translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_036e8962:

    # e "So... the village vote has finally ended, huh?"
    e "所以……村里的投票终于结束了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_e5bae165:

    # s "Yeah, roomie. It's been a long week."
    s "是啊，室友。这一周可真漫长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_bc5d2a88:

    # "Sebas stares at you with a curious look, as he taps on the front of the counter whimsically."
    "塞巴斯带着好奇的神情凝视着你，同时饶有兴致地轻敲着柜台正面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_6e4c4bd8:

    # e "But I'm sorry though, I know you were hoping for a different outcome."
    e "不过，还是很抱歉。我知道你原本希望结果能不一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_82a58b6d:

    # s "It's fine, [e]. I'm just... disappointed. I thought we could have a better future with the goats."
    s "没事，[e]。我只是……有点失望。我本以为我们能和山羊一起拥有更美好的未来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_c34a5004:

    # e "I'm glad the village is finally making a decision, I'm sure it's for the best."
    e "我很高兴村子终于要做出决定了。我相信这样是最好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_16b3bd80:

    # s "It's great! I'm sure our shop will be more lively with the goats around. I can't wait to see their wares."
    s "太棒了！我相信有山羊在，我们的店会热闹得多。我已经等不及要看看它们带来的货物了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_bd580643:

    # e "I'm sure it will be a great opportunity for both sides."
    e "我相信这会是对双方都很好的机会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_1d4fdb9f:

    # "Sebas smiles faintly. It's not his usual wide grin. You can tell he's still a bit shaken from the night in the wagon."
    "塞巴斯浅浅一笑，并不是他平时那种咧嘴大笑。你看得出来，马车里的那一夜仍让他有些心神不宁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Voting_Result_5615f346:

    # "But considering it is something he held dear to, you do not have the heart to ask him again."
    "但想到那是他珍视的事物，你实在不忍心再问他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_2a50e841:

    # e "Ole, what do you think about the votes?"
    e "奥利，你怎么看这次投票？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_47b41adc:

    # o "Hmm..."
    o "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_9c80a1e1:

    # o "I liked it. It's been a while since I've seen this many people in Lusterfield."
    o "我很喜欢。自从上次在流光镇见到这么多人，已经过了很久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_7132fa48:

    # o "That day, we worked quite hard to secure and count the votes, we were being cautious."
    o "那天我们费了不少力气保管并清点选票，整个过程都十分谨慎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_48a3ccb8:

    # o "And, it turns out, those few votes matter quite a lot in the grand scheme of things."
    o "结果证明，从全局来看，那几张选票还真是相当重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_9dea83f5:

    # o "Overall, I'm glad Lusterfield might have an ally on their backs, it helps see what's there to come."
    o "总的来说，我很高兴流光镇或许有了一个能为他们撑腰的盟友，这有助于看清接下来会发生什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_eb2841f0:

    # o "And with the shopkeeper tamed to the bone, I reckon our shop will thrive with the new alliance we have upon us."
    o "而且店老板已经被彻底驯服了，我估计在这场新联盟的助力下，咱们的店会兴旺起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_db03412b:

    # o "Even though there still lies a big problem with Gwyddyon. We will need to figure out something later."
    o "不过，格威迪恩那边仍然有个大问题。以后我们得想办法解决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_59b6b1ba:

    # o "It's so-so. I can't fault those who voted in favour of solitude, it is what most wanted."
    o "马马虎虎吧。我没法责怪那些投票支持独处的人，毕竟那是大多数人的愿望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_ae18ef43:

    # o "Albeit, Seb's not having the moment of his days right now."
    o "不过，塞布现在可不怎么好过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Result_5227e492:

    # o "It was kind of a waste to have negotiated with their shopkeeper. But at least we've got ourselves some cheap wares as well."
    o "和他们的店老板谈判，多少有点浪费时间。不过至少，我们也弄到了些便宜货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_8c27c077:

    # e "Lot..."
    e "洛特……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_5e83e3b3:

    # l "You coming to ask about the stupid vote?"
    l "你是来问那场蠢投票的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_7547f37f:

    # e "Uh... maybe?"
    e "呃……也许吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_97ec09e9:

    # l "I don't fucking care, if a horned scumbag comes up here, you better believe I'll run him down and teach him a lesson."
    l "我他妈才不在乎。要是哪个长角的混账敢跑到这儿来，你最好相信我会把他追上，给他点教训。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_cb530966:

    # e "Not including me... right?"
    e "不包括我……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_eb7e69fd:

    # e "Right?"
    e "对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_b1944051:

    # l "You better believe you've got dragon blood more than your goat blood, disciple. My fist doesn't recognise faces."
    l "你最好相信，你身上的龙血可比羊血多，徒弟。我的拳头可不认脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_937713fb:

    # l "Luckily the village came to their own common senses. Else we've got a big problem here."
    l "幸好村民们恢复了理智。不然这里可就麻烦大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_Result_03e828b2:

    # e "Okay... I'll keep that in mind."
    e "好吧……我会记住的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_d681ee1f:

    # e "How was the vote?"
    e "投票结果怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_0236dfe8:

    # a "Oh, puny friend."
    a "哦，弱小的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_fcf6af64:

    # a "Overall, I'm glad Lusterfield might have an ally on their backs, it helps see what's there to come."
    a "总的来说，我很高兴流光镇或许有了一个能为他们撑腰的盟友，这有助于看清接下来会发生什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_3ba4a437:

    # a "Now that the bridge has been restored, I'm seeing a lot of dry pants from here. Imagine the stink after walking over the river..."
    a "桥修好后，我从这里能看到好多条干爽的裤子。想想看，走过河之后那股臭味……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_00a9e33c:

    # e "Yeah, I'm glad we built one."
    e "是啊，我也很高兴我们修起了这座桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_05cb4c61:

    # a "But... I'm afraid for Lothar. And I have no idea where he went..."
    a "但是……我担心洛萨尔。我也完全不知道他去哪儿了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_bb012f73:

    # a "They planned to rebuild the bridge over the river crossing, think I might tell Jog to join soon 'nough."
    a "他们计划重建渡河处的桥，我想我也该很快告诉乔格来加入了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_25e8320b:

    # e "Oh, you are going to tag Jog along as well?"
    e "哦，你也打算把乔格叫来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_03dc4f5b:

    # a "Of course! The bridge is the most crucial part of the alliance, how would you ask everyone to trod through the river every time they travel between."
    a "当然！这座桥可是联盟最关键的一环，难道你要大家每次往返都趟过河吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_74b83226:

    # a "I had wanted to restore it myself, but now at least the goats are helping."
    a "我本来想亲自把它修好的，不过至少现在山羊们也在帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_2b6121ba:

    # a "The village is not going to ally with the goats, I'm not sure if it's the best choice. But it is what it is."
    a "村子不会和山羊结盟，我也不确定这是不是最好的选择。不过事已至此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_8f715cd4:

    # a "At least the bridge will be kept. We can safely travel between the two forests without having to worry about the river."
    a "至少这座桥能保住。这样我们就能安全往返于两片森林之间，不必再担心那条河了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Result_1bf9a090:

    # e "I'm glad you're seeing the bright side of things."
    e "我很高兴你能看到事情好的一面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_b3ca0cdc:

    # e "Jog, how do you feel about the vote?"
    e "乔格，你对这次投票有什么看法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_2658e9e5:

    # j "Vote, vote, vote. Always talking about the vote. It's long past midnight my brother."
    j "投票，投票，还是投票。老是在谈投票。兄弟，现在早就过了午夜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_6cf673a5:

    # e "Yeah, but what's your opinion?"
    e "是啊，但你的看法呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_c9322027:

    # j "My opinion is this vote sucked, now that the goats reinforced their huntsmen I can feel them everywhere."
    j "我的看法就是这次投票糟透了。山羊加强了猎手的力量后，我到处都能感受到他们的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_20120581:

    # j "Can't even climb a tree now, so boring."
    j "现在连树都爬不了了，真无聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_827f6c5c:

    # j "Eh. Business as usual, I wouldn't have expected otherwise."
    j "呃，还是老样子，我本来也没指望会有别的结果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_30b93616:

    # e "What about your vote? Did you vote for the alliance as well?"
    e "那你投的是什么？你也投了赞成联盟吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_c369bd97:

    # j "Of course I did, and it's all for you. Can't say if I regretted that but Lothar is coming for my ass right now."
    j "当然，我全都是为了你。至于我有没有后悔，还真不好说，不过洛萨尔现在正要来找我算账。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_93b9d906:

    # e "Uhm, surely not. I don't know where he's gone but if he intended to come for your ass he'd do it on the spot, no?"
    e "呃，肯定不是。我不知道他去哪儿了，但如果他真打算来找你麻烦，早就当场动手了，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_1484bd82:

    # e "I don't believe that, Lothar doesn't seem that angry at you, there's no alliance now."
    e "我不信。洛萨尔看起来没那么生你的气，而且现在已经没有联盟了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Voting_Result_b5a27780:

    # j "Maybe. Maybe."
    j "也许吧。也许。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_826fa826:

    # e "Cane, what exactly should I do with the ghost again?"
    e "凯恩，我到底该拿那个鬼魂怎么办来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_eaa4c696:

    # c "Eh? What'cha wanna know, that rat?"
    c "嗯？你想知道什么，那只老鼠？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_af0dd4dd:

    # c "Ya gotta find him in the afternoon, get some information out of 'em. We oughta know if that pesky ghost exists or not."
    c "你得在下午找到他，从他嘴里问出些消息来。我们得知道那只烦人的鬼魂到底存不存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_dfcdee8a:

    # e "Got it!"
    e "明白了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_5147e3eb:

    # e "I've met that patron, but he doesn't seem to want to talk with me..."
    e "我见过那位委托人，可他好像不想和我说话……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_c7f061aa:

    # c "Ah, lad. Ya know what I've learnt after serving beers to those scums like that rat, ya never talk soft with 'em, ya gotta scare them at first and show 'em their place, just like how I taught ya."
    c "啊，小子。给那些像那只老鼠一样的混账端啤酒时，我学到了一件事：跟他们说话可不能客客气气的，得先吓住他们，再让他们认清自己的位置，就像我教你的那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_1e911bb0:

    # "Cane glances at you again, then smiles."
    "凯恩又瞥了你一眼，然后笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_0cf7f67f:

    # c "Fine, maybe yer not the type to scare 'em off like that, but... it'd be a nice try at least."
    c "好吧，也许你不是那种能像这样把他们吓跑的人，不过……至少试试看也不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_63d62aa2:

    # c "Do what yer good at, okay lad?"
    c "做你擅长的事，行吗，小子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Ask_Rat_Patron_2f40e150:

    # "The tavernkeeper grins."
    "酒馆老板咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_2194ab8f:

    # "A pungent, rotten smell hits you as you wander the tavern. Within moments, you spot its source — a scruffy rat-like patron huddled in a far corner."
    "你在酒馆里闲逛时，一股刺鼻的腐臭味扑面而来。没过多久，你便发现了臭味的源头——一个邋遢的老鼠模样的客人，正蜷缩在远处的角落里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_ca95b42c:

    # e "Hey."
    e "嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_2ebedc5d:

    # "The rat barely glances up. With a dismissive snort, he turns back to his beer."
    "老鼠几乎没抬眼看你，只是轻蔑地哼了一声，便转回去继续喝他的啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_9362580f:

    # e "Excuse me, are you listening?"
    e "打扰一下，你在听吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_b684833e:

    # "The rat narrows his eyes and starts edging toward the door."
    "老鼠眯起眼睛，开始一点点朝门口挪去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_4a7c8c63:

    # e "Hey! I'm talking to you!"
    e "喂！我在跟你说话呢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_cc6df0f8:

    # "You grab his arm firmly. In an instant, every eye in the room is fixed on you as you clutch his matted fur."
    "你牢牢抓住他的手臂。转眼间，房间里所有人的目光都落在了你身上，而你的手正紧攥着他那团打结的皮毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_bdaf957c:

    # "After a brief struggle, the rat finally looks you in the eye, a mix of anger and resignation on his face."
    "经过一番短暂的挣扎，老鼠终于抬眼直视你，脸上交织着愤怒与无奈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_5b792a47:

    # rat_patron "Let go of me!"
    rat_patron "放开我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_4d2b00b7:

    # e "Not until you stop going away!"
    e "等你不再离开了再说！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_f62a4b03:

    # "You quickly sidestep the gust, though the rat's agitation remains evident."
    "你迅速侧身避开那阵风，但那只老鼠的躁动依旧显而易见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_b3936df3:

    # rat_patron "You were that annoying scumbag the other day, what do you want?"
    rat_patron "你就是前几天那个烦人的混账，你想干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_6befb8a9:

    # rat_patron "You again? Did I not tell you to leave me alone enough?"
    rat_patron "又是你？我不是已经叫你别来烦我了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_15197ef3:

    # e "I still need to talk to you."
    e "我还是得跟你谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_1f773f5d:

    # "The rat shakes his head, then stands up and gestures you to follow him."
    "老鼠摇了摇头，随后站起身，示意你跟上他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_26f68ed1:

    # "You follow him outside, where he leans against the tavern wall."
    "你跟着他来到外面，他倚在酒馆的墙上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_90adba05:

    # rat_patron "What do you want?" nointeract
    rat_patron "你想干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_65e6ef31:

    # e "Look, I'm not here to cause trouble. I just want to know more about you."
    e "听着，我不是来找麻烦的。我只是想多了解你一些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_e41d501b:

    # rat_patron "I'm not interested."
    rat_patron "我没兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_a8821223:

    # e "I heard about your story about the ghost, right? I'm just curious."
    e "我听说过你讲的那个鬼故事，对吧？我只是好奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_72fe265c:

    # rat_patron "I don't care, and I know you're here not just for your own curiosity."
    rat_patron "我不在乎，而且我知道你来这儿不只是出于好奇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Continue_Grab_7ea85b8d:

    # "You manage to evade a swing aimed your way, though the rat still struggles."
    "你设法躲开了朝你挥来的攻击，不过那只鼠人仍在挣扎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Continue_Grab_72b9c78e:

    # "You deftly sidestep the blow, drawing a mix of cheers and boos from nearby onlookers."
    "你灵巧地侧身避开这一击，引得附近围观者有的欢呼，有的喝倒彩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Fail_9cc538a2:

    # "Cursing under his breath, the rat scrambles off into the shadows of the tavern, leaving you empty-handed."
    "那只鼠人低声咒骂着，跌跌撞撞地钻进酒馆的阴影里，留得你两手空空。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Fail_1cb68bc1:

    # "You glance around, the rat is now nowhere to be seen. You have to hope he would come back, or you'd have to deliever the bad news to Cane."
    "你环顾四周，那只鼠人已经不见踪影。你只能希望他会回来，否则就得把这个坏消息告诉凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Fail2_862616a2:

    # "A wild punch sends you reeling for a moment, and in the confusion the rat escapes amid mocking laughter."
    "你胡乱挥出的一拳让自己踉跄了片刻，混乱之中，那只鼠人在嘲笑声中逃走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Fail2_1cb68bc1:

    # "You glance around, the rat is now nowhere to be seen. You have to hope he would come back, or you'd have to deliever the bad news to Cane."
    "你环顾四周，那只鼠人已经不见踪影。你只能希望他会回来，否则就得把这个坏消息告诉凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_4335637b:

    # "After a tense few seconds, the rat calms down and gestures for you to follow him outside."
    "紧张的几秒过后，那只鼠人平静下来，示意你跟他到外面去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_cb807a8d:

    # rat_patron "Alright, I guess I can't shake you off."
    rat_patron "好吧，我想我是甩不掉你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_0a5dafca:

    # "His grip suddenly tightens as he pulls you out of the tavern."
    "他拉着你走出酒馆时，手上的力道突然收紧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_296374cc:

    # "Outside, near the Nocturnal Trunk, you find him waiting. His ragged clothes and the bruises beneath his eyes tell their own story."
    "你在外面、夜夜椿附近找到了等候着的他。他破烂的衣服和眼睛下方的瘀青，已经说明了一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_ae0a8336:

    # e "I finally caught you. Why are you always running, anyway?"
    e "我总算抓到你了。话说，你为什么老是跑？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_1856db4f:

    # rat_patron "I thought you were with the loan shark—those bandits swiped everything I had. They're trying to keep me in line."
    rat_patron "我还以为你和放高利贷的那帮人是一伙的——那些强盗把我所有东西都抢走了。他们想让我老实点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_abeaed42:

    # rat_patron "And you're the new server, aren't you?"
    rat_patron "你就是新来的服务员，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_3e42958f:

    # rat_patron "Hadn't been back here for a while, I didn't even realise this place has a new server until some loud assholes over the tables talked about some goat with an apron."
    rat_patron "我有段时间没回这儿了，直到邻桌几个吵个没完的混蛋谈起一个系着围裙的山羊，我才知道这里来了个新服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_47fa36b0:

    # e "I'm a dragon."
    e "我是龙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_da1c0753:

    # "He gives you a wary sidelong glance."
    "他警惕地斜睨了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_c48a3460:

    # rat_patron "So, why are you after me? I already spilled everything to Cane."
    rat_patron "那你为什么还追着我不放？我已经把一切都告诉凯恩了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_aa0335ee:

    # e "I'm not here to stir up trouble. Cane mentioned you saw… something. A ghost, or so I hear?"
    e "我不是来惹麻烦的。凯恩说你看见了……什么东西。听说是个鬼魂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_ce3bfc0f:

    # "At your words, a flicker of worry crosses the rat's face."
    "听到你的话，那只鼠人的脸上掠过一丝担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_4ec402c9:

    # rat_patron "Look, I'm not making this up. There's a ghost in that cursed tavern."
    rat_patron "听着，我没编瞎话。那间受诅咒的酒馆里有个鬼魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_1e56eafa:

    # e "Really? Where did you see it?"
    e "真的？你在哪里看见它的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_784d0b42:

    # rat_patron "I… haven't seen it since that night."
    rat_patron "我……自那晚之后就没再见过它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_b2dfc9a5:

    # "He sighs and runs a rough hand over his head."
    "他叹了口气，用粗糙的手掌抚过头顶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_2283dfea:

    # rat_patron "Look at this."
    rat_patron "看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_b439150d:

    # "He lifts his hand, and you see a small burn mark on the pads of his palm."
    "他抬起手，你看到他掌心指垫上有一道小小的烧伤痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_5847f666:

    # e "That mark came from the ghost?"
    e "那道痕迹是幽灵留下的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_16883002:

    # rat_patron "Yeah. It was like a shadow with burning red eyes... But that's all I got."
    rat_patron "嗯。它就像一道长着燃烧般红眼睛的影子……但我就只知道这些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_70620787:

    # "You lean closer, softening your tone."
    "你靠近一些，语气也柔和下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_746ea4f3:

    # e "That sounds awful. I can't imagine how shaken you must've been."
    e "听起来太糟了。我无法想象你当时得有多么惊慌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_79ce9b18:

    # rat_patron "Why do you even care? You're just another busy fool."
    rat_patron "你干吗这么在意？你不过是个瞎忙活的蠢货罢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_14ad9b5e:

    # e "I'm trying to help — this doesn't look like a normal burn mark, what if something'd happen to it?"
    e "我只是想帮忙——这看起来不像普通的烧伤痕迹，要是它出了什么问题怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Fight_b7e981e0:

    # rat_patron "That's my problem... not yours."
    rat_patron "那是我的问题……不是你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_0119106a:

    # "The rat's eyes narrow, and he shifts uncomfortably."
    "老鼠眯起眼睛，不自在地挪动了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_8bccdf77:

    # rat_patron "Now drop the act and tell me why you are here in the first place." nointeract
    rat_patron "别装了，告诉我你来这里到底是为了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_611ea068:

    # e "I need to get to the bottom of this for Cane's sake. This ghost rumor's damaging his tavern's reputation."
    e "我得替凯恩查清这件事。这些关于幽灵的传闻正在损害他那家酒馆的名声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_72e65160:

    # rat_patron "Help Cane? You really must be one of those goody-two-shoes. Good for you."
    rat_patron "帮凯恩？你肯定是那种老好人。真有你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_8a22f41b:

    # rat_patron "But, no. I don't want any part of that old keeper's problems."
    rat_patron "不过，算了。我不想掺和那个老掌柜的麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_c7deb5b0:

    # e "Why? Do you have a history with the tavern?"
    e "为什么？你和那家酒馆有过什么渊源吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_78886f58:

    # rat_patron "No, look. I'm just coming back for a few days until that vote begins. And I honestly don't care if I leave the village with this little tavern burning down."
    rat_patron "不，听我说。我只是会在投票开始前回来待几天而已。而且说实话，就算我离开村子时把这间小酒馆留在那里烧毁，我也一点不在乎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_37339528:

    # rat_patron "I am just saying. It's so obvious I'm not gonna be the one burning it down, if it ever does... I'm not saying it's gonna burn down."
    rat_patron "我只是这么说。很明显，就算它真的烧起来了，也不会是我放的火……我没说它会烧毁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_c4f7294a:

    # e "Honestly, I just can't stand thinking about a ghost lurking around. I need to know for my own peace of mind."
    e "说实话，一想到有幽灵在附近游荡我就受不了。我得弄清楚，才能安心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_e31ab087:

    # rat_patron "Maybe try quitting the job, it doesn't sound like you work around here all the time."
    rat_patron "不如试试辞掉这份工作吧，听起来你也不是一直在这里干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_5dd18e56:

    # e "Why run when you can easily fix the problem. Your advice's not always the solution I'm afraid."
    e "既然你能轻易解决问题，干吗要逃？恐怕你的建议并不总是解决之道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_08d1ca2b:

    # "The rat's gaze darkens. His voice drops to a hushed murmur."
    "老鼠的目光变得阴沉，声音也压低成了喃喃低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_152d3b9a:

    # rat_patron "I pity your ignorance, server."
    rat_patron "我真替你的无知感到可悲，服务生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_e13d0233:

    # e "Look, I'd just like to hear the full story if you're willing."
    e "听着，如果你愿意，我只是想听完整的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_2ae7a2c3:

    # rat_patron "Why do you think I'm just telling you everything because you are interested?"
    rat_patron "你凭什么觉得，我会因为你感兴趣，就把一切都告诉你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_9a3b1a5b:

    # e "I'm sure you'll find the heart to just tell a little server about your story."
    e "我相信你总会发发善心，把你的故事告诉一个小小的服务生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_55ee6537:

    # rat_patron "Alright, alright..."
    rat_patron "好吧，好吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_557049c5:

    # rat_patron "I just happened to feel generous today. Don't need to say your piece."
    rat_patron "我今天只是碰巧大方了点。你不用再讲你的那套了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_cfbcecde:

    # "The rat looks up and down, before shaking his head."
    "那只老鼠上下打量了一番，然后摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_7629546d:

    # rat_patron "Nah."
    rat_patron "才不是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_339849fb:

    # e "I don't know. Empathy?"
    e "我不知道。同理心？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_7ee933cc:

    # rat_patron "What?"
    rat_patron "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Empathise_342f05a4:

    # rat_patron "You are a funny goat, saying funny words like anyone's gonna understand."
    rat_patron "你这山羊真有意思，说些怪词儿，好像谁都能听懂似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_2bf3de42:

    # e "Alright, now stop beating around the bush — just tell me everything without the runaround!"
    e "好了，别再拐弯抹角了——痛痛快快把一切都告诉我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_4ddb5a4d:

    # rat_patron "Hey, chill out! I told you what I saw."
    rat_patron "嘿，冷静点！我已经把我看到的告诉你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_1ba2489e:

    # e "You're hiding something, isn't it. That's why you're dodging my question."
    e "你在隐瞒什么，对吧？所以才一直回避我的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_9da00ef4:

    # rat_patron "Okay, so? Can't a rat keep some of his secrets? I have no duty to tell you anything, server."
    rat_patron "哦，是吗？老鼠就不能保留一点自己的秘密吗？我没义务告诉你任何事，服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_879d0ded:

    # e "Maybe you can't. What if I told the bandits that one of their precious debtor's actually have the gold to drink beer."
    e "也许你不能。要是我把这事告诉那些强盗，说他们宝贝似的债务人之一其实有钱喝啤酒呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_c5cfe687:

    # "You whisper with a devious smile."
    "你带着狡黠的笑容低声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_6649b9d5:

    # rat_patron "You don't dare. You are just a server here."
    rat_patron "你不敢。你不过是个服务员罢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_526c7eb2:

    # e "It's really easy to have rumors spread all over the village, even out of it. I don't even have to do it myself."
    e "让流言传遍整个村子，甚至传到村外，可是件轻而易举的事。我甚至不必亲自去做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_41e61564:

    # rat_patron "Then do it."
    rat_patron "那你就去做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_68c57803:

    # rat_patron "Do it."
    rat_patron "去做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_3a9929f8:

    # rat_patron "That's what I thought, you don't have legs to stand, server. I've been in this for too long to see who's not made out of it."
    rat_patron "我就知道，你没胆子站出来，服务员。我在这行混太久了，一眼就能看出谁成不了事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_924104da:

    # rat_patron "Fine. Fine. I get it. I'll tell you whatever you want. Just leave those bandits out of it."
    rat_patron "好吧，好吧。我明白了。你想知道什么我都告诉你。只是别把那些强盗扯进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_ef4cfd19:

    # e "That's more like it."
    e "这才像话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_88683d59:

    # e "I'm not playing around. I need every detail right now!"
    e "我没在跟你闹着玩。我现在就要知道每一个细节！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_5c4990a5:

    # "You lean in closer, your voice low and urgent. But the rat doesn't even faze."
    "你凑得更近了些，声音低沉而急切。但那只老鼠却丝毫不为所动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_da3a62fb:

    # rat_patron "You know what? That's it. I'm done. I already told you what I remember. You're just not worth my time."
    rat_patron "你知道吗？够了，就这样吧。我已经说了我记得的一切。你根本不值得我浪费时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_0c153abb:

    # e "Fine. Keep your secret."
    e "好吧。那就守着你的秘密吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_5013d429:

    # rat_patron "Okay."
    rat_patron "好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_952f47df:

    # "The rat looks at you with an amused smirk."
    "老鼠带着戏谑的笑意看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_907e6d73:

    # rat_patron "You looked foolish when you tried to push me around, regardless of its success, it was certainly an attempt."
    rat_patron "你想摆布我时的样子可真蠢。不管你有没有成功，至少确实算是尝试过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_9aee0e71:

    # e "I'm trying to make you talk."
    e "我是在想办法让你开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_c2e21c35:

    # rat_patron "How are you trying to make me talk, server. That's like the most pathetic attempt, if it ever was one."
    rat_patron "你想怎么让我开口，侍者？那要真算得上一次尝试，也未免太可悲了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_10559704:

    # e "Are you trying to make a fool of me?"
    e "你想让我出丑吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_b6eeeabd:

    # rat_patron "No, I just find you interesting, that's all."
    rat_patron "不，我只是觉得你很有意思，仅此而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_3ec7df06:

    # rat_patron "I need something... more material, before I can tell you anything substantial." nointeract
    rat_patron "在我告诉你任何有分量的东西之前，我需要……更实在的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_4025d89e:

    # e "Look, I'll pay you. How much do you want?"
    e "听着，我会付钱给你。你想要多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_18277a0c:

    # rat_patron "2000 gold, that's what I owed to the shark."
    rat_patron "两千枚金币，那是我欠鲨鱼的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_c2f717d9:

    # e "T-that's a lot!"
    e "这、这也太多了吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_b3c3d1c4:

    # rat_patron "Well, you're not exactly like the other assholes, I'll spare you half of it."
    rat_patron "好吧，你和其他那些混蛋不太一样，我就只收你一半。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_4bf036f8:

    # rat_patron "1000 gold."
    rat_patron "一千枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_703bc7e3:

    # e "Well, how about this, you get some time to do with me anything you want."
    e "那这样如何？我给你点时间，想对我做什么都随你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_916c5839:

    # rat_patron "Is this an invitation or..."
    rat_patron "这是邀请，还是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_ec2ffa96:

    # e "A deal."
    e "一桩交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_46c92181:

    # rat_patron "Okay. Good. As long as you perform as good as I've heard."
    rat_patron "好。只要你的表现和我听说的一样好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_9a88b676:

    # "Despite the rat's dismay, you shake your head."
    "尽管那只老鼠颇为失望，你还是摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_02856acd:

    # e "Hmmph... I don't know? I can't offer anything worthwhile for you."
    e "哼……我不知道？我没什么值得给你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_94db6a9e:

    # rat_patron "I'd have thought you've got my hint. Fine, I'm interested in getting an hour with you, it's not that hard to understand, right?" nointeract
    rat_patron "我还以为你已经听懂我的暗示了。好吧，我想和你共度一小时，这很难理解吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_e7c78753:

    # e "Fine, the information's better be very helpful."
    e "好吧，这些情报最好非常有用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_484d8e0f:

    # e "No. I'm afraid."
    e "不，我害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_e5fe42d2:

    # rat_patron "Disappointing. Then you've got nothing useful for me then."
    rat_patron "真令人失望。那看来你什么有用的东西都给不了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Push_2c91c103:

    # rat_patron "I'm going."
    rat_patron "我走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_22994abe:

    # e "Fine, here it is."
    e "好吧，给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_0e647e96:

    # "You pull out your bag, handing him the gold as he grins."
    "你掏出袋子，在他咧嘴笑着时把金币递给他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_c6de8364:

    # rat_patron "Thank you."
    rat_patron "谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_8d3db9b3:

    # e "Now, the promised secret."
    e "现在，说好的秘密呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_fea9644b:

    # "You don't have enough gold."
    "你的金币不够。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_87b6c175:

    # e "Well, I don't have that much gold."
    e "呃，我没那么多金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_5b582bae:

    # e "How about the other option..."
    e "另一个选项怎么样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_eb83f82e:

    # e "I'll do whatever you want."
    e "你想让我做什么，我都愿意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_4899ea12:

    # rat_patron "Whatever... I want?"
    rat_patron "随便……我想让你做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_87b6c175_1:

    # e "Well, I don't have that much gold."
    e "呃，我没那么多金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_085f7e57:

    # rat_patron "That's a shame."
    rat_patron "真遗憾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Concede_Push_Menu_a6cfa1ef:

    # rat_patron "I'll be here next time, if you have the gold."
    rat_patron "如果你带够金币，下次我还会在这里等你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_5c6aa62d:

    # e "Yes, I kind of get what you meant when you said that, but now will you not ogle at me like I'm some piece of fine meat."
    e "是的，你这么说的时候我多少明白你的意思了，但现在能不能别再像打量一块上等肉似的盯着我看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_2c98d294:

    # rat_patron "Oh, you are. I mean, look at you."
    rat_patron "哦，你就是啊。我的意思是，看看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_13c31a22:

    # e "Mhmm, so... what do you want me to do."
    e "嗯……所以，你想让我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_2882e3bc:

    # rat_patron "Hey, don't worry. It'll be very quick, server, or I will make it very quick."
    rat_patron "嘿，别担心。很快就结束，服务员，否则我会让它很快结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_c9e321d7:

    # rat_patron "Come."
    rat_patron "来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_ab6b435a:

    # "You follow the rat as he walks around Lusterfield."
    "你跟着那只老鼠，在卢斯特菲尔德里四处走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_867c6c6c:

    # rat_patron "So, a private show, huh? I didn't know nowadays a server had to do that as well. That's what I heard, anyway."
    rat_patron "哦，私人表演是吧？我不知道现在连服务员也得做这个。反正我是这么听说的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_016c7905:

    # e "The customers happened to like it when I served the tavern, so they asked Cane about that."
    e "我在酒馆当服务员时，客人碰巧很喜欢，所以他们就去找凯恩谈了这事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_07de9732:

    # rat_patron "I see. So, that barkeep's a pimp as well?"
    rat_patron "我明白了。所以，那个酒馆老板也是皮条客？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_05db7af2:

    # e "I wouldn't call him that... he doesn't even get any gold from the show."
    e "我不会这么称呼他……他甚至都没从表演里拿到金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_f043eca5:

    # rat_patron "So, you work in the tavern. How's the job. Did the keeper overwork you to the last bit."
    rat_patron "所以，你在酒馆工作。工作怎么样？老板有没有把你压榨到最后一丝力气？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_a946459c:

    # e "What? He'd never."
    e "什么？他绝不会那样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_69acb2d3:

    # rat_patron "Just a question. I figured he'd do that."
    rat_patron "只是问问。我还以为他会那么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_60feacac:

    # e "I am just here to work once in a while, relieving Cane of some duty, not a full-time server here."
    e "我只是偶尔来这里工作，替凯恩分担一些活儿，并不是这里的全职服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_b35b29ec:

    # "He shoots you back with a knowing glance."
    "他回了你一个心照不宣的眼神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_bc7f0245:

    # rat_patron "Oh, and I heard about the apron. It fits you snuggily, doesn't it."
    rat_patron "哦，对了，我听说了那件围裙。穿在你身上很合身，对吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_8271f162:

    # e "Yeah, that's the former server's. Cane gave it to me."
    e "嗯，那是之前那位侍者的。凯恩把它给我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_bdba3670:

    # rat_patron "Mhmm... good. Keep it clean then."
    rat_patron "嗯……很好。那就保持干净。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_a7eb3148:

    # rat_patron "Here. No one's going to see us."
    rat_patron "来这儿。没人会看到我们的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_332e92e5:

    # "The rat pulls you into a dark alleyway, away from the tavern's prying eyes."
    "老鼠把你拉进一条昏暗的小巷，避开酒馆里那些窥探的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_c4e65079:

    # e "You know, I can probably take you to one of Cane's room."
    e "你知道的，我大概可以带你去凯恩的一个房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_04c66dae:

    # "You glance around, slightly confused as to why the rat wanted it this way."
    "你环顾四周，有些不解，不明白老鼠为什么要这么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_ef658dc4:

    # rat_patron "No, I want it right here, in this dingy alley."
    rat_patron "不，我就想在这里——这条破旧的小巷里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_68201962:

    # rat_patron "I want to see your face when I give you something no one else can."
    rat_patron "我想看看，当我给你一件别人都无法给你的东西时，你会露出什么表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_c331ecd5:

    # "You nod, still a bit confused but willing to do what the rat wants."
    "你点了点头，仍有些困惑，但愿意照老鼠的意思做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_31da5c57:

    # rat_patron "Come on, I won't bite. And I'll tell you all about the ghost after."
    rat_patron "来吧，我又不会咬你。之后我会把那个鬼魂的事全告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_dedc60c5:

    # "The rat whispers, taking a seat on the cobblestone ground."
    "老鼠低声说着，在石板路上坐了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_69fdf7e7:

    # "He chuckles and starts walking towards the exit of the alley, leaving you to catch your breath and straighten your clothes. "
    "他轻笑一声，开始朝小巷出口走去，留下你喘息并整理衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Personal_Service_017dc87d:

    # "Once you're able to move again, you follow after him, thinking about just what kind of information he has to offer."
    "等你终于又能行动后，便跟在他身后，思索着他究竟能提供什么样的消息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_7045a038:

    # e "So what else did you see that night?"
    e "那么，那天晚上你还看到了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_009bf0bc:

    # "The rat patron glances around warily, leaning his back against the stone wall."
    "鼠老板警惕地环顾四周，背靠在石墙上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_f5fc5020:

    # rat_patron "I saw that odd creature when the sun's almost out — around, I guess, five or six in the morning."
    rat_patron "太阳快出来的时候我看到了那个古怪的生物——大概是早上五六点吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_120519a4:

    # e "What were you doing there, anyway?"
    e "你刚才在那里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_1274fea4:

    # "You ask hurriedly, meeting a strange, almost guilty look in his eyes."
    "你急忙问道，正对上他眼中那抹奇怪、几乎带着歉意的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_cc752a8e:

    # e "What do you mean — huh?"
    e "你这是什么意思——啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_dea6dce3:

    # rat_patron "I was just... looking around. I slipped up to the counter when the keeper was in the other room. And that's when I saw it."
    rat_patron "我只是……随便看看。我趁店主在另一个房间时，偷偷溜到柜台那边。然后我就看到了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_3a94dbef:

    # rat_patron "Right there, by the fire — this ghost, kneeling as if it were studying the flames. It looked like a shadow, but with these burning red eyes that pierced through the darkness."
    rat_patron "就在火堆旁边——那个鬼魂跪在那里，仿佛正在研究火焰。它看起来像一道影子，却有着燃烧般的红色眼睛，刺穿了黑暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_72560194:

    # e "Do ghosts in this world even have wings? I thought they just floated around like the one I was used to."
    e "这个世界的鬼魂都有翅膀吗？我以为它们只会像我以前见过的那个一样飘来飘去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_1c939132:

    # rat_patron "Nah, not always. This one... its wings fluttered so fast it almost lifted him off the ground when he caught sight of me."
    rat_patron "不，也不总是。这一个……它的翅膀扇动得太快了，看到我时，差点把他从地面上托起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_68ee7b40:

    # rat_patron "I bolted before he could reach me. But then I tripped into the side of a chair. I tried to grab something on the counter but my hand got caught in the fire."
    rat_patron "我在他追上我之前就拔腿跑了。可后来我一头撞上了椅子侧面。我想抓住柜台上的什么东西，手却被火焰缠住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_55d63aac:

    # e "The tavern's always full of people, surely someone else would have seen it, right?"
    e "酒馆里总是挤满了人，肯定还有别人看见了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_6fe42831:

    # rat_patron "No, only another group of folks stayed late enough at that time, they all said they didn't see it, even as that bright glow's clear as day."
    rat_patron "不，当时只有另一拨人留到了那么晚。他们都说没看见，就算那道明亮的光芒清晰得如同白昼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_17ddf619:

    # rat_patron "When it fled, I even heard a soft rustling, like the turning of old pages."
    rat_patron "它逃走时，我甚至听见了一阵轻柔的沙沙声，像翻动旧书页。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_2b93b3f1:

    # rat_patron "But the folks all said they heard nothing at all, only my shout all over the tavern."
    rat_patron "可那些人都说什么也没听见，只有我的喊声传遍了整个酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_7b1bbd96:

    # e "Look, if the ghost escaped, I can't think of a way no one saw the glow that you're talking about."
    e "听着，如果那鬼魂逃走了，我实在想不出为什么会没人看见你说的那道光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_eb9cf9ed:

    # rat_patron "Not my fault half the tavern are blind in the night. These folks all gathered to eat bread or something, it's like I was the only one drunk in the taven..."
    rat_patron "酒馆里一半的人一到晚上就跟瞎了似的，又不是我的错。这些人全都聚在一起吃面包什么的，搞得好像整个酒馆里只有我一个醉鬼似的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_4f334111:

    # rat_patron "And you bet I can see better than any one of them."
    rat_patron "那当然，我看得可比他们任何一个都清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_4907f223:

    # e "I can't help but wonder — you were at the counter for a reason. Were you... trying to take something?"
    e "我不免有些好奇——你当时在柜台那儿总有原因吧。你是……想拿走什么东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_f6d49591:

    # "The rat shifts uncomfortably, his ears twitching as he glances away."
    "老鼠不自在地挪动着，耳朵抽动了一下，同时别开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_55ab9899:

    # rat_patron "Alright, alright... I'll be straight with you. I was there to snag a bit of stew. I know it sounds bad, but the keeper wasn't there, and I was just a bit hungry."
    rat_patron "好了，好了……我老实告诉你吧。我当时是想顺手拿点炖菜。我知道这听起来不太好，可那时店主不在，而我只是有点饿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_94706e07:

    # e "So you were stealing from the stew?"
    e "所以你是想偷炖菜？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_b5b07c04:

    # rat_patron "I was about to. But in that moment, when I was sneaking a bowl, I saw the ghost. So I technically didn't steal anything."
    rat_patron "我本来是想偷的。可就在我偷偷拿碗的时候，我看见了鬼魂。所以严格来说，我什么也没偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_9016759b:

    # e "Is this why you didn't want to talk about it with Cane?"
    e "这就是你不想和凯恩谈这件事的原因吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_cd7c62f8:

    # rat_patron "Yes, but not entirely."
    rat_patron "是，但也不完全是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_e30cd64f:

    # e "After you ran, did you see where it went?"
    e "你逃跑之后，有没有看见它去了哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_e4c20415:

    # "The rat squints, as if recalling a half-forgotten detail."
    "老鼠眯起眼睛，仿佛在回忆一个几乎被遗忘的细节。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_4b38aa58:

    # rat_patron "I... I noticed a faint, lingering glow disappearing into the shadows. I just can't see clearly, I was already slumping on the ground when it escaped."
    rat_patron "我……我注意到一道微弱的余光消失在阴影中。只是我看不清楚，它逃走时我已经瘫倒在地上了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_72724ba6:

    # e "So you didn't see it?"
    e "所以你没看见它？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_64c7ea5b:

    # rat_patron "He didn't get to the seating area, so he either escaped from my eyes, or..."
    rat_patron "它没走到座位区，所以要么是从我眼皮底下逃掉了，要么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_fb914f23:

    # rat_patron "He ran downstairs."
    rat_patron "他跑到楼下去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_46f2d357:

    # e "That means he's still within the tavern...?"
    e "这意味着他还在酒馆里……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_22a1cc57:

    # rat_patron "Keep this between us, but if it went into that storage room, the keeper would have seen it."
    rat_patron "这事就你我之间知道吧，不过如果它进了那间储藏室，店主肯定会看见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_77740c06:

    # e "I hadn't been downstairs yet, but is it possible that Cane just didn't happen to bump into the ghost?"
    e "我之前还没下楼，但有没有可能凯恩只是碰巧没撞上那鬼魂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_bfe6d899:

    # rat_patron "I don't think so. He came right up with a keg of ale right as the ghost escapes, and the keeper acted like nothing happened."
    rat_patron "我觉得不是。鬼魂逃走的时候，他正好提着一桶麦酒上来，而店主却装得像什么都没发生过一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_33cbbb85:

    # e "So... what's your theory?"
    e "所以……你是怎么想的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_4d2c37fa:

    # rat_patron "I don't know, maybe the keeper knew about the ghost, maybe he was the ghost all along."
    rat_patron "我不知道，也许酒馆老板知道那个鬼魂的事，也许他从头到尾就是那个鬼魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_b933a8d5:

    # e "You're sounding like a lunatic now, I know Cane, he's just not some kind of ghost, even if you believe he's a ghost, why did you come back?"
    e "你现在听起来就像个疯子。我认识凯恩，他不是什么鬼魂。就算你觉得他是鬼魂，你为什么还要回来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_062a25ca:

    # rat_patron "I'm just bored, I wanted to see if he's an actual ghost!"
    rat_patron "我就是觉得无聊，想看看他到底是不是鬼魂！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_a7c68cbc:

    # e "So, let me piece this together: That odd, ghostly figure appeared around six in the morning, by the fire."
    e "那么，让我捋一捋：那个古怪的幽灵身影在早上六点左右出现在火堆旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_f3ff9f0b:

    # e "Its wings glowed and it had those burning eyes. And, whether it was fleeing from you or—"
    e "它的翅膀发着光，还有那双燃烧般的眼睛。而且，不管它是在逃离你，还是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_cc20978f:

    # "You pause as the rat interjects."
    "你停了下来，鼠族客人插话道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_fb5f2b07:

    # rat_patron "Yeah, well... I might've been a bit mixed up about everything. But one thing's for sure - it escaped right as it saw me."
    rat_patron "嗯，好吧……我可能把这一切搞得有点混乱。但有一点可以肯定——它一看到我就逃走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_fcf3e21a:

    # e "To the storage room inside the tavern, huh? That might be your only lead."
    e "是酒馆里面的储藏室，对吧？那可能是你唯一的线索了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_a0d3f67a:

    # rat_patron "Exactly. Look, I know I don't make the best company and maybe I tried to sate my hunger. But believe me, something moved in those shadows, and it slipped away through a hidden door."
    rat_patron "没错。听着，我知道自己不是什么好相处的人，也许我当时只是想填饱肚子。但相信我，那些阴影里确实有什么东西动了动，然后从一道暗门溜走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_fcf3e21a_1:

    # e "To the storage room inside the tavern, huh? That might be your only lead."
    e "是酒馆里面的储藏室，对吧？那可能是你唯一的线索了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_b6d51177:

    # rat_patron "Yeah, I know. But you oughta make use of that lead."
    rat_patron "嗯，我知道。但你应该好好利用这条线索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_ce522ff7:

    # e "So, neither the keeper nor the other patrons saw the ghost? And you were... drunk with beer?"
    e "所以，酒馆老板和其他客人都没看到那个鬼魂？而你当时……是喝啤酒喝醉了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_6b9b9cf1:

    # rat_patron "I don't like the implication you're hinting at, I saw it with my eyes, and I knew what I saw.."
    rat_patron "我不喜欢你话里的暗示。我亲眼看到了，也知道自己看到了什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_361e6ebc:

    # e "So, you tried to life some stew, got spooked by the ghost, and you're positive that other people didn't see the ghost?"
    e "所以，你是想偷些炖菜，却被鬼魂吓到了，而且你很确定其他人没有看到那个鬼魂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_2054675f:

    # rat_patron "More or less my point, that ghost also escaped somewhere inside the tavern... Because I cannot find him anymore."
    rat_patron "这基本就是我的意思。那个鬼魂也逃进了酒馆里面的某个地方……因为我再也找不到他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_36268f7a:

    # e "Thanks for your time. I'll see what I can do with this."
    e "谢谢你抽出时间。我会看看能拿这条线索做些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_c3ed969b:

    # rat_patron "Do whatever you want with it."
    rat_patron "你想怎么处理都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_2ea2ee1e:

    # e "Understood. I'll keep you posted if I need more help."
    e "明白了。如果还需要帮忙，我会通知你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_ce4f4435:

    # rat_patron "Yeah, sure... Now, leave me alone. I've got enough trouble."
    rat_patron "嗯，行了……现在离我远点。我遇到的麻烦已经够多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Menu_92f51433:

    # "You part ways with the rat patron, his words echoing in your mind as you head off."
    "你和那位鼠族客人分道扬镳，离开时，他的话语仍在你的脑海中回响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Fail_4a1854cd:

    # e "Alright, I guess that's all I'll get from you."
    e "好吧，我想你也就只能告诉我这些了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Probed_Info_Fail_7fb46a8f:

    # rat_patron "Yeah, now if you'll please excuse me."
    rat_patron "嗯，现在请你放我走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_Dialogue_End_5f9c3948:

    # "The conversation slowly winds down as you watch the rat walk away."
    "你看着那只鼠族客人走远，对话也渐渐告一段落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_e9fe0057:

    # e "Cane, I did what you asked for."
    e "凯恩，我已经按你说的做了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_0158cddf:

    # c "Oh? Did ya get the rat?"
    c "哦？你把那只老鼠逮着了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_56bc6bff:

    # e "I did, he wasn't too keen on talking, but I managed to get some information out of him."
    e "我是抓到了，他不太愿意开口，不过我还是从他嘴里弄到了一些消息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_e49fcffd:

    # c "Oh? What'd he say?"
    c "哦？他说啥了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_b255fab8:

    # e "He said he saw a ghost in the tavern by the counter, and that it had wings and burning eyes. It was six in the morning I think."
    e "他说自己在酒馆柜台旁看见了一个鬼，还说那鬼长着翅膀，双眼像在燃烧。我想那会儿是早上六点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_39b2f568:

    # c "Yeah, I know. I was there but that rat's just mumbling some weird stuff. What else?"
    c "是吗，我知道。我当时就在场，可那老鼠只是在嘀咕些怪话。还有呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_821744be:

    # e "He said it fled as soon as it saw him."
    e "他说那鬼一看见他就逃了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_eecaa6d7:

    # e "He also mentioned that the ghost might have escaped to the storage room."
    e "他还提到，那鬼可能逃进储藏室了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_9d581fc7:

    # c "Nah... I was just walking out at that time, something like that wouldn't have slipped in when I closed the door right away."
    c "才不是……那时候我正往外走，我关门关得那么及时，那种东西不可能溜进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_72724ba6:

    # e "So you didn't see it?"
    e "所以你没看见它？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_d903231e:

    # c "No, I hadn't seen anything. I' go in and out of the storage room every day, I'd have known if I caught the sight of a ghost."
    c "没，我什么都没看见。我每天都进出储藏室，要是真瞧见过鬼，肯定早就知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_572871c0:

    # e "He also mentioned that he was trying to steal some stew from the tavern."
    e "他还说，他当时正想从酒馆偷些炖菜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_c646a433:

    # c "Oh, that rat. I'm not surprised. Ya know, at first I was thinking he's full of lies and he just wanted to get himself off the hook."
    c "哦，那只老鼠啊。我一点也不惊讶。你知道吗，起初我还以为他满嘴谎话，只是想把自己撇干净。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_d74fc98f:

    # e "And he also said that the ghost's trying to do something with the stew too."
    e "他还说，那鬼似乎也想对炖菜做些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_3fb3a795:

    # e "And when I asked him about the other patrons, he said they didn't see the ghost either."
    e "我问起其他客人时，他还说他们也没看见那个鬼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_27b406d4:

    # c "Just like I said, that rat's just a drunkard."
    c "就像我说的，那只老鼠就是个酒鬼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_b8fd9747:

    # e "But he said he was the only one who was drunk."
    e "但他说，只有他一个人喝醉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_eedec97c:

    # c "Ye, I knew it already, he was just there yapping about nonsense."
    c "是啊，这我早知道了，他当时只是在那儿叽里呱啦地胡扯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_fc23fc1c:

    # c "But I guess it was a good try, lad. I didn't expect ya to get anything out of that rat."
    c "不过我猜这也算试得不错，小子。我没指望你能从那只老鼠嘴里问出什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_0a59f7bd:

    # e "Maybe he was right? Maybe the ghost's hiding still, in this place."
    e "也许他说得没错？也许那个鬼还藏在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_d5d269a3:

    # e "I mean, he said it fled to the storage room, right?"
    e "我的意思是，他说那鬼逃进储藏室了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_5a8f9ba1:

    # c "That door, fine, yer been there already... Not downstairs though, but there's nothing much to look."
    c "那扇门嘛，行，你已经去过了……不过楼下还没去，可那儿也没什么好看的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_9ca2fd43:

    # c "I've checked every place... the only possible spot he could've hidden in..."
    c "我把每个地方都查过了……唯一可能藏着他的地方……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_094f3762:

    # c "The brewery, but I don't think he could've gotten in there, I check that place every day."
    c "啤酒坊，不过我不觉得他能进去，我每天都会检查那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_327bc84d:

    # e "But Cane, if the ghost's hiding in the tavern, then why didn't you see it?"
    e "但凯恩，如果那个鬼藏在酒馆里，那你为什么没看见它？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_f48feda0:

    # c "Don't ask me, lad, Do I look like I've got any clues what the hell's going on?"
    c "别问我，小子。你看我像是知道这他妈到底是怎么回事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_22468a3c:

    # "He says as he polishes a mug and leans on the bar."
    "他一边擦拭着杯子，一边倚在吧台上说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_98775d3d:

    # c "He's just saying stuff to get ya to believe his made up stories, I tell ya."
    c "他就是在胡扯，好让你相信那些编出来的故事，我跟你说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Report_Rat_Patron_42560e57:

    # e "Okay, but the details checked out, I think there's still something to it."
    e "好吧，不过那些细节都对得上，我觉得这事肯定还有点蹊跷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_3d0d52ce:

    # e "Maybe the ghost's trying to do something with the stew too."
    e "也许那个鬼魂也在打炖菜的主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_7f66e020:

    # e "I think we should recreate the scene when it first happened, you entering the storage and having the stew ready."
    e "我觉得我们应该重现事情第一次发生时的场景：你走进储藏室，把炖菜准备好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_11cd6bec:

    # c "At six in the morning?"
    c "早上六点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_d12c89b5:

    # c "Sounds like a bloody waste of time and coin to me, but... Alright, I'll go along with this."
    c "听起来就是在白白浪费时间和钱，不过……好吧，我跟你一起干。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_6ac1c95f:

    # "He says with a sigh."
    "他叹着气说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_f44aa221:

    # c "Ya better get ready by then, I'll be waiting with everything else."
    c "你最好在那之前准备好，我会带着其他东西在那里等你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_a18bcdd5:

    # e "He said he was drunk, right? What if we drink the beer too and go downstairs...?"
    e "他说自己当时喝醉了，对吧？要不我们也喝点啤酒，再下楼去……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_2f419f7c:

    # c "Ya think that beer would help us see the ghost?"
    c "你觉得喝啤酒能帮我们看见鬼魂吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_0f0d5c87:

    # e "Maybe. I mean, if the ghost's hiding in the tavern, then why didn't you see it?"
    e "也许吧。我的意思是，如果那个鬼魂藏在酒馆里，那你当时怎么没看见它？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_ffd9b161:

    # c "Yeah, ya caught me, I was sober... And I did open a new batches of old beer... a week before."
    c "行，你抓到我了，我当时确实是清醒的……而且我是在一周前开过一批新的陈啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_571c6ede:

    # c "Okay, we'll check the brewery then, but don't get your hopes up."
    c "好吧，那我们就去看看酿酒坊，不过你可别抱太大希望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_531f61f4:

    # e "Should I be drinking the beer... or you?"
    e "该喝啤酒的是我……还是你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_2288b400:

    # c "Heh, of course it's you, lad. If I'm drunk, ya ain't gonna carry my burly arse upstairs, even if yer life depends on it."
    c "嘿，当然是你，小子。我要是喝醉了，就算关系到你的命，你也不可能把我这壮实的屁股扛上楼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_8403d653:

    # "You nod, perparing to drink a beer before heading to the storage room."
    "你点了点头，准备喝杯啤酒后前往储藏室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_f840b6b6:

    # "You walk into the tavern, the familiar smell of stew wafting through the air as Cane stands behind the bar, polishing a mug."
    "你走进酒馆，熟悉的炖菜香气在空气中飘荡。凯恩站在吧台后，一边擦拭着杯子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_9d561778:

    # c "Oh, you're right on time, lad. Here, I've got the stew ready as usual. How are we gonna recreate the rest of the scene?"
    c "哦，小子，你来得正是时候。给，炖菜已经像往常一样准备好了。接下来我们要怎么重现场景？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_34f513fa:

    # e "Well, I was thinking maybe you could go down into the cellar brewery and see if anything there seems amiss?"
    e "嗯，我在想，也许你可以下到地窖里的酿酒坊，看看那里有没有什么不对劲？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_84457345:

    # "You say as you place your hand on your chin."
    "你说着把手放到了下巴上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_3438a3fa:

    # e "Then I can keep watch over the stew, secretly, maybe I'll get to catch the ghost if he's there."
    e "那我就暗中盯着炖菜，也许那个鬼魂要是在那儿，我就能把它抓个正着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_2c34eb75:

    # "He looks at you for a moment before chuckling, and then sets his mug on the counter."
    "他看了你一会儿，随后轻笑起来，把杯子放在了柜台上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_f49bb57c:

    # c "Bah! Fine, fine, I'll do it."
    c "呸！行了，行了，我来做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_d21b9f64:

    # c "But if nothing happens, then ya gotta owe me a few hours of work, alright?"
    c "不过要是什么都没发生，你就得给我干上几个小时的活，听见没？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_4dae1ccd:

    # "The tavernkeeper smiles, and you nod."
    "酒馆老板微笑着，你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_55359e61:

    # e "Deal!"
    e "成交！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_c9593162:

    # "As the night goes by, you have the tavern all to yourself as the tavernkeeper is still down in the brewery."
    "随着夜色渐深，酒馆里只剩下你一个人，因为酒馆老板还在下面的酿酒坊里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_17218ac1:

    # "You start to feel a bit sleepy and decide to sit on one of the chairs by the bar."
    "你开始有些困了，便决定坐到吧台旁的一把椅子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_5542d3e3:

    # "The fire crackles with the flames burning in it and you rub your hands together to warm them up."
    "火焰在炉中燃烧，噼啪作响，你搓了搓双手取暖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_1ca13036:

    # "You look towards the door every now and then but nothing seems to happen."
    "你时不时朝门口望去，但似乎什么也没发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_65e64b80:

    # "As you start to hear the sound of footsteps walking behind the storage room door, you look around but no one seems to come through."
    "当你开始听到储藏室门后传来脚步声时，你环顾四周，却似乎没人进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_c4c85b13:

    # "You sigh and lean your head back. Slowly you start to drift off to sleep as you listen to the crackling fire."
    "你叹了口气，向后靠着脑袋。听着噼啪作响的火焰，你渐渐开始昏昏欲睡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_e036812e:

    # "The last thing you see, was a sihoulette of a pair of antennae fluttering on top of you."
    "最后映入你眼帘的，是一对在你上方扑动的触角剪影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_2f8b87d2:

    # "As you open your eyes, you find yourself sitting back in the chair by the bar, but this time Cane is standing next to you."
    "你睁开眼，发现自己又坐回了吧台旁的椅子上，只是这次凯恩正站在你身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_0d0ffd87:

    # c "Oi, what happened? Did ya actually see anything? Where's the ghost?"
    c "喂，怎么回事？你真的看到什么了吗？鬼呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Stew_Route_Meet_41a7645b:

    # "He asks as he kneels beside your chair. You check your arms again, and now it's back to orange-ish."
    "他一边问，一边在你的椅子旁跪下。你再次检查自己的手臂，发现它现在又变回了橙色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_1f72c27b:

    # e "C-cane..."
    e "科、凯恩……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_71151981:

    # "You walk up to Cane with tipsy steps, your face blushes a glowing red."
    "你脚步踉跄地走向凯恩，脸颊泛着发亮的红色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_91322d25:

    # c "Ye, no doubt yer drunk as hell, now go downstairs... and see if ya can find anything, or any ghosts."
    c "没错，你肯定醉得不轻。现在下楼去……看看能不能找到什么，或者什么鬼魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_fa492b53:

    # "You nod dizzily, as Cane leads you to the door."
    "你晕乎乎地点点头，凯恩领着你走向门口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_a215cc4d:

    # c "Now, go on, lad. I'll be waiting here. Shout if you see anything."
    c "好了，去吧，小子。我会在这儿等着。要是看到什么就喊一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_639798d2:

    # "You climb down the stairs, your head spinning as you try to keep your balance."
    "你一边努力保持平衡，一边头晕目眩地走下楼梯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_6b669ac6:

    # "You look around the cellar, the dim light flickering as you walk around."
    "你在地窖里四处张望，昏暗的灯光随着你的走动忽明忽暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_0944c920:

    # "The air is thick with the smell of beer and the sound of barrels creaking fills your ears."
    "空气中弥漫着浓重的啤酒味，木桶的吱嘎声不绝于耳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_2aafa88c:

    # "As you walk around, you notice a strange shadow moving in the corner of your eye."
    "你四处走动时，余光瞥见角落里有一道奇怪的影子在移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_cfa41d7f:

    # e "Hello?"
    e "喂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_4cb9aee0:

    # "You call out, but the shadow disappears as you turn to look. It seems to be startled, as if surprised by your presence, or acknowledgement."
    "你出声喊道，可当你转头看去时，那道影子却消失了。它似乎受到了惊吓，仿佛是因为察觉到了你的存在，或是听到了你的回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_433c0a16:

    # "You take a step closer, your heart racing as you try to get a better look."
    "你走近一步，心跳加速，想要看得更清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_640f0154:

    # "The only thing you can make out is the pendulous antenna fluttering, it's almost mind-numbing to the point your eyelid feels heavier by the second."
    "你唯一能看清的，只有那根摇曳的长触须。它几乎令人麻木，眼皮仿佛每过一秒都变得更加沉重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_75ab91e4:

    # e "W-wait..."
    e "等、等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_be1bf16e:

    # "Slowly your head begins to spinning, you try to lean on the wall to prevent falling over completely, but your world fades away before you'd ever reached the ground."
    "你的脑袋渐渐天旋地转，你试着靠住墙，免得整个人摔倒，可还没落地，眼前的世界便彻底暗了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_db4e9d53:

    # "As you open your eyes, you find yourself leaning against the back wall of the brewery, your legs bent and your body hunched over."
    "你睁开眼，发现自己正靠在酒坊后墙上，双腿弯曲，身体蜷成一团。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_8342c32e:

    # "You stare at your orange-furred arms, sighing a breath of relief. It was just a dream. Or at least, you thought so."
    "你盯着自己长着橙色绒毛的双臂，松了口气。原来只是场梦。至少，你当时是这么想的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_5f2539ac:

    # c "Ya alright there, laddie?"
    c "你还好吗，小子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_37d3bfa5:

    # "Cane is standing next to you, patting your head with a grin."
    "凯恩正站在你身旁，咧嘴笑着拍你的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_745df178:

    # c "I figured ya gonna need help, so I went down regardless and saw yer slacking off here."
    c "我猜你会需要帮忙，所以还是下来了，结果看到你在这儿偷懒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Beer_Route_Meet_b5f6ce9f:

    # "He says as he looks around the brewery, before leading you up to the bar."
    "他一边环顾酒坊，一边说着，随后领你走到吧台前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_51b16a2b:

    # e "I saw Topu..."
    e "我看见了托普……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_ab340eba:

    # "You say as you rub your temples."
    "你揉着太阳穴说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_e298c819:

    # e "Or rather, I was him. And we were here in this brewery..."
    e "不，确切地说，我就是他。而且我们当时就在这间酒坊里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_9e1f30bb:

    # "The bat's expression goes from amusement to confusion in a blink of an eye."
    "蝙蝠的表情转眼间便从觉得有趣变成了困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_1bea093c:

    # c "That's impossible... Ya can't just have visions like that, it ain't making no sense..."
    c "这不可能……你不可能平白无故看到那种幻象，这根本说不通……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_47e290a7:

    # e "I don't know how, but... I saw what happened when you first met him? Maybe it's the ghost."
    e "我也不知道是怎么回事，可是……我看到了你第一次遇见他时发生的事？也许是那个鬼魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_81f92a8d:

    # e "He said he saw a ghost, and then you told him it wasn't real..."
    e "他说自己看见了鬼，然后你告诉他那不是真的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_bb8789cb:

    # c "Well... that part's true enough."
    c "嗯……至少那部分确实是真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_56d84f9c:

    # c "That was the only time he mentioned a ghost or some sort, so I figured he just made the whole thing up."
    c "那是他唯一一次提到鬼之类的东西，所以我就以为整件事都是他编出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_4f66f799:

    # "You explain to Cane your experience of having the vision of Topu in the cellar. Cane listens intently, a look of shock on his face."
    "你向凯恩解释了自己在地窖里看到托普幻象的经历。凯恩神情震惊，专注地听着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_4c3b6d53:

    # c "But who is giving you these... visions, lad?" nointeract
    c "可是，小子……到底是谁让你看到这些……幻象的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_5afbcc58:

    # e "I think it's the ghost's doing. I mean, Topu has seen him before."
    e "我觉得是那个鬼魂干的。我的意思是，托普以前也见过他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_7ca67fdc:

    # c "Ya think there's been a ghost in my bloody cellar this whole time?"
    c "你是说，这么长时间以来，我那该死的地窖里一直有个鬼？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_3725cfc6:

    # e "Maybe, and I think the ghost's trying to tell us something. Maybe there's a way we can communicate with him..."
    e "也许吧，而且我觉得那个鬼魂正试图告诉我们什么。也许我们能找到和他沟通的办法……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_316bed0d:

    # e "I mean, why else did he let me see what happened that night."
    e "不然他为什么要让我看到那晚发生的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_6e4ca081:

    # e "Cane, you believe me, right?"
    e "凯恩，你相信我，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_abfffead:

    # c "How else can I not, lad? What ya told me was bloody vivid, just like when I first saw him..."
    c "我怎么可能不信你呢，小子？你说的那些实在太鲜明了，就像我第一次见到他时一样……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_1827c337:

    # e "What if Topu came back?"
    e "要是托普回来了呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_b86b5474:

    # c "Oh, I wished... I just missed seeing that lad around here... he was a good worker, always helped me out with the brewing and cleaning up the place."
    c "哎，我真希望……我只是想念那个小伙子在这儿的日子……他干活很卖力，总是帮我酿酒、收拾店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_9095946d:

    # c "I don't wanna believe he betrayed the village, lad. I wanted to say he's not that kind of people, but then I realised I never really knew him."
    c "我不想相信他背叛了村子，小子。我本想说他不是那种人，可后来才意识到，我其实从来没真正了解过他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_062cc0d5:

    # c "But if he came back, then why didn't he just tell me himself? What troubles has he gotten himself into now..."
    c "可他要是回来了，为什么不亲自告诉我？他现在又惹上什么麻烦了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_ef1ae248:

    # "He says as he rests his chin in his palm."
    "他一边说，一边用手掌托住下巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_b6c52e67:

    # c "Now, what was it you wanted from me again, lad? I'm getting tired just thinking about it..."
    c "那么，小子，你刚才又想让我做什么来着？光是想想我就累了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_10fa038a:

    # e "Right! I guess we go down again and see if the ghost's still there."
    e "对！我们大概得再下去看看那鬼魂还在不在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_48641d76:

    # "The bat suddenly perks up."
    "蝙蝠突然打起精神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_02ef518c:

    # c "Oh! Maybe that's why we couldn't see the bloody thing before!"
    c "哦！也许这就是我们之前看不见那见鬼东西的原因！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_d928eb0e:

    # c "Topu took a swirl at my barrel of beer, remember?"
    c "托普喝过我那桶啤酒，还记得吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_e30e36a3:

    # e "And you said it's going to be expensive when he drank that."
    e "而且你说过，他喝掉那啤酒得付一大笔钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_cbb4123f:

    # c "Aye, I lied, I just wanted to get'em to feel bad, maybe pay for the damage too. It's just some old beer I had lying around, tasted nasty as hell..."
    c "当然，我撒了谎。我只是想让他觉得过意不去，也许还能赔点损失。那只是我放在一边的些陈年啤酒，难喝得要命……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_5bda6b91:

    # "He says as he looks around for something."
    "他一边四处寻找什么，一边说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_d625db90:

    # c "Hold on, let me grab some of that stuff..."
    c "等等，让我拿点那东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_4a7c49d4:

    # "He disappears behind the bar for a few moments before coming back with a piece of old paper."
    "他在吧台后消失了片刻，随后拿着一张旧纸回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_0c033741:

    # c "That lad kept buggering me to teach him to make beer. He never told me why, but I sorta figured out someone taught him to drink those beer."
    c "那小子一直缠着我教他酿啤酒。他从没告诉我为什么，不过我大概猜到，是有人教他喝那些啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_efec0736:

    # "He says as he hands it over to you. The edge is already yellowed, the ink lost to the air."
    "他把纸递给你时说道。纸边已经泛黄，墨迹也在空气中褪去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_1b550d06:

    # c "I thought he was trying to hide something from me- those scumbags taught m' lad drinking, all behind m' back. I just couldn't stand 'em, but that lad begged me not to kick 'em out."
    c "我以为他想瞒着我什么——那些人渣背着我教我家小子喝酒。我真是受不了他们，可那小子求我别把他们赶出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_fc8fc9a0:

    # c "So I gave in, I taught him to make beer, but he insisted that there's one recipe he's most excited about, one that I must teach him to make."
    c "所以我让步了，教他酿啤酒，可他坚持说有一种配方让他最期待，非要我教他做出来不可。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_691d1ee3:

    # "Hesitantly, He unfolds the paper and places it in your palm."
    "他犹豫地展开纸张，把它放进你的手心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_ea230252:

    # c "It's the first beer that he got in my cellar, same one as ya saw in the vision."
    c "这是他在我酒窖里拿到的第一种啤酒，就是你在幻象里看到的那种。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_43c6b030:

    # e "T-that? is it the same beer you sold to that patron?"
    e "那、那个？就是你卖给那位客人的同一种啤酒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_40e51d0a:

    # c "Aye, that's right. It's his beer, I've kept it in the cellar for a while... but lately I've been thinking, I've gotta move on, ya know."
    c "对，就是这样。这是他的啤酒，我在酒窖里放了一阵子……但最近我一直在想，我也该向前看了，你懂吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_4d19b3eb:

    # c "So I sold 'em. Bad news is, the last of that batch to that pesky patron that ya were seeing, so... ya gotta make a new one, but I've got a new method for ya!"
    c "所以我把它卖了。坏消息是，我把那批最后一点卖给了你见过的那个烦人客人，所以……你得重新做一份。不过我有个新方法教你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_fa69e7be:

    # c "Just follow the recipe here and yer gonna make that beer in no time."
    c "只要照着这里的配方做，你很快就能酿出那种啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_c72ac512:

    # e "Should I make this beer, and then drink it?"
    e "我该把这啤酒做出来，然后喝掉吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Combining_Beer_Stew_Route_b92e92d3:

    # c "If my theory's right, of course! Just make it, drink that up and come back to me. Ya don't even gotta go through all the brewing process, I've gotcha covered."
    c "当然，前提是我的理论没错！你只管把它做出来，喝下去，再回来找我。连完整的酿造过程都不用走，包在我身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_1fe669ed:

    # c "Ya wanna help? It's not that hard, just follow the recipe and ya'll be fine." nointeract
    c "你想帮忙吗？没那么难，照着食谱做就行，你肯定能行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_3eda7a31:

    # "You nod, looking at the recipe in your hand."
    "你点了点头，看着手里的食谱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_edef3d43:

    # e "Okay, I'll get going then. I think I know where to find the ingredients."
    e "好吧，那我这就去。我想我知道去哪儿找那些材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_df820f9c:

    # c "Good, good. I know ya can do it, lad."
    c "好，好。我就知道你能做到，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_b1404895:

    # e "Cane, I think I still have something else to do before drinking it..."
    e "凯恩，我想在喝之前，我好像还有件事要做……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_ee0a240d:

    # c "What'cha gotta do, checking off your bucket list? Nah, this beer's not gonna kill you, lad."
    c "你还得做什么，去勾掉你的人生清单吗？不，这啤酒又不会要了你的命，小伙子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_c36abec6:

    # e "Y-yeah about that... I'll be back later."
    e "嗯——对，就那件事……我晚点再回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_2714af4f:

    # "The keeper shrugs."
    "酒馆老板耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Menu_59a1bf8e:

    # c "Okay, Okay. I was just joking, lad. Come back when yer' ready."
    c "好，好。我刚才只是开玩笑，小伙子。准备好了就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_fb898b45:

    # e "Cane, what should I do again?"
    e "凯恩，我接下来该做什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_e0f698d6:

    # c "Aye, aye! Remember the recipe I gave ya?"
    c "对，对！还记得我给你的配方吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_bf310889:

    # c "W-wait a second 'ere, you've got the beer! Great, that means my recipe's alright."
    c "等、等一下，你拿到啤酒了！太好了，这说明我的配方没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_03f442fb:

    # c "Now, go drink whatever ya got."
    c "现在，去把你拿到的喝了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_3a3bfc13:

    # c "Aye, aye! Remember the recipe I gave ya? Go find 'em ingredients and craft the beer."
    c "对，对！还记得我给你的配方吗？去找齐那些材料，把啤酒酿出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_c921d344:

    # c "It doesn't take that much for a normal brewing process, but considering we'd only need one mug full of beer. That much herbs gotta be enough."
    c "正常酿造用不了这么多，不过我们只需要一杯啤酒。这么多草药应该够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_fdc8ecdb:

    # "You nod, as you look at the recipe in your hand."
    "你一边看着手里的配方，一边点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_6b775c92:

    # e "What's... gruit's and hops?"
    e "什么……格鲁伊特和啤酒花？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_9d0ef032:

    # c "The Gruits just a mix of herbs, Horehounds' in the goat's place, golden berries probably in the lagoon, and Mugwort I've seen 'em on the side of the road outside of the farms."
    c "格鲁伊特就是几种草药的混合物。山羊那边有苦薄荷，金莓大概在泻湖里，农场外的路边我见过艾草。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_fa53d007:

    # c "Hops' in the grove near the farm."
    c "啤酒花就在农场附近的树林里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_de0dc213:

    # c "We never put gruits with hops ever, they're both... too bitter for the folks around 'ere."
    c "格鲁伊特"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_9e1cb84e:

    # c "But I've tried a few times, they usually were not sold to my dear patrons for a reason."
    c "不过我试过几次，没把它们卖给我那些亲爱的顾客，肯定是有原因的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_5b832aef:

    # "Cane trails off as he tries to remember something."
    "凯恩努力回忆着什么，话音渐渐低了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_d0797b40:

    # c "Now, put both into yer beer. And lo and behold, ya made it, and fair warning, these nasty things taste bitter as swamp water."
    c "现在，把这两样都放进你的啤酒里。瞧，这不就做成了？先说好，这些讨厌的东西喝起来苦得跟沼泽水似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_7e53c78b:

    # c "Ahh... and somehow that ol' lad's sure had a taste for it... Just drink it when ya ready, and report to me, I'll open the cellar door for ya."
    c "啊……不知怎么的，那个老家伙倒还挺喜欢这味道……你准备好了就喝下去，然后来告诉我一声，我就替你打开地窖门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Craft_Beer_Ask_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_19cdde56:

    # e "C-cane... I've drunk the beer."
    e "科……凯恩……我把啤酒喝了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_8a94931b:

    # e "I-Is it supposed to do this to me? I'm starting to feel really drowsy..."
    e "这……这是应该发生在我身上的吗？我开始觉得特别困了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_09a3156d:

    # c "Bloody hell... Already?"
    c "见鬼……这么快？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_13441e33:

    # "He says as he sets his mugs back behind the bar."
    "他一边说着，一边把杯子放回吧台后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_369d657b:

    # c "I guess I shoulda known better than to let ya have some of that stuff. Go on down to the cellar, I'll be right behind ya."
    c "我早该知道不该给你喝那东西。你先下地窖去，我马上跟上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_46aa7bf8:

    # "You nod, as you make your way down the steps, you can hear Cane muttering under his breath."
    "你点点头，沿着台阶往下走，听见凯恩在低声嘟囔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_75f96d1c:

    # "You sit down on one of the stools in the brewery, and your head starts spinning even more as you try to focus your vision."
    "你在酿酒坊的一张凳子上坐下，努力集中视线时，脑袋转得更厉害了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c21b66f0:

    # "After a few minutes, you begin to see things moving around in the shadows, and you start to feel like someone's watching you."
    "几分钟后，你开始看见阴影中有什么在移动，也开始觉得好像有人在盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_ed48c708:

    # "You ask out loud as you look around the dark room."
    "你环顾昏暗的房间，大声问道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_7a441084:

    # e "Cane? Are you there?"
    e "凯恩？你在吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_7a9d68d7:

    # c "Hold on, lad, I'm comin'!"
    c "等等，小子，我这就来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9ccf9392:

    # "The bat calls from upstairs."
    "楼上传来蝙蝠的叫声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c60aad11:

    # c "The door's a little bit jammed, give me a minute!"
    c "门有点卡住了，给我一分钟！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_313abdec:

    # "You nod and turn back towards the shadows, your vision suddenly becomes clearer, and the shadow slowly emerges into a perching figure behind the barrels."
    "你点点头，转身重新望向阴影，视线突然变得清晰起来，而那道阴影也缓缓显出身形，正蹲踞在木桶后方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_cade4b95:

    # "It's tall, with long limbs and covered in thick fur."
    "它身形高大，四肢修长，浑身覆盖着厚厚的皮毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_38f6aa00:

    # e "Cane, come quick! I found him!"
    e "凯恩，快来！我找到他了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_abd4e80d:

    # c "What? Found who? Get yer arse outta there now!"
    c "什么？找到谁了？赶紧从那儿滚出来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1fe4119f:

    # "But before you can react, the figure moves. And so does everything else in the brewery."
    "可还没等你反应过来，那身影动了。啤酒厂里的一切也随之动了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_58f98ccd:

    # "You feel as if you've been transported from Puro again. Your world is blinking itself out of existence."
    "你感觉自己仿佛又被传送离开了普罗。你的世界正一闪一闪地从存在中消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_38f07ce0:

    # "Barrels and boxes fly across the room as the figure suddenly appears in front of you."
    "那身影突然出现在你面前，酒桶和箱子也随之飞过整个房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_397b4beb:

    # "It's not a ghost at all. It's a mothman, a huge creature with wings like a moth, standing on two legs like a man."
    "根本不是什么幽灵，而是一个蛾人——一只长着蛾翼、像人一样用两条腿站立的巨大生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c63fd294:

    # "And it's looking directly at you with its huge, glowing eyes. You realize that you have seen it before, in the back of your mind inside Topu's memory."
    "它正用巨大而发光的双眼直直盯着你。你意识到自己以前见过它——就在托普记忆中的脑海深处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_266f3ef1:

    # e "What... what are you?"
    e "你……你是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_01df8c89:

    # "You ask, your voice coming out as a whimper."
    "你问道，声音里带着呜咽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_b31cd7bd:

    # "The moth-creature steps closer to you, its wings rustling as it moves. Its body is covered in thick fur, like a bat's would be, but it stands on two feet like everyone else."
    "飞蛾生物朝你走近，翅膀随着动作沙沙作响。它的身体覆盖着厚厚的绒毛，像蝙蝠一样，却和其他人一样用两条腿站立。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1874a427:

    # "It tilts its head to the side, regarding you curiously. Suddenly, it reaches out a hand towards you, its claws glinting in the light of the brewery."
    "它歪着脑袋，好奇地打量着你。突然，它朝你伸出一只手，利爪在酿酒厂的灯光下闪闪发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_08eb11e4:

    # "You shiver involuntarily as it touches your face, its touch cool against your skin. It seems gentle enough though, almost... tender?"
    "它碰到你的脸时，你不由自主地打了个寒颤，接触皮肤的触感冰凉。不过，它似乎相当温柔，甚至……带着几分怜爱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c45b88a0:

    # "Slowly, it pulls back its hand and points towards a corner of the room where a single barrel sits, half-full of dark liquid. Its other hand gestures towards you, then towards itself. It wants you to follow it?"
    "它慢慢收回手，指向房间角落。那里放着一个木桶，里面盛着半桶黑色液体。它的另一只手先指向你，又指向自己。它是想让你跟着它吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d27fbc25:

    # "You nod slowly, trying not to startle the creature."
    "你慢慢点头，尽量不惊吓到这个生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_14e571c1:

    # e "Okay... I'll come with you."
    e "好吧……我跟你走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d16f44a3:

    # "As you approach the barrel, the creature carefully pushes it aside, revealing a patch of damp earth beneath that you did not notice before. It points at the ground, then looks at you expectantly."
    "你走近木桶后，这个生物小心翼翼地将它推到一旁，露出下面一片你之前没有注意到的潮湿泥土。它指了指地面，随后满怀期待地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1ede00d8:

    # "You kneel down and try to touch the spot where it's pointing, the ground feels cold to the touch, and it seems to be glowing in bright blue."
    "你跪下身，试着触碰它所指的位置。地面摸起来冰冷，而且似乎正泛着明亮的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_00563ce0:

    # "You look back at the barrel, the pieces of wood facing the wall is almost drenched in this blue glowy substance."
    "你回头看向木桶，朝着墙壁那一侧的木板几乎都被这种泛着蓝光的物质浸透了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_dbed6177:

    # e "Where does this come from?"
    e "这东西是从哪里来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_da698c0e:

    # "You ask as you stand up again and look around the cellar."
    "你再次站起身，环顾着地窖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c25dd7d4:

    # e "Is it the beer that's making me see these things?"
    e "是啤酒让我看到了这些东西吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_cd7ceadd:

    # "The creature nods, then points towards the wooden floor, his feet are bound to the same blue glow, tethered beneath the damp dirt under the barrel."
    "这个生物点了点头，接着指向木地板。它的双脚被同样的蓝光束缚着，拴在木桶下方潮湿泥土的深处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6372985d:

    # e "Does that mean, you're trapped here..."
    e "这是不是意味着……你被困在这里了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_f371c1cf:

    # "You say quietly, realizing what had happened."
    "你轻声说道，意识到了这里发生过什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c0bdafc8:

    # e "But why? What happened here?"
    e "可是为什么？这里究竟发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_02b0de29:

    # "You ask, looking around the brewery."
    "你问道，同时环顾着酿酒厂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_48665996:

    # "The creature sighs with his mandibles, or at least, that's what it sounds like."
    "这个生物用大颚叹了口气，至少听起来像是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1abcd329:

    # "Then it turns to face you directly, its eyes glowing brighter than before. He extends his arms, then places his hands on either side of your head."
    "随后，它转过身直面你，双眼比之前更加明亮。它伸出双臂，将双手放在你头部两侧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d61844f3:

    # "You feel a sharp pain shoot through your skull, but it's quickly replaced by an overwhelming feeling of peace and warmth."
    "你感到一阵剧痛穿过头颅，但那痛苦很快被一种压倒性的平静与温暖取代。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_3889d763:

    # "When you open your eyes again, everything looks the same, but somehow, everything looks different too. Colors seem brighter, and the air itself feels... thicker."
    "当你再次睁开眼时，一切看起来都和原来一样，可不知为何，又仿佛全都变了。色彩似乎更加明亮，就连空气本身也感觉……更加浓稠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6004eb91:

    # yu "I'm so thirsty..."
    yu "我好渴……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_02a1c766:

    # "You whisper, feeling yourself stepping down the stairs. You can still hear loud chatters in the distance."
    "你低声呢喃着，感觉自己正走下楼梯。你依然能听见远处传来的喧闹交谈声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d224123c:

    # yu "Why am I so thirsty?"
    yu "我为什么这么渴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_4aa893b3:

    # "A voice calls in your head, familiar yet strange. It sounds like someone you know, yet not quite right."
    "一个声音在你脑海中响起，熟悉却又陌生。听起来像是你认识的人，却又不太对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_e9e9283f:

    # yu "Topu? Am I... dreaming of his memory again?"
    yu "托普？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_adfd0b19:

    # "You ask softly in your mind, but the other part of your mind doesn't sense your presence."
    "你在心里轻声发问，但心灵的另一部分并没有察觉到你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c814097b:

    # "The other you limp towards a barrel, filled with a strange liquid, light yellow in color."
    "另一个你一瘸一拐地走向一个木桶，桶里装着奇怪的液体，颜色淡黄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9c656ff8:

    # "A pungent smell permeates from the barrel."
    "一股刺鼻的气味从木桶里弥漫出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_2d2bf5c5:

    # "As soon as you touch the liquid, you start to feel a strong urge to drink it. Your body moves without your control, and before you know it, you've already gotten incredibly drunk."
    "你一碰到那液体，便强烈地想要把它喝下去。你的身体不受控制地动了起来，等你回过神时，已经醉得不省人事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9f69b0a3:

    # "Your vision blurs, and you can barely keep your balance on your feet."
    "你的视线变得模糊，几乎无法站稳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_f7d003cb:

    # yu "That was so good... I'm so full..."
    yu "太好喝了……我好撑……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d10a3a34:

    # "You giggle, your mind becoming fuzzy. You look across the room, and suddenly, your legs give out beneath you, causing you to topple over onto the beer shelves."
    "你傻笑起来，意识变得一片模糊。你望向房间另一头，突然双腿一软，整个人摔倒在啤酒架上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_8535de21:

    # "A glass bottle breaks under your weight, and a streak of blue glow emerges from its shards as you slump onto the ground."
    "一只玻璃瓶被你的体重压碎了。你瘫倒在地时，一缕蓝光从碎片中冒了出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_cf698c14:

    # my "What was that?"
    my "那是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9474347d:

    # "A voice from upstairs shout, the tavern quieten as if they are trying to look for the source of the commotion."
    "楼上传来一个声音的喊叫，酒馆也安静下来，仿佛都在寻找骚乱的源头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_ec851375:

    # "The liquid inside the bottle starts to leak out, forming a small pool of blue glow that slowly reaches your paws."
    "瓶中的液体开始渗出，形成一小滩蓝色的光，缓缓流到你的爪子旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_04972173:

    # "Your half-closed eyes watches the glowing liquid as it seeps into your fur, your body begins to tremble slightly."
    "你半闭的双眼注视着发光的液体渗入毛发，身体开始微微颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_60a3d955:

    # "Then, a pair of antenna suddenly appears above you, blocking your view of the ceiling."
    "随后，一对触须突然出现在你上方，挡住了你看向天花板的视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_2d966d51:

    # yu "Huh?"
    yu "咦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1c8fd011:

    # "You look up to see a giant bug perching directly above you, its wings rustling as it lands onto the barrels."
    "你抬头一看，只见一只巨大的虫子正停在你上方。它落到木桶上时，翅膀发出窸窣声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_3bf26811:

    # "The creature tilts its head to the side, regarding you curiously as its eyes glow brighter than before."
    "那生物歪着头，好奇地打量着你，眼睛比刚才亮了许多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_dda8e765:

    # "It notices the glass shard and the blue glow on your paw."
    "它注意到了玻璃碎片，以及你爪子上的蓝光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_59099ca1:

    # "The bug's eyes widen as it realizes what has happened, and it stands up straight on its hind legs, looking panicked."
    "虫子意识到发生了什么，双眼睁大，随后用后腿直立起来，显得惊慌失措。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_e3775ea0:

    # my "What's going on down there?"
    my "下面到底怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_a4d25828:

    # "The same voice shouts from upstairs as the creature flies towards the stairs."
    "同一个声音从楼上传来，大声喊着，而那只生物朝楼梯飞去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1dbac8c0:

    # "You struggle to move your body, feeling like your limbs have turned to lead. But you can feel the mothman's panic resonating through the ground, the blue glow following him like a trail."
    "你挣扎着想要移动身体，四肢却仿佛变成了铅。但你能感受到蛾人的恐慌在地面上传来共鸣，蓝光如同轨迹般跟随着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1e050c0a:

    # "When the mothman runs up, you can hear the sound of footsteps begins to muffle..."
    "蛾人跑上楼后，你听见脚步声开始变得模糊……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_fa5bf22b:

    # c "[e]! What the hell's going on down there?"
    c "[e]！下面到底他妈的怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_729fa704:

    # "Cane shouts as he stands over you, while the mothman crouching in the corner."
    "凯恩站在你身前大喊，蛾人则蜷缩在角落里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6c32e549:

    # "The weird echo in your mind has stopped, everything is back to normal, as if nothing happened at all."
    "你脑海中那道诡异的回声已经停止，一切都恢复了正常，仿佛什么都没发生过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_3a8f9d29:

    # "You point at the mothman, trying to show Cane the ghost that he saw."
    "你指向蛾人，试图让凯恩看到他见过的那个鬼魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_94bd3d03:

    # e "I found it, Cane."
    e "我找到它了，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_4d756d9a:

    # "You say weakly as you try to get up from the floor."
    "你虚弱地说道，试着从地上爬起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_3f8c2cb3:

    # e "The ghost's there. It's a moth, I guess."
    e "鬼魂就在那儿。我想，它是一只蛾子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_631392dd:

    # c "What? Where?"
    c "什么？在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_41a8fd84:

    # "He asks as he looks around the cellar."
    "他环顾地窖，边看边问道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_a40731cb:

    # c "Bloody hell... Oh, for fuck's sake..."
    c "见鬼……妈的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_0ff5c783:

    # "Cane comes to as sudden realisation as he looks at you with concern, kneeling beside you."
    "凯恩突然意识到了什么。他关切地看着你，跪在你身旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_65c8701f:

    # c "Whats it want from ya, lad? Tell me if he's coming close to me."
    c "它想从你这儿得到什么，小子？要是它靠近我，记得告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_ce19a7cb:

    # e "No, no, it's not a ghost... It's just... trapped here. I think Topu unleashed it from that broken bottle."
    e "不，不是鬼……只是……被困在这里。我想，是托普把它从那只碎掉的瓶子里放出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_0eb9b3aa:

    # "You say as you look towards the ghost, who seems to be glowing a little brighter than before."
    "你望向鬼魂说道，它似乎比之前亮了一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_cb78ea71:

    # c "That bottle? I thought it was just an old beer, it was there since I'd taken the tavern over..."
    c "那瓶子？我还以为只是一瓶陈年啤酒，自从我接手酒馆时它就在那儿了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_3e682681:

    # c "If Topu got it out, what's it doing here?"
    c "既然托普把它弄出来了，它怎么还在这儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_0aa3260c:

    # e "I think the ghost wants me to help it escape."
    e "我想那个鬼魂是想让我帮它逃出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_ba426ed1:

    # "Cane frowns and stands up, crossing his arms. He tries to look in the direction of the mothman, but he was quite off."
    "凯恩皱起眉头站起身，抱起双臂。他试图朝蛾人的方向看去，却偏得厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9e14a645:

    # c "Nah, lad, you can't be trustin' that bloody thing! Who knows what kinda trouble it could cause if it gets outta here?"
    c "不行，小子，你可不能信那该死的东西！谁知道它要是从这儿出去，会闹出什么乱子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6d8fc4d8:

    # "You nod slowly."
    "你缓缓点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_a71e7eb9:

    # e "Maybe... But I don't think it's dangerous..."
    e "也许吧……但我不觉得它有危险……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_e33ea50b:

    # "You say as you stand up."
    "你说着站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_0e32c4b0:

    # e "And I don't think it can hurt anyone either... It didn't try to hurt me."
    e "而且我也不觉得它能伤害任何人……它刚才没有试图伤害我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1e665559:

    # c "Hmm..."
    c "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_f0f5cef5:

    # c "Alright, alright, I'll think on it. Oh, we ain't never gonna get any work done if we keep chasin' after ghost all day long!"
    c "好吧，好吧，我会考虑的。哦，要是我们整天追着鬼跑，那可就什么活都别想干了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_97a96926:

    # "He sighs as he looks at the corner again."
    "他又看向角落，叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_0f25697e:

    # c "Lad, if it's so harmless, can ya ask this... ghost to stop haunting my tavern?"
    c "小子，这要是真没啥危害，你能不能让这只……鬼别再在我的酒馆闹腾了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_e8c7a90e:

    # c "Dangerous or not, I got people comin' in here thinkin' my place is some sort of a bloody haunted house!"
    c "不管危险不危险，客人们都跑到这儿来，以为我的地方是该死的鬼屋！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_182e734d:

    # "You smile weakly, the mothman seem to understand Cane's request, it nods, but then points at his stomach, and then pointing towards the door upstairs."
    "你勉强笑了笑。蛾人似乎明白了凯恩的请求，点了点头，随后指指自己的肚子，又指向楼上的门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_a2d4e105:

    # e "Uh... Cane."
    e "呃……凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_eec52767:

    # e "I think he wants me to feed him something..."
    e "我觉得他是想让我喂他点什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_691d0444:

    # "You say slowly as the mothman repeats his gesture."
    "蛾人再次做出那个手势时，你慢慢说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_4181fe94:

    # e "Maybe... maybe he'll stay in the cellar if he's got food?"
    e "也许……也许给他吃的，他就会待在地窖里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_455bd71d:

    # "Cane raises an eyebrow."
    "凯恩挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_a37cdcef:

    # c "Feed the ghost? Lad, you gotta be kidding me... Does the ghost even die if we starve 'em alive?"
    c "喂鬼？小子，你不是在开玩笑吧……把鬼活活饿着，它真的会死吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_43907915:

    # "You shake your head, realizing that the mothman had just been hungry, all along."
    "你摇了摇头，这才意识到蛾人一直只是饿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d199502e:

    # e "No, no, he's not a ghost, and I think it's been just eating from your stew anyway."
    e "不，不，他不是鬼，而且我觉得他一直都只是吃你的炖菜而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_23888d9e:

    # "You say as you look around the brewery."
    "你一边环顾酿酒坊一边说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_5e8319f6:

    # e "And that's when that patron saw him."
    e "就是在那时候，那个客人看见了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_978a4d8c:

    # "The bat keeper sighs and rubs his temples."
    "蝙蝠店主……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_bd9136a4:

    # c "Alright, alright... fine, lad."
    c "好了，好了……行了，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_b23d25fd:

    # c "I'll bring him some stews, ya like that big pot of stew, ghost?"
    c "我给他弄几份炖菜来。你喜欢那一大锅炖菜，对吧，鬼？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_649e56bd:

    # "The mothman nods slowly."
    "蛾人缓缓点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_371799df:

    # e "Thank you so much, Cane! This is perfect!"
    e "太谢谢你了，凯恩！这真是太好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_b1e439ea:

    # "Cane smiles for a moment, before gesturing you to follow him upstairs."
    "凯恩笑了片刻，随后示意你跟他上楼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6d4f3947:

    # c "Come on lad, let's get ya something to sober ya up."
    c "来吧，小子，给你弄点东西醒醒酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_829983c0:

    # "He places his arm around your shoulder as he leads you out of the brewery, giving the mothman another cautious glance."
    "他搂住你的肩膀，带你走出酿酒坊，同时又谨慎地瞥了蛾人一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d14bd766:

    # c "Don't go tellin' nobody about this ghost business, alright?"
    c "别把这鬼的事告诉别人，行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_da11dd7a:

    # "He says as he pats your head."
    "他一边拍着你的头一边说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_2af9c4af:

    # c "It ain't gonna do us any good, and I don't wanna scare off my customers!"
    c "这对我们没半点好处，而且我可不想把客人都吓跑！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c8f01d59:

    # "You nod in agreement as you make your way towards the bar, still feeling a little light-headed from the beer."
    "你点头表示同意，朝吧台走去，啤酒还让你感觉有些头晕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d16b27a2:

    # "Cane sets you up on one of the chairs and hands you a cup of water."
    "凯恩让你在一把椅子上坐下，并递给你一杯水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_f8f738e6:

    # c "That ghost's been watching me down there... all along."
    c "那个鬼魂一直都在下面盯着我……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6ad23f0e:

    # "He says as he sits down next to you."
    "他一边说着，一边坐到你身旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9efcbb5f:

    # c "I always knew it was somethin', but I just couldn't figure out what..."
    c "我早就知道那是某种东西，可就是想不出到底是什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_e2e15451:

    # c "Bloody hell, is that why he'd always get drunk from that barrel? To see that bloody thing?"
    c "该死，难道他总是从那个木桶里喝醉，就是为了看见那个鬼东西？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6d8fc4d8_1:

    # "You nod slowly."
    "你缓缓点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_5e74b4bf:

    # e "Yeah... And... I think he was trying to help it escape too."
    e "是啊……而且……我觉得他也在想办法帮它逃出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_8561f593:

    # "Cane frowns and looks towards the corner where the mothman is hiding."
    "凯恩皱起眉头，望向蛾人藏身的角落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_94a1c438:

    # c "He could've told me, ya know. We coulda worked together to fix this mess."
    c "他本可以告诉我的，你懂吧。我们本可以一起想办法收拾这个烂摊子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_9b8bd73c:

    # e "No, no, he didn't want to trouble you."
    e "不，不是的，他只是不想麻烦你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_61629a8c:

    # e "He thought you were mad at him for drinking already. But he really cared about you, Cane."
    e "他以为你已经因为他喝酒的事生气了。但他真的很在乎你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_d392b2e3:

    # "The bat keeper falls silent, looking down at his hands as he rests them on the bar counter."
    "蝙蝠店主……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_cfd95d2d:

    # c "I was mad! He wasn't like that before, yer know?"
    c "我是生气了！可他以前不是那样的，你知道吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_f0476c53:

    # c "If I didn't want him to drink I'd have thrown away that barrel. I let him drink that beer, do anything he wanted, but that just made him hide away from me."
    c "如果我不想让他喝酒，早就把那个木桶扔了。我任由他喝那些酒，想做什么就做什么，可那反而让他躲着我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1acbe0c0:

    # c "And I... I was younger, lad. I didn't have much patience for him as I do now."
    c "而且……我那时候还年轻，小子。我不像现在这样，对他那么有耐心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_73883598:

    # "He says as he looks at you, smiling weakly."
    "他看着你，脸上露出一丝勉强的笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_367be9bd:

    # c "I didn't know how to talk to that kid, I wanted to apologize to him but other words just slipped out of my mouth..."
    c "我不知道该怎么和那孩子说话。我本来想向他道歉，可别的话却从我嘴里溜了出来……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_b4f12f66:

    # "Cane sighs and shakes his head."
    "凯恩叹了口气，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_244188a0:

    # c "It's not easy running a tavern, yer know? And it's even harder when ya gotta take care of a bratty lad like him."
    c "经营一家酒馆可不容易，你知道吧？更别说还得照顾他那样一个顽皮的小子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_bae66f63:

    # c "But still... I'd have done anything to make sure he's alright, even if I didn't... appear so."
    c "但即便如此……为了确保他没事，我什么都愿意做，哪怕我当时……看起来并不是这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_47fc9cfe:

    # "He stands up from his stool and pats your shoulder."
    "他从凳子上站起来，拍了拍你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_98207d9b:

    # c "Come on then, get some rest. Thanks for helping me figure this out, lad."
    c "那么，去休息一会儿吧。谢谢你帮我弄清楚这件事，小子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_0b574df6:

    # c "We'll have to keep an eye on that moth ghost later, but I think we can manage, ain't cha think?"
    c "之后我们得留意那个蛾鬼，不过我觉得我们应付得来，你不觉得吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_6a3b7378:

    # c "Here's a bit of compensation."
    c "这是给你的一点补偿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_a4a7d0d7:

    # msg "You also received a level up point."
    msg "你还获得了一个升级点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_5ada0b3c:

    # c "But, I oughta mention... I was going to vote for the goats anyway, so I'm not sure if this helped or not, if ya helped for the vote."
    c "不过，我得说一句……反正我本来就打算投山羊，所以我也说不准这到底有没有帮上投票的忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_7982da50:

    # e "Oh, I see..."
    e "哦，我明白了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1998a834:

    # e "But no, Cane... I didn't do it for the vote, I just wanted to help you and Topu."
    e "不过不是，凯恩……我不是为了那场投票才这么做的，我只是想帮你和托普。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_5acb6d4e:

    # "Cane smiles, putting your hands in his palms."
    "凯恩笑了笑，将你的双手捧在他的掌心中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_1ca97b90:

    # c "Speaking of, that rat looks like he's leavin' after the vote, ya gotta check to see if he's got any vote left."
    c "说到这个，那只老鼠看起来打算投票后离开，你得去确认一下他还有没有票可投。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Draft_Beer_Drinking_c36016dc:

    # e "Okay, I'll go check on him."
    e "好，我去看看他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_3b58cc95:

    # my "...and then someone's kid just got drunk in my cellar... bah, I can't believe it."
    my "然后还有人家的孩子在我的地窖里喝醉了……啧，真是难以置信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_b5145b79:

    # "You hear a gruff voice as your eyes flutter open. Everything seems so blurry and you can barely make out anything in front of you."
    "你睁开双眼，听见一个粗哑的声音。眼前一片模糊，几乎什么都看不清。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_d0c80c96:

    # "You raise your arm, and notice that your body is covered in gray fur, donning some loosely ragged clothes."
    "你抬起手臂，注意到自己的身体覆满灰色皮毛，身上穿着几件松垮破烂的衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_05036e6c:

    # yu "Hnn... Wh-What?"
    yu "嗯……什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_3d30a90f:

    # "You say as you try to get a clear look at your surroundings. As your vision finally clears, you find yourself sitting on a chair in the brewery, with a bat standing over you."
    "你一边努力看清周围的状况，一边说道。视线终于清晰后，你发现自己正坐在酿酒坊的一把椅子上，一只蝙蝠正站在你身前俯视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_974984c6:

    # tavernkeeper "Oi, good, yer awake!"
    tavernkeeper "哎呀，太好了，你醒啦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_35ab7e36:

    # "He says as he walks over to you, putting down a keg of freshly pour beer."
    "他一边走向你，一边放下一桶刚装好的啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_0de6a08e:

    # tavernkeeper "I thought you fell down here and hit your head or somethin'! What's going on?"
    tavernkeeper "我还以为你摔到这里，撞了脑袋什么的！这是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_36025bb3:

    # yu "I-... I saw a ghost. It... It was here, in the cellar..."
    yu "我、……我看见了一个鬼魂。它……它就在这里，在地窖里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_86243e0c:

    # "He looks at you with a confused expression before laughing."
    "他满脸困惑地看着你，随后笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_32c91625:

    # tavernkeeper "Ghost? In MY tavern?! That's bloody ridiculous! Ya musta had some awful nightmare is all!"
    tavernkeeper "鬼魂？在我的酒馆里？！这也太荒谬了！你肯定只是做了场可怕的噩梦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_b02a70a8:

    # "The bat looks over at your side, where a half-full barrel of beer sits on the floor beside you."
    "蝙蝠朝你身侧看去，旁边地上放着一桶半满的啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_b8d50407:

    # tavernkeeper "You weren't drinking from that were ya?"
    tavernkeeper "你刚才没在喝那个吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_5f5ba77e:

    # yu "N-No sir, I wasn- I didn't mean to drink any of that."
    yu "不、不，先生，我没——我不是故意要喝那个的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_5e62d422:

    # "You say as you rub your eyes."
    "你揉着眼睛说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_5a7c0526:

    # yu "I just... I don't know how I got here... I was... just so thirsty. And something's here..."
    yu "我只是……我不知道自己怎么会到这里……我……只是太渴了。还有什么东西在这里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_54cbb382:

    # tavernkeeper "Oi, what about this one ya slammed into the ground?"
    tavernkeeper "嘿，那这个呢？是你把它砸到地上的吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_ac7e0f81:

    # "He asks as he points to the broken bottle."
    "他指着那个破碎的瓶子问道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_7648b558:

    # tavernkeeper "That's the most expensive one- ya can't pay for that-"
    tavernkeeper "那是最贵的那瓶——你可赔不起——"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_e947bb85:

    # yu "I didn't mean to! I just... it's the g-ghost that's doing this, you have to catch it."
    yu "我不是故意的！我只是……是那只鬼、鬼干的，你得抓住它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_014ab06c:

    # "You stutter nervously, the voice comes out rougher than anything you've uttered."
    "你紧张地结结巴巴，发出的声音比你说过的任何话都更加沙哑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_7749642b:

    # tavernkeeper "Awful lotta nonsense ya been talkin', ya lil thieving brat."
    tavernkeeper "你这小偷崽子一直在说些什么鬼话！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_95fa6319:

    # tavernkeeper "Ya broke into my brewery, drank my precious beer, broke my bottle and then passed out. That's a lotta trouble ya caused just for a bloody ghost story!"
    tavernkeeper "你闯进我的酿酒坊，喝了我珍藏的啤酒，打碎了我的瓶子，最后还醉倒了。就为了一个该死的鬼故事，你可给我惹了不少麻烦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_d9d6cede:

    # yu "But... it was real..."
    yu "可是……那是真的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_03737aaa:

    # "You say as you stand up from the chair."
    "你从椅子上站起来时说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_4892c853:

    # yu "I saw it..."
    yu "我看见它了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_2f53e614:

    # tavernkeeper "Don't go bein' ridiculous, there ain't no such thing as ghosts."
    tavernkeeper "别胡说八道了，这世上根本没有鬼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_a77c0c48:

    # tavernkeeper "Now get yer arse out of my place, I gotta get some cleaning done before the regulars come in."
    tavernkeeper "现在赶紧滚出我的地方，我得在那些老客进来前打扫干净。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_488267b7:

    # "You nod and apologize again. As you make your way towards the exit, you look back at the keeper who looks rather annoyed with you."
    "你点头再次道歉。走向出口时，你回头看了眼酒馆老板，发现他看你的眼神相当恼火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_9b8c60e2:

    # yu "S-Sorry sir..."
    yu "对、对不起，先生……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_11cf3936:

    # "You say as you bow your head, the bat keeper stops, and then he turns to you."
    "你低下头说道。蝙蝠人老板停了下来，随后转身面向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_7c47f5ac:

    # tavernkeeper "Lil brat, where yer house? I ain't see yer face 'ere before."
    tavernkeeper "小兔崽子，你家在哪儿？我以前没在这儿见过你这张脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_39e19ef3:

    # "You freeze in place as he comes near you."
    "他朝你走来时，你僵在了原地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_e70ca7f9:

    # yu "I don't know... I was looking for a place to stay..."
    yu "我不知道……我正在找个落脚的地方……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_dc9fa12c:

    # "He frowns and crosses his arms."
    "他皱起眉头，抱起了双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_b5e1dfdb:

    # tavernkeeper "So you're just one of those beggars that wandered into my place? Well, I ain't got no handouts to give ya, alright?"
    tavernkeeper "所以你就是那些流浪到我这儿来的乞丐之一？哼，我可没什么东西施舍给你，听明白了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_06ed485b:

    # yu "I'm sorry..."
    yu "对不起……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_401e5086:

    # tavernkeeper "But, where yer heading?"
    tavernkeeper "那你要去哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_44ddf542:

    # yu "I've nowhere else to go... sir. I'll work for you if you can just give me a place to sleep."
    yu "我已经无处可去了……先生。只要你能给我个睡觉的地方，我愿意为你干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_78f7541e:

    # "He sighs and runs a hand through his furry hair."
    "他叹了口气，用手捋过毛茸茸的头发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_be377e1b:

    # tavernkeeper "Bah... Alright then, you can stay the night. Look, I've got no free room for ya, you gotta sleep 'ere or something."
    tavernkeeper "哼……好吧，那你今晚可以留下。听着，我没有空房间给你，你只能睡在这儿什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_ac90d0b5:

    # tavernkeeper "Tomorrow I'll have ya working yer arse all day long to pay back for that beer, alright?"
    tavernkeeper "明天你得整天给我卖力干活，偿还那瓶啤酒，听见了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_99eca732:

    # "You nod enthusiastically, struggling to hide your smile."
    "你热情地点着头，努力掩饰自己的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_05f66e50:

    # yu "Yes sir! Thank you so much!"
    yu "是的，先生！太感谢您了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_a41d645f:

    # "And the bat waves his hand at you."
    "那只蝙蝠朝你挥了挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_ac3f63c1:

    # tavernkeeper "I've never seen someone so keen on sleeping on the floor..."
    tavernkeeper "我还从没见过这么热衷于睡地板的人……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_3b341808:

    # "You smile widely as you make your way upstairs to the storage room, the keeper calls after you."
    "你咧嘴笑着走上楼去储藏室，店主在身后叫住你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_9472ec66:

    # tavernkeeper "Hey, brat, what's yer name anyway?"
    tavernkeeper "喂，小鬼，你叫什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_46923ec9:

    # yu "Topu, sir. I'm Topu."
    yu "托普，先生。我叫托普。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_b42ccb9e:

    # tavernkeeper "Well then, Topu, I expect you to be up early for work. Yer lucky I ain't kicked yer arse outta here already!"
    tavernkeeper "好吧，托普……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_f2d6a4d7:

    # tavernkeeper "But if ya got any more of those ghost stories for me patrons, I'll have ya thrown out of here myself, got it?"
    tavernkeeper "不过，要是你再给我的客人讲那些鬼故事，我就亲自把你扔出去，明白了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_ea434176:

    # yu "Yes sir, I understand."
    yu "是，先生，我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_400fd0e8:

    # "You turn around and see a big rug drapes over the keeper's hands."
    "你转过身，看见店主的双手上搭着一张大毯子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_b32f31fd:

    # yu "What is it?"
    yu "这是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_d7551526:

    # "You ask as you approach him, and the bat frowns."
    "你走近他开口询问，蝙蝠皱起了眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_49da9b74:

    # tavernkeeper "Yer bed."
    tavernkeeper "你的床铺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_8e8d6bf1:

    # "He says as he drops the rug and a sack of flour on the floor."
    "他说着把地毯和一袋面粉放到地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_104fecdd:

    # tavernkeeper "Now go on, ya look half dead on yer feet. Get some rest 'ere, and I'll wake ya up when it's time for work."
    tavernkeeper "行了，去吧。你看起来都快站不住了。先在这儿歇会儿，到了干活的时候我叫醒你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_cda3c385:

    # yu "Thank you so much, Sir! I won't let you down!"
    yu "太谢谢您了，先生！我不会让您失望的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_14c9cbdd:

    # "You say as you bow deeply to the bat, and he waves his hand at you dismissively."
    "你向蝙蝠深深鞠了一躬，说道；他不耐烦地挥了挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_7f612bae:

    # tavernkeeper "Yeah, yeah, don't call me sir, it's Cane."
    tavernkeeper "行了行了，别叫我先生，我叫凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_f425a3b6:

    # "He mumbles as he walks away, leaving you alone in the storage room with your new rug. You set it down on the floor and lay down on it, closing your eyes. As sleep takes you, you hear Cane muttering to himself."
    "他一边走开一边嘟囔着，留下你独自在储藏室里，身边只有那张新地毯。你把地毯放到地上，然后躺在上面，闭上双眼。睡意袭来时，你听见凯恩还在自言自语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_01035a2e:

    # c "Bloody hell, what did I get myself into..."
    c "见鬼，我这是惹上什么事了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Cane_Voting_Quest_Topu_Vision_6da0b94e:

    # "His speech blurs as you drift off into a deep sleep."
    "他的声音逐渐模糊，你也渐渐陷入沉睡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_bfa76043:

    # e "Hey there."
    e "嗨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_dc08e4ae:

    # "You find the rat patron sitting on the tavern table again, "
    "你又看到那位鼠人主顾坐在酒馆的桌子上，"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_f8b7aa72:

    # rat_patron "Oh, it's you again. What do you want? I already told you everything I know."
    rat_patron "哦，又是你。你想干什么？我已经把知道的一切都告诉你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_d9a97b3f:

    # e "I'm just here to tell you that you were right! There's something in the cellar, I saw it myself!"
    e "我来只是告诉你，你说得没错！地窖里确实有东西，我亲眼看到了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_beb83b15:

    # rat_patron "Oh, really? So you finally saw it?"
    rat_patron "哦，真的吗？所以你终于看到了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_89bcd30a:

    # e "Yeah, I did. It was just like what you said."
    e "是啊，我看到了。就跟你说的一模一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_a571fc47:

    # rat_patron "Ah! So you finally believe me, huh? I knew it all along."
    rat_patron "啊！你终于相信我了，对吧？我早就知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_78e6961e:

    # e "It turns out that the ghost's a moth, and you drank the beer that makes you see the moth."
    e "原来那个鬼魂是只蛾子，而你喝了那种能让你看见蛾子的啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_88eef3a1:

    # rat_patron "Is that so? That explains why their beer looked so... dark. I thought the keep changed his recipe or something."
    rat_patron "是这样吗？难怪他们的啤酒看起来那么……黑。我还以为旅店老板改了配方什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_aff9e050:

    # e "Yeah, Cane didn't know about it either. The moth just had the same idea as you when you went for the stew."
    e "是啊，凯恩也不知道这事。那只蛾子只是和你一样，打起了炖菜的主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_73981a8a:

    # "The rat smiles awkwardly as he looks over at the cellar door."
    "老鼠望向地窖门，尴尬地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_21ccd776:

    # rat_patron "Well, thanks, server. At least I don't have to worry about the ghost messing around this place now."
    rat_patron "好吧，多谢你了，服务员。至少我现在不用再担心鬼魂在这里捣乱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_99bfc646:

    # rat_patron "If there's anything you need, ask away. I'll leave Lusterfield after the vote's finished."
    rat_patron "如果你还有什么需要，尽管问吧。投票结束后我就会离开卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_61ff973a:

    # e "Oh the voting day, can you vote for the goat?"
    e "哦，说到投票那天，你能投山羊一票吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_782de86d:

    # e "Oh the voting day, can you vote against the goat?"
    e "哦，说到投票那天，你能投票反对山羊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_c597992f:

    # e "Well, I don't need anything else for now, thanks again."
    e "嗯，我暂时没别的事了，再次谢谢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_8c1a7d69:

    # rat_patron "Alright, server."
    rat_patron "好吧，服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_37cb4b05:

    # rat_patron "Ah, you've got the right guy, server. It's a wonder there's no such laws as vote manipulation in Lusterfield."
    rat_patron "啊，你找对人了，服务员。卢斯特菲尔德居然没有操纵选票之类的法律，真是奇了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_e38dce77:

    # e "Is that a yes?"
    e "这算是答应了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_5e7a993b:

    # rat_patron "Sure, I wasn't going to vote anyway, consider it my gratitute for your help."
    rat_patron "当然，反正我本来也不打算投票，就当是感谢你帮忙吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_0d3338af:

    # "You nod, as the rat begins to take his leave."
    "你点了点头，老鼠也开始离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_d48a4320:

    # rat_patron "Oh, by the way, server, Cane probably doesn't remember me, but I was there when Topu took a gulp at my beer."
    rat_patron "哦，对了，服务员，凯恩大概不记得我了，不过托普从我的啤酒里喝了一大口时，我就在场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_183fbb09:

    # rat_patron "The boy was just a bit lost, you know? He told me a lot of things, things that I didn't care at the time."
    rat_patron "你知道，那孩子当时只是有点迷茫？他跟我说了很多事，不过那些事我当时并不在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_d5f9110e:

    # rat_patron "But, one thing I never understood was why he started drinking that night..."
    rat_patron "不过，有一件事我始终想不明白，他那晚为什么开始喝酒……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_c3e2bf7c:

    # "The rat turns away, and steps off the tavern without another word."
    "老鼠转过身，一言不发地走出了酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_5076db8f:

    # "You look at the door, wondering what he meant by that."
    "你望着门口，琢磨着他那话到底是什么意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_cb40e345:

    # e "I think you were right... I think I saw a ghost after following your trails."
    e "我觉得你说得对……我顺着你的踪迹找过去后，好像看到了一个鬼魂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_925c2bfb:

    # rat_patron "Really? What's it like then?"
    rat_patron "真的吗？那到底是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_768bac7a:

    # e "Uhm... I couldn't really see anything, it was a shadow to me, but I've made a really weird dream."
    e "呃……我其实什么都没看清，对我来说那就是一团影子，不过我确实做了个特别奇怪的梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_afc712fe:

    # rat_patron "Yeah, I've seen shadows and I've made nightmares plenty, come back when you've got some better experience, server."
    rat_patron "是吗？我见过影子，也制造过不少噩梦。等你积累了更多经验再回来吧，服务员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_f8c2a159:

    # e "Oh, okay. I'll report to Cane now..."
    e "哦，好吧。我现在就去向凯恩报告……"

translate schinese_rewrite Rat_Patron_After_Probing_87689fd1:

    # rat_patron "Shoo shoo."
    rat_patron "嘘嘘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_f3a602d5:

    # "As you enter his house, you find Rahim sitting alone at the working station, just as usual."
    "你走进他的房子时，发现雷希姆一如往常，独自坐在工作台前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_86570088:

    # e "Rahim!"
    e "雷希姆！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_8f35dc67:

    # r "What's it that you want."
    r "你想要什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_3a11f380:

    # e "I'm sorry I missed the vote the other day, Rahim, how did the village vote go?"
    e "雷希姆，很抱歉前几天投票时我没能参加，村子最后投票的结果怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_754ace14:

    # r "Normal. Have you at least done the courtesy of reading the vote result?"
    r "很正常。你至少还算客气地读过投票结果吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_9a941dbf:

    # e "I did."
    e "读过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_30a475d8:

    # r "[e], good to see you here."
    r "[e]，很高兴在这里见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_14b6f585:

    # e "I'm just here to check in, after that huge village vote we just held."
    e "我只是来了解一下情况，毕竟我们刚刚举行了一场规模很大的村庄投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_d8c161ae:

    # r "Oh yes, vote, everyone else's talking about the vote like it's some kind of big deal."
    r "哦，对，投票。所有人都在谈论投票，好像那是什么了不得的大事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_11e4a09a:

    # r "I spent the whole week preparing for the votes. Every single second I spent thinking about the votes, I really don't need one more person to ask me about it."
    r "我花了整整一周准备这次投票。每一秒都在想着投票，我实在不需要再多一个人来问我这件事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_7df4705a:

    # e "Oops, uh. I'm sorry."
    e "呃，抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_bb11f4d9:

    # r "It's fine, I'm just... tired. It's been a long time since I've had to deal with this."
    r "没事，我只是……累了。已经很久没有处理这种事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_aba7549f:

    # r "I don't even know why people looked up to me in the first place, I was not the mayor, I didn't know how to run the village."
    r "我甚至不知道人们当初为什么会仰望我。我又不是村长，也不知道该怎么管理村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_add478a4:

    # e "Maybe because you have a kind heart and tender soul?"
    e "也许是因为你有一颗善良的心和温柔的灵魂？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_04df46aa:

    # "Rahim hisses, frowning at your flattering portrayal."
    "雷希姆发出嘶嘶声，对你这番奉承的描述皱起了眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_126b31c1:

    # r "Regardless of the results, I shall take my role more seriously from now onwards."
    r "不管结果如何，从今往后我都会更加认真地对待自己的职责。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_71e7c6c1:

    # e "That's great, I'm sure Lusterfield will flourish in your hands."
    e "那太好了，我相信卢斯特菲尔德在你的手中一定会繁荣起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_250f9be9:

    # r "Speaking of, I didn't see you in the crowds during the announcement, [e], did you leave early?"
    r "说起来，宣布结果时我没在人群里看到你，[e]，你是提前离开了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_528a55ea:

    # e "Uh, I was there with Seb."
    e "呃，我当时和塞布在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_ce1e0d13:

    # r "Good, now you know that we are not ever going to ally up with the goats. Never."
    r "很好，现在你知道了，我们永远不会和那些山羊结盟。永远不会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_4b87c7a8:

    # e "Is it really out of the question? Maybe somewhere down the line you might need an ally."
    e "真的完全没有可能吗？也许将来的某一天，你会需要一个盟友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_887f3dd0:

    # r "I stand by the decision of my people, for the foreseeable future, you won't see the goat's banner anywhere near our village."
    r "我支持族人的决定，在可预见的未来，你不会在我们村子附近看到山羊的旗帜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_afa0e85c:

    # r "The vote serves its purpose."
    r "投票达到了目的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_d6daf845:

    # e "I see, maybe it's best for both sides, considering the ancient history you two had."
    e "我明白了，考虑到你们两人之间由来已久的过往，这或许对双方都好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_1b21679a:

    # r "I am not so certain, it... it affects the two of us nonetheless, I hope it's the better decision."
    r "我不太确定，这……无论如何都会影响我们两人，我希望这是更好的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_86317715:

    # "The bull looks outside the windows, you catch a glimpse of reflections in his eyes ever so slightly."
    "公牛望向窗外，你隐约看到他的眼中映出些许倒影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_f1533a29:

    # r "There's something I need you to do, rather related."
    r "有件事需要你去做，和这件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_d70eda48:

    # r "I suppose it is time. With or without the goats, we'll need to prepare for the worst."
    r "我想，是时候了。不管有没有山羊，我们都得为最坏的情况做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_899de235:

    # r "As much as I want to return to my sewing work. The village need a leader."
    r "尽管我很想回去做缝纫工作，村子需要一位领袖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_59398a27:

    # e "What do you need of me, Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆，你需要我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_aae237f9:

    # r "Can you go ask Sebas to come here, we need to have a talk."
    r "你能去请塞巴斯到这里来吗？我们需要谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_482bbfcc:

    # r "Okay, good. Just as I reminded you, it's not what I'd hoped for, but I'll do whatever my people need."
    r "好，很好。正如我提醒过你的，这不是我所希望的结果，但族人需要我做什么，我都会去做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_3eb2c3df:

    # e "I'm glad, I'm sure the people from both sides are going to get along very well."
    e "我很高兴，我相信双方的人会相处得非常融洽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_7666fb1c:

    # r "Mayhaps. The people will."
    r "也许吧。族人会的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_7f526578:

    # e "I'm not sure allying up with the goats was the best choice, afterall, it hasn't been long after what happened."
    e "我不确定和山羊结盟是否是最好的选择，毕竟那件事发生后还没过去多久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_faf29681:

    # r "I was there when it happened, rest assured, I won't regret a decision made by my people."
    r "事情发生时我就在场，放心吧，我不会后悔族人做出的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_86317715_1:

    # "The bull looks outside the windows, you catch a glimpse of reflections in his eyes ever so slightly."
    "公牛望向窗外，你隐约看到他的眼中映出些许倒影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_f1533a29_1:

    # r "There's something I need you to do, rather related."
    r "有件事需要你去做，和这件事有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_59398a27_1:

    # e "What do you need of me, Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆，你需要我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_425833f4:

    # "Rahim turns away, taking out a letter from the shelves. He stares down, holding onto the letter with two hands before looking back at you."
    "雷希姆转过身，从架子上取出一封信。他低头凝视着信，双手握着它，然后回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_d5835fbb:

    # r "Give this to Furkan, steadfastly."
    r "把这个交给弗坎，务必如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_ed6a16e3:

    # r "If he is as earnest as he said, it should be easy for us to sign an alliance pact and discuss our future."
    r "如果他像自己说的那样诚恳，我们应该很容易签署联盟协定，并商讨我们的未来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_221d47c0:

    # r "Now, you should be going. We have more to discuss later."
    r "现在你该走了。我们之后还有事要谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Vote_Day_After_f8d3b816:

    # "You nod, quickly taking the letter from his hand."
    "你点点头，迅速从他手中接过信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_c8e1ed86:

    # e "Hey, Sebas. Rahim wants to talk to you."
    e "嗨，塞巴斯。雷希姆想和你谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_38e417b9:

    # s "Oh, really? He could've just come here himself, you know. The shop's as empty as my own stomach."
    s "哦，真的吗？他本可以直接来这里找我，你知道的。这店里空荡荡的，就跟我的肚子一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_bd2438ed:

    # "Sebas chuckles, as he leans back on the counter."
    "塞巴斯靠在柜台上，轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_470616dc:

    # s "Speaking of, I can really use a snack right now. Probably a beer... definitely a beer."
    s "说到这个，我现在还真想吃点零食。大概来杯啤酒吧……不，绝对得是啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_e4151919:

    # e "I'm sure Rahim has something important to say, come on!"
    e "我敢肯定雷希姆有要紧事要说，走吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_c8658b2c:

    # "You grabs Sebas by the arm, pulling him out of the shop."
    "你一把抓住塞巴斯的胳膊，把他拉出了店门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_624c67cc:

    # s "Okay, okay. I'm coming, roomie."
    s "好啦，好啦。我这就来，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_57574f61:

    # "The lion clumsily follows you out of the shop, as you both head towards Rahim's house."
    "那头狮子笨手笨脚地跟着你走出店门，你们一起朝雷希姆的家走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_1843b347:

    # "You quickly knock on Rahim's door. He opens it, revealing a slightly annoyed expression."
    "你赶紧敲响雷希姆的门。他打开门，脸上显出几分不耐烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_5610eb0c:

    # r "Anyone else with you two?"
    r "你们俩还带了别人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_8d06b330:

    # e "No, just us."
    e "不，就我们两个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_a04c4abd:

    # s "Hey, Rahim. What's up?"
    s "嘿，雷希姆，怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_86c6860a:

    # r "I need to talk to you two about something important."
    r "我有件重要的事要和你们两个谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_94f69063:

    # "Rahim gestures for you both to enter, as he closes the door behind you."
    "雷希姆示意你们两人进去，同时在你们身后关上门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_b68bae64:

    # r "What I need to talk about is not for the ears of the village, or anyone else you know."
    r "我要和你们谈的事，不能让村里人，或是你们认识的其他任何人听见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_634e6a16:

    # s "Okay... is it something about my stash of rocks?"
    s "好吧……是关于我那堆收藏的石头吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_a2d52d0f:

    # "Rahim raises an eyebrow, as he looks at you both."
    "雷希姆看着你们两人，挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_3244b061:

    # s "I mean, the one at your house looked really beautiful, I thought you did't notice it at all."
    s "我是说，你家那堆看起来真的很漂亮，我还以为你根本没注意到它呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_2b67810c:

    # "You nudge at Sebas, who is now looking at you with a confused expression."
    "你轻轻碰了碰塞巴斯，而他此刻正带着困惑的表情看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_51e6ea0c:

    # r "What are you talking about?"
    r "你在说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_71ade13a:

    # r "No, I want to talk about Lusterfield, now that the vote is over."
    r "不，我想谈谈卢斯特菲尔德，投票既然已经结束了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_404298bf:

    # e "I thought you said the village will remain the same?"
    e "我以为你说过村子会维持原样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_383c615a:

    # r "Yes, but that doesn't mean my duty is over."
    r "是的，但这不代表我的职责已经结束了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_15332d33:

    # r "We need to go to the Mayor's Longhouse, the old one next to the tavern there."
    r "我们得去村长的长屋，就是那边酒馆旁边的那座旧长屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_7b7669fe:

    # s "Oh, I see. What do you need us for?"
    s "哦，我明白了。你需要我们做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_90bf08da:

    # r "You're just tagging along, Sebas. I am talking to [e] here."
    r "你只是跟着来而已，塞巴斯。我是在和[e]说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_e06b9d38:

    # "Sebas shrugs, as he leans back on the wall."
    "塞巴斯耸耸肩，靠回墙上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_4e7820f0:

    # s "Okay, okay. I get it. I'm just plucked out of my shop to witness the great Rahim do his own thing again."
    s "好了好了，我懂了。我只是被从店里硬拽出来，来看伟大的雷希姆又在自作主张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_33e78efe:

    # "Rahim rolls his eyes."
    "雷希姆翻了个白眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_f191007d:

    # r "Are you coming with us or not?"
    r "你到底跟不跟我们走？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_60f07d05:

    # s "Yes, Rahim. I'll do anything for you if you ask."
    s "是，雷希姆。只要你开口，我什么都愿意做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_e0d8cfcf:

    # "Sebas smirks. As Rahim turns back to you."
    "塞巴斯咧嘴一笑，雷希姆转回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_524398c7:

    # r "Shall we go now?" nointeract
    r "我们现在走吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_3a777282:

    # e "Okay, let's go then."
    e "好，那我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_a250fb53:

    # s "Wait, wait. I need to grab my things first."
    s "等等，等等。我得先拿上我的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_4c4b04ae:

    # e "Uh, maybe later. I need to do something first."
    e "呃，或许晚点吧。我得先做点事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_7f445c14:

    # "Rahim looks at you two with a disappointed expression, as he crosses his arms."
    "雷希姆失望地看着你们两个，同时抱起双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Mayor_Rahim_Talk_d5e5ce70:

    # r "Okay, but don't take too long. I need to get this done as soon as possible."
    r "好吧，但别花太久时间。我得尽快把这件事办完。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_ede3d340:

    # e "Chief Furkan, guess what happened back in Lusterfield?"
    e "弗坎酋长，猜猜卢斯特菲尔德那边发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_efb2acbd:

    # f "What can it be? You seem to be very excited, [e]. Hmm..."
    f "会是什么呢？你看起来很兴奋，[e]。嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_82514bc2:

    # f "Let me guess, Rahim held a village-wide vote, and the folks finally decided to ally with us?"
    f "让我猜猜，雷希姆举行了全村投票，大家终于决定和我们结盟？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_dc232e71:

    # e "Hey, that's no fun. You knew it already. Thought I could somehow surprise you."
    e "嘿，那就没意思了。你早就知道了。我还以为能想办法给你个惊喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_e78bf3c4:

    # f "It was merely a wild guess. Did I guess right, [e]?"
    f "只是随口乱猜而已。我猜对了吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_46b6afd6:

    # e "Y-yes, okay, but that's not even a guess."
    e "是——是，好吧，但那根本算不上猜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_8a16ecf2:

    # f "It was a joke, [e]. Of course I knew, words travels faster than a courier."
    f "开个玩笑，[e]。我当然知道，消息传得比信使还快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_04267472:

    # f "Besides, my fellows told me some Lusterfolks were trying to restore the bridge."
    f "再说，我的同伴告诉我，有些卢斯特菲尔德人正试图修复桥梁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_110547dc:

    # f "According to them, they saw a handsome looking horned one trodding through water like it's nothing."
    f "据他们说，他们看到一个长相英俊的长角人在水中跋涉，仿佛那根本不算什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_a71dd77e:

    # e "Uh... yeah."
    e "呃……是啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_d14274e6:

    # f "So, if Rahim needed me, I will ensure it will not be a one-sided conversation."
    f "所以，如果雷希姆需要我，我会确保这不会变成单方面的谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_89fe9e80:

    # e "Yes, you got it right, Furkan. I have got something for you right here."
    e "没错，你猜对了，弗坎。我这里正好有东西给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_55466ff9:

    # "Furkan nods as you hand the letter to him. He flicks open the seal naturally, before unfolding the paper inside."
    "你把信递给弗坎时，他点了点头。他熟练地揭开封印，随后展开里面的纸张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_d78c40a6:

    # f "'{i}Furkan, Chief of the Goat Tribe,{/i}'"
    f "'{i}弗坎，山羊部落酋长，{/i}'"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_792db768:

    # "Naturally, he reads the rest of letter silently, a sense of bewilderment can be seen in his widened eyes."
    "他自然地默默读起了信的其余部分，睁大的双眼中流露出困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_1dc08a01:

    # "The ram quickly skims through the page, before he sneaks a glance at you."
    "公羊迅速扫过整页内容，随后偷偷瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_487ac336:

    # f "Have you read the letter?"
    f "你读过这封信了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_af3c6f15:

    # e "No, chief. I received it from Rahim after it's sealed off."
    e "没有，酋长。我是在信封好后从雷希姆那里收到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_babda770:

    # "Furkan raises his brows, your glances meet briefly."
    "弗坎扬起眉毛，你们的目光短暂交汇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_00eb6afe:

    # f "He wishes to meet me in Haskell's hut, with you taking part as the conciliator."
    f "他希望在哈斯克尔的小屋里与我见面，并由你担任调解人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_9a87c81c:

    # f "I appreciate the gesture Rahim has bestowed, but tell him I will bring my general along, lest anything happens."
    f "我很感激雷希姆的这番好意，但告诉他我会带上我的将军，以防万一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_c7d2d946:

    # e "Just to assure, I don't think Rahim will do anything you're thinking..."
    e "我只是想让你放心，我不认为雷希姆会做你想的那些事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_b99b7287:

    # f "I remember the last time we talked, it did not end too pleasantly, so it is fair that Kari shall escort me much the same as you escort Rahim."
    f "我记得我们上次交谈时，最后闹得不太愉快，所以由卡里陪我去，也和你陪同雷希姆一样合情合理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_3757f961:

    # e "Okay. I will let Rahim know..."
    e "好。我会转告雷希姆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_a15a5990:

    # "Furkan smiles."
    "弗坎笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_454e9f3a:

    # "For a man who was publicly humiliated on the streets of Lusterfield, the ram is surprisingly composed as he hears about meeting the abuser."
    "对于一个曾在卢斯特菲尔德的街道上遭受公开羞辱、如今又听说要与加害者见面的人来说，这只公羊表现得出奇镇定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_dc6cdf81:

    # e "Furkan, do you not worry about anything at all? How could you keep so calm all the time?"
    e "弗坎，你一点都不担心吗？你怎么能一直这么冷静？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_3e756e06:

    # f "Oh, I worry. I worry a lot. I worried when the sun hides, worried when a bleat is heard. I worried if my father is here to see it all."
    f "哦，我会担心。我非常担心。太阳藏起来时，我会担心；听到咩叫时，我会担心。我还担心父亲是否在这里，看着这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_38ba5b9b:

    # f "Duty has left me weary, left me a husk of my own self, yet it was the same thing that kept me afloat in the ebbing tides."
    f "职责让我疲惫不堪，把我变成了自己的空壳，可也正是它让我在渐退的潮汐中坚持了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_df9e6ba9:

    # e "It must be tiresome to rule alone, but I guess Kari is here to help."
    e "独自统治一定很累，但我想卡里在这里能帮上忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_1aad8484:

    # f "I feel more alone with him by my side. He is a loyal deer, but sometimes I wonder if I am the one who's dragging him down."
    f "有他在身边，我反而觉得更加孤独。他是一只忠诚的鹿，但有时我会怀疑，是不是我在拖累他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_c1093468:

    # f "I am not sure if I am the right chief for the tribe, but I am the only one left with our name."
    f "我不知道自己是不是适合当这个部落的酋长，但我们这个名字如今只剩下我一个人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_e7f9062a:

    # e "You are doing a great job, Furkan. I am sure your people are proud of you."
    e "你做得很出色，弗坎。我相信你的族人一定以你为傲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_eb1070e1:

    # "Furkan chuckles, as he folds the letter back into his pocket."
    "弗坎轻笑一声，把信重新折好，塞回口袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_28aa59fa:

    # "He stands up, his eyes fixed on the distant horizon."
    "他站起身，目光凝望着远方的地平线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_69c8c81c:

    # "It takes a moment before he turns back to you, his eyes blurry."
    "过了一会儿，他才转身看向你，双眼有些模糊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_5a2dff0f:

    # f "They said it was hollow grief."
    f "他们说，那是空洞的哀痛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_c88227b4:

    # "Furkan stammers in a voice lower than you can hear."
    "弗坎用低得你听不见的声音结结巴巴地说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_217a9390:

    # f "They said that I could never become their chief just as I abandoned my duty and left my father to die."
    f "他们说我永远不可能成为他们的酋长，就像我抛弃职责、任由父亲死去一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_83b1ef0e:

    # f "But I persisted, I pledged myself to the tribe when all I wanted in my life was to be free from it."
    f "但我还是坚持了下来，在我一生只想摆脱部族的时候，立下誓言效忠部族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_4999d7f1:

    # f "When I ran away from the tribe, I wandered off the primrose path for a while, I fed myself, had my way with any traveller across the plains."
    f "我逃离部族后，有一阵子偏离了正道，靠自己填饱肚子，还在平原上遇到的任何旅人身上随意寻欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_5b772040:

    # f "Then comes the long weeks of slumber and weariness. I quickly got bored of this life. I stayed in my shed, refused to see anyone, not even the general."
    f "随后便是漫长数周的沉睡与疲惫。我很快就厌倦了这样的生活。我待在自己的棚屋里，拒绝见任何人，连将军也不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_de01d46d:

    # "Furkan's voice is soft, as he continues to speak."
    "弗坎继续说着，声音很轻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_cbb3bf11:

    # f "I thought I had wanted to be rid of the tribe's life, and I was too stubborn to admit otherwise."
    f "我以为自己想要摆脱部族的生活，只是太过固执，不肯承认并非如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_5941018c:

    # f "There were times Kari pleaded for me come back and I would feign being asleep. I was determined to stay in the shed, until that last knock."
    f "有几次卡里哀求我回去，我却装睡。我下定决心待在棚屋里，直到最后那次敲门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_63611024:

    # "His eyes are distant, and his voice is barely a whisper."
    "他的目光游离，声音轻得几乎只剩耳语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_35d799d1:

    # f "The passing of my father brought me home, dragged my body with deep grief. I tried not to cry when I saw him, but it is futile effort. I was left half a ram after the ceremony."
    f "父亲去世后，我回到了家，深深的悲痛拖着我的身体。看到他时，我努力不让自己哭出来，但那只是徒劳。仪式过后，我只剩下半个公羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_67d52d0b:

    # f "And thus was the impression of my first day as the chief, a traitor... a fool... and worst of all, a wailing wimp."
    f "这就是我成为酋长第一天给人的印象：一个叛徒……一个蠢货……最糟糕的是，一个哭哭啼啼的窝囊废。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_e106ccce:

    # e "Furkan... you had all the reason to cry. It was a sad day."
    e "弗坎……你完全有理由哭。那是悲伤的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_1d08be97:

    # f "It was, but I had to move on, I had to be the chief my father wanted me to be. Or else, what was the point of all this?"
    f "确实如此，但我必须继续前进，必须成为父亲希望我成为的酋长。否则，这一切又有什么意义？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_95eaae89:

    # "He looks at you, his eyes are clear, his voice is firm."
    "他看着你，目光清明，声音坚定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_d02ef2c2:

    # f "If my people see me as an incompetent fool, then I shall be the fool they need. Just as who Rahim sees me as, I shall be who he needs."
    f "如果我的族人把我看成无能的蠢货，那我就做他们需要的蠢货。正如雷希姆眼中的我那样，我也会成为他需要的那个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_f379f287:

    # e "You are not a fool, Furkan. Stop saying that."
    e "你不是蠢货，弗坎。别再这么说了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_533ac04a:

    # "Furkan chuckles, as he pats your head."
    "弗坎轻笑着拍了拍你的头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_96a95f7e:

    # f "You are too kind, [e]. But I am afraid, I am not as strong as you think I am. I am not as strong as my father thought I was."
    f "你太善良了，[e]。不过我担心，我没有你想的那么强大，也没有父亲以为的那么强大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_5fb26116:

    # "He turns away, as he walks towards the open windows."
    "他转过身，朝着敞开的窗户走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_73e773bf:

    # "You watch as he stares at the horizon, his eyes are fixed on the distant lands."
    "你看着他凝望地平线，目光落在远方的土地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_2dfdc4aa:

    # f "I will see you where Haskell lives."
    f "我会在哈斯克尔住的地方见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Receive_Pact_0afdda3e:

    # "You nod, as you slowly take your leave."
    "你点点头，慢慢告辞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_588679cd:

    # "You arrive at Haskell's hut, the dragon is already waiting for you at the door."
    "你来到哈斯克尔的小屋，龙已经在门口等着你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f0b6b007:

    # "On the corner of your eyes, you notice Kari standing beside Furkan, who is crossing his arms silently."
    "你用眼角余光注意到卡里站在弗坎身旁，而弗坎正默默地抱着双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ff956dab:

    # h "Ah, [e]. You're here. Come in, come in. The tea is ready. And little ram, you too."
    h "啊，[e]。你来了。进来，进来。茶已经准备好了。还有小公羊，你也进来吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_417e9f1f:

    # "Haskell opens the door, as he gestures both of you to enter, leaving the general outside."
    "哈斯克尔打开门，示意你们两人进去，把将军留在外面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6a37ed64:

    # "You step inside, the hut is warm and cozy, the smell of chamomile fills the room."
    "你走进屋内，小屋温暖而舒适，满室都是甘菊的香气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_65d599b4:

    # "Rahim is already sitting at the table, his eyes are fixed on the paper in front of him."
    "雷希姆已经坐在桌边，目光紧盯着面前的纸张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_800600ec:

    # h "Take a seat, take a seat. Unless you want to stand, I don't mind."
    h "坐吧，坐吧。除非你们想站着，我也不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_4a602b9b:

    # "You sit down, as Haskell pours you three some cups of tea."
    "你坐了下来，哈斯克尔给你们三人倒了几杯茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_fdeb42c8:

    # h "Want tea? I brewed up a pot full of Chamomile, freshly harvested."
    h "想喝茶吗？我刚用新鲜采摘的甘菊泡了满满一壶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3805dea9:

    # r "No thanks."
    r "不用了，谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_39120e0d:

    # h "Actually, that wasn't a question, Himmy. I've already poured you a cup."
    h "其实我刚才不是在问你，希米。我已经给你倒了一杯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_67963cc0:

    # "Haskell shoves the tea in front of the old bull, which he reluctantly takes."
    "哈斯克尔把茶推到老公牛面前，老公牛不情愿地接过了茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a6e8bbb6:

    # h "Welcome to my humble abode, you two magnificent leaders. Take a seat, I've got some biscuits if you're hungry."
    h "欢迎来到我的寒舍，两位非凡的领袖。请坐，你们要是饿了，我这儿还有些饼干。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_364c694b:

    # f "Thanks, I will be sure to take a bite-"
    f "谢谢，我一定会尝一块——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_582aff1f:

    # r "We're not here for tea and biscuits, Haskell."
    r "我们不是来喝茶吃饼干的，哈斯克尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_635702db:

    # h "I am the host today. Maybe you could've said so before I had picked the freshest thymes for you marvelous leaders."
    h "今天我是主人。你们也许该在我为两位了不起的领袖挑好最新鲜的百里香之前就说一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_259b9a08:

    # "The dragon pours two more cup, before he puts the pot away."
    "那条龙又倒了两杯茶，然后把茶壶收了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c7453f9a:

    # h "Isn't that right, [e]."
    h "不是这样吗，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b1845490:

    # e "Uh- yes."
    e "呃——是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3f2e9a29:

    # "He turns back to the bull, who frowns at the dragon."
    "他转身面对公牛，而公牛正皱眉瞪着那条龙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_646d2687:

    # h "Well, someone's being a grumpy old man. I'll leave you three be then."
    h "哎呀，看来有人是个爱闹脾气的老头。那我就不打扰你们三位了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9974afff:

    # "Haskell smiles as he leaves the hut with the empty pot."
    "哈斯克尔带着微笑，拿着空茶壶离开了小屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_008cfc3e:

    # "You briefly catch a glimpse of Kari standing outside, guarding the entrance, before Haskell closes the door."
    "哈斯克尔关门前，你短暂瞥见卡里正站在外面守卫入口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_eeed1f8c:

    # r "So, thank you for coming here, Furkan. And you, [e]."
    r "那么，感谢你来到这里，弗坎。还有你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_012035ab:

    # f "I have read your letter, Rahim. I am glad you've decided to meet me in person. This will clear up the air nicely."
    f "我已经读过你的信了，雷希姆。很高兴你决定亲自来见我。这下我们之间的误会就能好好澄清了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6abc6a1a:

    # f "Before that, I am curious, what made you change your mind, Rahim?"
    f "在那之前，我很好奇，是什么让你改变了主意，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b8d766fb:

    # r "I have not changed my mind, Furkan. I am merely following the decision of my people."
    r "我没有改变主意，弗坎。我只是在遵从族人的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_04d35cee:

    # r "They deemed me the leader of Lusterfield, and I will do whatever it takes to ensure the safety of my people."
    r "卢斯特菲尔德的领袖"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ccdcb24c:

    # f "Sure."
    f "当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6265e090:

    # r "I did not come here to explain myself, Furkan. I came here to discuss the future of our tribes."
    r "我不是来向你解释自己的，弗坎。我是来和你商谈我们部族的未来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_e6b1e8e4:

    # "Rahim shoots a stare towards the other side of the table, and raises his hand to his beard."
    "雷希姆朝桌子另一边投去锐利的目光，同时抬手捋了捋胡须。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_720a41b3:

    # f "I am glad, we shall put the past behind all of us."
    f "我很高兴，我们会把过去抛在身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_deca0cea:

    # r "It's best we secure this history in our mind, so none of the betrayal shall happen again... if we were to be allies, it shall be permanent."
    r "最好把这段历史牢牢记在心里，这样背叛就不会再发生……如果我们要成为盟友，那就必须是永久的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_efa561b3:

    # "Furkan nods with the warmest smile you have ever seen from him. His cordial pose hides a hint of delight and anticipation."
    "弗坎点了点头，露出你从未见他展现过的最温暖笑容。他亲切的姿态掩饰着一丝喜悦与期待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_08204915:

    # r "Now, let's talk about the alliance."
    r "现在，我们来谈谈联盟吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9541b866:

    # "He throws his hands on the table, looking at Furkan intently."
    "他双手按在桌上，目光专注地望着弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_2615ccfe:

    # r "Can't believe I am sitting on a table with a goat again, but here we are."
    r "真不敢相信，我又一次和一只山羊坐在同一张桌子旁，不过事到如今也只能这样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ef638f12:

    # "Furkan chuckles, as he takes a sip of his tea."
    "弗坎一边轻笑，一边抿了口茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_95efcf38:

    # f "Rahim. You have no idea how long I have been waiting for today."
    f "雷希姆。你根本不知道我等今天等了多久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_10dd1a4f:

    # r "Let's not get ahead of ourselves, Furkan. We are here to discuss the terms of the pact, not to celebrate."
    r "别急着高兴，弗坎。我们是来商谈盟约条款的，不是来庆祝的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1eb4f2c6:

    # f "Of course, Rahim. I am ready to listen to your terms."
    f "当然，雷希姆。我已经准备好听听你的条件了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f0698545:

    # "His elegant manners and hospitality had tricked you as being an experienced chief, but in truth, this is probably his first time negotiating a pact."
    "他优雅的举止和待客之道让你误以为他是经验丰富的酋长，但实际上，这大概是他第一次谈判盟约。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_110e3f7c:

    # "Rahim spots this flaw earlier on, often commmentating on his nervousness, or when he is intimidated by the bull's voice. Furkan would only smile along, but he does not seem troubled."
    "雷希姆很早就发现了这个破绽，经常评论他的紧张，或是他被公牛的声音震慑时的模样。弗坎只是陪着笑，却似乎并不为此困扰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3a2ed0c1:

    # "It is after a few minutes into the discussion that Furkan has gotten comfortable in his chair, he sits upright by the table, sometimes even talks over Rahim in the matter of his people."
    "讨论开始几分钟后，弗坎便在椅子上坐得自在起来。他挺直身子坐在桌旁，有时甚至会因为自己族人的事打断雷希姆的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_027b2743:

    # "You had not been the greatest mediator, as expected, they often speak of words you rarely understand, of places and lands further than you have ever walked."
    "不出所料，你并不是个多出色的调解人；他们经常谈论一些你很少能听懂的话题，还有那些远在你从未走过之地的地方与土地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6cbf7429:

    # "Gradually, you decide it is best you sit between the two leaders silently, occassionally nodding or taking a sip of Haskell's tea. Staring was not a good option, as Rahim would chide you endlessly."
    "渐渐地，你觉得自己最好默默坐在两位领袖之间，偶尔点点头，或喝一口哈斯克尔的茶。盯着他们看可不是什么好主意，因为雷希姆会不停地训斥你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_57d84672:

    # "During the long hour of boring dialogues, your mind wandered everywhere, mostly of the places you have visited on this land, but sometimes you thought about Chime."
    "在这段漫长而无聊的对话中，你的思绪飘向四面八方，大多是在想这片土地上你曾去过的地方，但有时你也会想起齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c7f1b0e2:

    # "It had been a while since Puro even crossed your mind, for a long portion of your life you lived in that village, yet your memory of it is getting fuzzier by seconds."
    "你已经有一阵子没想起普罗了。你人生中很长一段时间都生活在那座村子里，可你对它的记忆却在一秒一秒地变得模糊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c584f9d5:

    # "You were dragged here because you were looking for Chime, even whilst Chime had become a distant memory, you cannot shake off your quest for him, as if you were compelled by a ghostly force."
    "你正是为了寻找齐门才被带到这里的。即使齐门已经成了遥远的记忆，你也无法放下寻找他的执念，仿佛有一股幽灵般的力量在驱使着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_629a99ee:

    # r "...That's not possible! The tree is too close, the Luster river is already an apt boundary for you. Nothing further."
    r "……那不可能！那棵树离得太近了，卢斯特河已经是你们合适的边界。不能再往外了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_41a9f56a:

    # "A familiar gruff voice wakes you from the train of thoughts, you look up, and notice the two begin to argue over the pact, again."
    "一个熟悉而粗哑的声音将你从思绪中惊醒。你抬起头，发现两人又开始为盟约争论起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_e6665d31:

    # f "The goat tribe had always held rituals around the tree, it has been our tradition since the beginning of our tribe. We are simply asking for a time where we can hold our ritual undisturbed."
    f "山羊部落一直都在那棵树周围举行仪式，这是我们部族自诞生之初便延续的传统。我们只是想要一段时间，好让我们不受打扰地举行仪式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_bf2cf01a:

    # r "Your tree is in the path of our main route to the river, I cannot tell my people to just not walk by when you parade around your passed ones."
    r "你们的那棵树正好挡在我们前往河边的主要路线上，你们围着逝者举行仪式时，我总不能叫我的族人别从那儿经过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a8df6d46:

    # f "It had been this way since before my father, I am sure there are other paths your wagons can take during our ceremony."
    f "自我父亲出生以前就是这样了。我相信，在我们举行仪式期间，你们的马车还可以走别的路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_4633e16d:

    # f "If my memory stands, it was the first of Lusterfield who had taken our old territories, including the tree."
    f "如果我没记错，最初是卢斯特菲尔德的人夺走了我们的旧领地，那棵树也包括在内。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_74ecebd6:

    # r "Your history was nothing but folk tales to me, little cub. I cannot see myself allowing you to leave us defenseless."
    r "对我来说，你们的历史不过是些民间故事，小崽子。我不能眼睁睁看着你们让我们毫无防备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_83091c48:

    # f "We are forming an alliance, our people is your people too."
    f "我们正在结成同盟，我们的族人也就是你们的族人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9fbe3c80:

    # "Rahim raises his hand to support his snout, he retreats into moments of silence while Furkan is waiting for an answer."
    "雷希姆抬手托住口鼻，在弗坎等待答复时陷入了片刻沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_190cde6e:

    # f "I am afraid we won't reach a conclusion if this is the conversation we are having."
    f "我担心，如果我们一直这样谈下去，就没法得出结论。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9821c065:

    # f "But, [e] is here."
    f "不过，[e]在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6b21e98f:

    # e "Uh, me?"
    e "呃，我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_aa669429:

    # r "Oh. Yes, [e]."
    r "哦。对，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a739a6c7:

    # f "He had contributed in both our tribes, especially for me, maybe he can prove to be useful today."
    f "他曾为我们两个部族都做出过贡献，尤其是对我而言。也许今天他能派上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_424c60c9:

    # "Both Rahim and Furkan stare at you suddenly."
    "雷希姆和弗坎突然一同盯住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_aa16c13a:

    # e "Sure, I mean, I was not sure why I am here in the first place."
    e "当然，我是说，我一开始也不明白自己为什么会在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1f9c2679:

    # "You raise the cup to your mouth, slowing sipping up the tea as you peer at the two leaders."
    "你把杯子举到嘴边，一边慢慢啜饮茶水，一边打量着两位首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_0a66c3c2:

    # r "Aren't you afraid that he'd side with me, after all, he lives in my village, he's one of my people."
    r "你就不怕他会站在我这边吗？毕竟他住在我的村子里，也是我的族人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1e39563a:

    # f "Not at all, I would just like for our pact to be settled. But indeed, I suppose [e] won't feel much better if we get the shortest end of the stick."
    f "一点也不。我只是希望我们的盟约能够敲定。不过话说回来，要是我们吃了大亏，我想[e]的心情也不会好到哪里去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b2070ad9:

    # "You smile awkwardly, from what Furkan had suggested, it had sounded not like an intimidation, but a subtle regard to your desire to please."
    "你尴尬地笑了笑。按弗坎的说法，听起来那并不是威吓，而是在委婉地顾及你想讨好他们的愿望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_4b525c01:

    # "Sometimes you question if you had made your intention too obvious to their eyes."
    "有时你会怀疑，自己是不是已经把意图表现得太明显，让他们看出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_32cc9eaf:

    # r "As you wish."
    r "如你所愿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6dcc89f7:

    # r "You have walked around the ancient tree, [e]. Should we avoid that route while the goats perform their rituals?"
    r "你已经绕过那棵古树了，[e]。山羊族举行仪式时，我们是不是该避开那条路？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_44519b50:

    # e "I think, we should avoid the tree? Rituals are sacred, after all."
    e "我觉得，我们该避开那棵树？毕竟仪式是神圣的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_41b382b9:

    # f "Then it is settled."
    f "那就这么定了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d26ee822:

    # r "I had just held a village-wide vote, and now I let one person to deal with the matter of two."
    r "我刚刚才举行了全村投票，现在却让一个人来处理两方之间的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_219f4bac:

    # r "Fine. [e], I will have you know I am not happy with this decision."
    r "好吧。[e]，我得让你知道，我对这个决定并不满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_8ea4d5ca:

    # e "I think, the boundary is here for a reason, the Lusterfolks should travel freely?"
    e "我觉得，这道边界存在自有原因。卢斯特菲尔德人就该自由通行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_77c930e0:

    # r "Great, now we can move on."
    r "好，那我们继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_60f2c15e:

    # f "If this is the will of [e], then it shall be."
    f "若这是[e]的意愿，那便如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_17960b6e:

    # r "It is the will of my village."
    r "这是我们村子的意愿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a9189709:

    # f "I suppose we can arrange a puppet show for your curious villagers while we are at it."
    f "既然如此，我想我们也可以为你们那些好奇的村民安排一场木偶戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_40889bae:

    # f "Now, we shall discuss the matter of trade route. It was left unsettled at the beginning of our discussion."
    f "现在，我们来讨论贸易路线的问题吧。讨论开始时，这件事还没有定下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_baf2925c:

    # f "I reckon [e] is familiar with it already?"
    f "我想[e]已经对此很熟悉了吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c2fdca5a:

    # "You shake your head, you had been trailing off to your daydreams while the two were talking, not a single word about the trade had you recalled."
    "你摇了摇头。两人交谈时，你早已神游天外，关于贸易的事情一个字也没记住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d18fdea9:

    # "Furkan and Rahim look at each other with a puzzled face, before returning to you with folded brows."
    "弗坎和雷希姆困惑地面面相觑，随后皱着眉头重新看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_dda444e9:

    # f "First of all, we are grateful for [e] and the red bear's effort to restore the bridge, it helps reinstating our route quickly."
    f "首先，我们感谢[e]和红熊为修复桥梁所作的努力，这让我们能够迅速恢复这条路线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_646e6871:

    # f "First of all, the bridge shall be restored, we will both share the cost equally."
    f "首先，桥梁必须修复，我们两方平摊费用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ec19e65c:

    # f "Rahim here suggested Lusterfield should receive our flowing water regularly, while we may receive... some of his fabric, made from our people's sheddings."
    f "雷希姆提议，卢斯特菲尔德应当定期获得我们的流动水源，而我们则可以得到……一些由我们族人脱落之物制成的布料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1ef25087:

    # r "It's the only thing we can offer here. You had rejected my other proposals."
    r "这已经是我们能提供的唯一东西了。你拒绝了我其他的提议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b90f1b63:

    # f "We have our own seamster here, Rahim. I have heard your tailor skills were exquisite, but I don't see how I would sacrifice our sacred water for it."
    f "我们这里也有自己的裁缝，雷希姆。我听说你的裁缝手艺精湛，但我实在看不出为何要为此牺牲我们的圣水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_0f8dd8a5:

    # r "Weren't your people practicing magicless battles? I am sure some of you can live without magic."
    r "你们的人不是在进行无魔法战斗吗？我相信你们当中有些人可以过没有魔法的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_588d91b7:

    # r "Lusterfield is not known for arcane mastery, or healing, but it should be helpful for when hard times come."
    r "卢斯特菲尔德不以奥术造诣或治疗能力闻名，但在艰难时期应该能派上用场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_eb59821b:

    # f "I understand your concerns, Rahim, but I think the flowing water is too important for us to give up."
    f "我理解你的顾虑，雷希姆，但我认为流动的水对我们来说太重要了，不能放弃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_21770d0c:

    # r "Do you want to give up the flowing water, or do you want to give up the alliance?"
    r "你是想放弃流动的水，还是想放弃联盟？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_19424ccc:

    # "Rahim's voice is stern, as he looks at Furkan with a piercing gaze."
    "雷希姆的声音很严厉；他以锐利的目光注视着弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_70671b58:

    # f "It seems we both cannot reach a conclusion..."
    f "看来我们两人都无法达成结论……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_59d3e095:

    # r "Fine, a vote. If we can even call it."
    r "好吧，投票决定。前提是这还能算投票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_8c1db900:

    # "Rahim has grown impatient, he crosses his arm silently while waiting for your decision."
    "雷希姆已经有些不耐烦了，他默默抱起双臂，等待你的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_e3b6c90e:

    # r "I concur that we would need a third vote."
    r "我同意，我们需要第三票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_e42fbf35:

    # "You look up to see Furkan stare at you intently."
    "你抬起头，看到弗坎正目不转睛地盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1ee82eaa:

    # e "Uhm..." nointeract
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f8a01e31:

    # e "I agree that Lusterfield might need the flowing water."
    e "我同意，卢斯特菲尔德或许需要流动的水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_8098b237:

    # r "That makes us two votes."
    r "那我们就是两票了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a59b0407:

    # f "[e], is this what you truly wish? I find it hard to believe such an abundant village full of resources would need our only reserve here."
    f "[e]，这真的是你的心愿吗？我很难相信，一个资源如此丰富的村子会需要我们在这里唯一的储备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1c1138f0:

    # e "I am sorry, Furkan. This is what I think is best for both tribe."
    e "对不起，弗坎。我认为这样对两个部族都最好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_92c55ba7:

    # "Furkan's eyes meet yours as you raise your head, but you quickly avert your gaze."
    "你抬起头时，弗坎的目光与你相遇，但你很快移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_dab18688:

    # f "I suppose that is only fair, before we run out of flowing water for the both of us."
    f "我想这也算公平，免得我们双方的流动水源都用光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3c29ff9d:

    # e "Maybe you should trade something that's less scarce for both tribes? Like horehounds?"
    e "也许你们该拿对双方来说都没那么稀缺的东西来交易？比如苦薄荷？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_54018f2b:

    # f "Horehound is not as useful for Rahim, we volunteer to confer our wool to Lusterfield, it should sweeten the pot enough."
    f "苦薄荷对雷希姆没那么有用。我们愿意把羊毛交给流光镇，这应该足以让这笔交易更有吸引力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1c181f65:

    # r "You are sabotaging your own homeland, [e]. I hope you remember that when you sleep on our land tonight."
    r "你这是在破坏自己的家园，[e]。希望你今晚睡在我们的土地上时，还记得这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b93ae93a:

    # r "Fine, at least my people won't starve without some special water."
    r "好吧，至少没有那种特别的水，我的族人也不会饿死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_eecca430:

    # "The hut quickly descends into silence once more as Rahim record the ruling."
    "雷希姆记录下裁决时，棚屋里很快又陷入了寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_869e1f42:

    # f "Remember, tend to both sides' need, [e]."
    f "记住，要顾及双方的需要，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_db1197b1:

    # "Furkan puts down his hands, as he begins to address the room sternly."
    "弗坎放下双手，开始严肃地对屋里众人讲话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_4e34eea7:

    # f "Before the next subject begins, [e]. I need you to understand, this is not a time for personal feelings."
    f "在开始下一个议题前，[e]。我希望你明白，现在不是感情用事的时候。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ce96c1ee:

    # f "I understand that you have a kind heart, which is why both of us had agreed to give you the third vote in this meeting."
    f "我知道你心地善良，所以我们两人都同意在这次会议上把第三票交给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_967ca5f2:

    # f "But today, the fates of the two tribes are in your hand, please do not mistake your choice as a test of affection to any of us."
    f "但今天，两个部族的命运掌握在你手中，请不要把你的选择误认为是在考验你对我们任何一方的感情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3b5bdbc6:

    # "You nod silently."
    "你默默地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d65b4755:

    # r "I suggest you stop harassing [e], and let him have a judgement of his own, little whelp."
    r "我建议你别再纠缠[e]，让他自己做判断，小崽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_657e9941:

    # "Rahim adjusts his seat as he takes a deep breath."
    "雷希姆调整了一下座位，深吸了一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_620b5f4a:

    # r "The next subject - guards. My people are not trained, I proposed the goats should send a few of your guards or huntsmen to station in our village."
    r "下一个议题——守卫。我的族人没有受过训练，我提议山羊族派几名守卫或猎人驻扎在我们村子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1a094cad:

    # r "Our observatory is free for your goats to use, we will use the tower as an access point from your own outpost."
    r "我们的天文台可以免费供你们山羊族使用，我们会把这座塔作为从你们前哨站进入的通道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_660b86f2:

    # f "It is not necessary, Rahim, we already have huntsmen warding the ancient tree. You are spreading my men thin if we are to be on guard everywhere."
    f "没必要，雷希姆，我们已经有猎人在守卫那棵古树了。如果我们要处处设防，你会让我的人手捉襟见肘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f14c548f:

    # f "I suggest you begin to train your men, or the swordmaster wolf could undergo another stealth mission of his to solve all problems."
    f "我建议你们开始训练自己的族人，不然那位剑术主人狼又可以执行一次他的潜行任务，一举解决所有问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b240923a:

    # r "Right, if you had listened like I told you to, you'd know we are recruiting young lads either way. Still, I must commend that your people are more versed in defending, which is my I needed them."
    r "对，我不是早就告诉过你了吗？要是你听了，就该知道无论如何我们都在招募年轻小伙子。不过，我得称赞一下，你们的人更精通防卫，这正是我需要他们的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_051defcb:

    # "Furkan nods."
    "弗坎点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f48abc80:

    # f "Regretfully, it seems [e] has to make the decision again."
    f "遗憾的是，看来又得由[e]来做决定了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_038ebb53:

    # "Rahim smirks, as he raises Haskell's biscuits to his mouth."
    "雷希姆咧嘴一笑，把哈斯克尔的饼干举到嘴边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_da60e1f5:

    # f "You have fought with my men, courier. You have seen their weariness. Please, make the right decision."
    f "信使，你曾与我的人并肩作战，也见过他们的疲惫。请做出正确的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_970a2c42:

    # f "Shall we leave the choice to [e]?"
    f "把选择权交给[e]，如何？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_220a442e:

    # "Rahim begrudgely shifts his attention to you again."
    "雷希姆不情愿地再次将注意力转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a589896c:

    # r "Don't leave your home defenseless."
    r "别让你的家园毫无防备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_afc7c573:

    # e "Let me think..." nointeract
    e "让我想想……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_2443e6c5:

    # e "I agree that Lusterfield needs capable guards. Since it resides in much of an open field."
    e "我同意卢斯特菲尔德需要能干的守卫，毕竟那里大多是一片开阔地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c1b63bfc:

    # e "If enemies were to invade Lusterfield, they would find the task much easier as compared to the forest."
    e "如果敌人入侵卢斯特菲尔德，相比森林，他们会觉得在那里行动容易得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ead9b76d:

    # e "Perhaps the goats can share a few of them?"
    e "或许山羊那边能分出几名守卫？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_78c6b3cc:

    # r "Yes, they can."
    r "可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_49588c57:

    # "Furkan looks at you, his eyes are soft and warm as he nods."
    "弗坎看着你，点头时双眼柔和而温暖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f1d9878f:

    # f "It is only fair, we shall send our guards to Lusterfield."
    f "这样才公平，我们会派守卫去卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d3e3e81d:

    # "You turn your head towards Furkan, expecting to see the face of disappointment, but he only nods. You can hardly discern his expression."
    "你转头看向弗坎，本以为会看到失望的神情，却只见他点了点头。你几乎分辨不出他的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_13beef3e:

    # f "I suppose so."
    f "我想也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_caa7a64d:

    # e "I believe we can defend ourselves enough, it doesn't make sense to send guards without any threats."
    e "我相信我们有足够的自卫能力，在没有任何威胁的情况下派出守卫并不合理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_045e09fd:

    # r "Nonsense, [e]. You don't need to see a monster killing innocents in front of you to know they exist. Shall we wait until the foes come knocking on our front door?"
    r "胡说，[e]。你不必亲眼看见怪物在面前杀害无辜，才能知道它们确实存在。难道要等敌人找上门来，我们才行动吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d0d91ffa:

    # "You feign a sliver of contemplation, in truth you understand the importance of defense."
    "你假装露出一丝思索之色，实际上心里明白防御的重要性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_7ae7b6a3:

    # e "I just thought we should maintain balance between the two factions."
    e "我只是觉得，我们应该维持两个派系之间的平衡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_dd39d59c:

    # r "Fine, I now know you have [e] on your side, Furkan."
    r "好吧，我现在知道你有[e]站在你这边了，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c5b639de:

    # r "Fair. We will train our own guards soon enough."
    r "也好。我们很快就会训练自己的守卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9074ab2b:

    # f "I am glad we have reached an agreement, Rahim. I am sure our people will be happy to hear the news."
    f "很高兴我们达成了协议，雷希姆。我相信我们的族人听到这个消息一定会很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_2c336375:

    # "Before your sentence ends, Furkan tilts his head slightly to the side, as he raises his hand to stop you."
    "你的话还没说完，弗坎便微微歪了歪头，同时抬手示意你停下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d1e3f3b7:

    # f "We are grateful for your decision."
    f "我们感谢你的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_48f04d32:

    # r "Enough! I will not let my people be defenseless, Furkan. I will not let you have your way just because [e] is infatuated with your kind."
    r "够了！我不会让我的族人毫无防备，弗坎。也不会因为[e]迷恋你们这一族，就任由你称心如意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_811ae6b9:

    # "Rahim shouts as he slams his fist on the table, addressing Furkan but his eyes are locked into yours."
    "雷希姆一边怒吼，一边把拳头砸在桌上，话是对着弗坎说的，目光却死死锁定在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_46691d78:

    # f "I am sorry, but our courier here has his reasonings, we both shall respect his decision."
    f "抱歉，不过我们这位信使自有他的理由，我们都该尊重他的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_34bb17ad:

    # "The air is tense, as you feel the weight of the two leaders' gaze on you."
    "空气紧张得令人窒息，你感受到了两位首领目光中的分量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d0733fed:

    # e "I thought it's better for both sides, Rahim."
    e "我觉得这样对双方都更好，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b1bb2f3c:

    # r "I don't care what you think, [e]. Keep my people away from the tree, fine, keep the flowing water, fine. But I am not letting you strip my village naked of its defense."
    r "我不在乎你怎么想，[e]。让我的人离那棵树远点，行；保留流动的水，行。但我不会让你剥夺我村子的所有防卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c2280d46:

    # f "Rahim, if you are so intent on your cause, I am sure you could have persuaded [e] better before he made his decision."
    f "雷希姆，既然你如此执着于自己的立场，我相信你本可以在他做出决定前更好地说服[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1fca8401:

    # r "He knows nothing! I can't have someone like him decide the future of our people, and yours."
    r "他什么都不懂！我不能让这样的人决定我们人民和你们人民的未来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_535ac60b:

    # f "One thing my father taught me, was to always keep true to my words, if I ever wanted someone to trust me."
    f "父亲教会我的一件事，就是如果想让别人信任自己，就必须始终信守诺言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6576c2e9:

    # f "we both had accepted [e] into the discussion, I believe our words shall hold weight here."
    f "既然我们都让[e]参与了这场讨论，我相信我们的话在这里应当有分量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_071267a0:

    # r "Here's another lesson. You either accept my terms, or we are done. You goats have no real leverage against us."
    r "再给你上一课。你要么接受我的条件，要么我们就此作罢。你们这些山羊对我们根本没有讨价还价的筹码。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_965e581c:

    # "The bull stands up, as he pushes the chair back, his eyes are locked into Furkan's."
    "那头公牛起身把椅子向后一推，目光紧锁着弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_63fa9ca3:

    # f "Then I am afraid we cannot proceed with the pact."
    f "那么，恐怕这份协定无法继续下去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6f369a1b:

    # r "...You are willing to sacrifice the goods of your people, for something your father couldn't even abide?"
    r "……你愿意牺牲自己人民的物资，就为了某件连你父亲都无法容忍的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d2ade817:

    # f "I am abiding by the people I want to trust, if we were to form an alliance, it shall be ever-lasting, just as you said."
    f "我会坚持选择自己愿意信任的人；如果要结成联盟，就应当像你说的那样，永世长存。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6af6b52c:

    # "Though Furkan silently trembles in front of the mad bull, he has mostly kept his composure. The voice is calm as he speaks."
    "尽管弗坎在这头疯狂的公牛面前暗自发抖，他大体仍保持着镇定。开口时，声音依旧平静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_5ebfea40:

    # f "It is but my pitiful wish for you to trust my words as much as I do yours."
    f "我不过是卑微地希望，你能像我信任你的话一样信任我的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_47e1d6ce:

    # "For a moment, Rahim's eyes soften, the anger in his eyes fades away as he looks at Furkan on a new light."
    "片刻间，雷希姆的目光柔和下来，眼中的怒意也渐渐消退；他仿佛换了种眼光看待弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_801dc515:

    # r "Your elegant words are nothing but a poor excuse to your foolish ambitions, Furkan."
    r "你华丽的言辞，不过是为你愚蠢野心找的拙劣借口，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f889bc5c:

    # f "My duty outweighs my ambition, Rahim."
    f "我的职责比我的野心更重要，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d3b9074a:

    # r "At least you've grown a spine since the last we spoke. It's a rare sight these days. I put my trust more in an ally who stands his ground than a spineless porcupine who sways where the wind goes."
    r "至少自从我们上次交谈以来，你终于有了点骨气。这年头可真难得。我更信任一个立场坚定的盟友，而不是一只没有脊梁、随风摇摆的豪猪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_57dd22d5:

    # "The bull sits back down as he takes a deep breath, before you notice his side glance."
    "那头公牛重新坐下，深吸了一口气；随后你注意到他瞥向一旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_42030fab:

    # r "You've been silent for a while. What do you think?"
    r "你已经沉默了一阵子了。你怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f00872c2:

    # e "Well, it's quite stressful for me to weigh in on the pacts all by myself. I am just a courier after all."
    e "嗯，要我一个人对这些协定发表意见，压力实在很大。毕竟我只是个信使。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c5b795b5:

    # r "And it should stay that way."
    r "而且就该一直如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ba443c22:

    # "Rahim lifts his eyes away, nodding indifferently."
    "雷希姆移开目光，漠然地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d3f0afc4:

    # r "If I hadn't known you, you'd be banished into the wilderness the first time you sided with the goats."
    r "要不是我认识你，你第一次站到山羊那边时，就会被放逐到荒野。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_2d88b2c7:

    # r "I will allow it, your goats can stay wherever you like, but no more decisions from [e]."
    r "我允许了。你们的山羊可以随意留在任何地方，但今后不许再让[e]参与决策。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b3e6b9ab:

    # f "Of course, Rahim. You will find nothing but loyalty from my people."
    f "当然，雷希姆。我的族人只会对你忠心耿耿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_0be10b36:

    # "You went silent again as they continue to finalise the pact without any of your input, it also doesn't help that."
    "他们继续在完全不听取你意见的情况下敲定协定，而你也再次陷入了沉默，偏偏还……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_696317b5:

    # "Nonetheless, you breathe a sigh of relief seeing Rahim lean closer to the table. He may still hold a grudge, but at least you are exempt from any hard decisions."
    "尽管如此，看到雷希姆朝桌边靠近，你还是松了口气。他或许仍然心怀芥蒂，但至少你不用再面对任何艰难的决策了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1d3d3914:

    # "It was not long before Rahim has completed writing the pact, he lets Furkan read over every line, before signing both their names on the corner of the paper."
    "没过多久，雷希姆便写完了协定。他让弗坎逐行查看，随后在纸张一角签下了两人的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3a049aa2:

    # "Rahim puts down the cup and pushes himself away from the table. He barely looks at you, as he paces around Haskell's hut."
    "雷希姆放下杯子，起身离开桌边。他几乎没看你一眼，便在哈斯克尔的小屋里踱起步来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b55544a7:

    # r "This is all we have to discuss today."
    r "今天就谈到这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c28667f5:

    # "The ram nods, as he stands up and offers his hand to Rahim."
    "公羊点了点头，站起身来，向雷希姆伸出手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_149ac1da:

    # f "Thank you, for putting everything all behind us. I am sure our people will be happy to hear the news."
    f "谢谢你愿意让这一切都成为过去。我相信，我们的族人听到这个消息一定会很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_bf9e8d6c:

    # "A brief silence fills the room, as Rahim takes the hand and shakes it firmly."
    "雷希姆握住那只手，用力一握，房间里陷入了短暂的寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b57d6bdf:

    # r "The establishment of the pact is not over. We'll meet again in the village next time."
    r "协定的订立还没有结束。下次我们会在村子里再见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f9f0bc92:

    # "Rahim stands up again, carrying the journal and the completed pact with him. He turns back, a gaze quickly meets your eyes."
    "雷希姆再次起身，带上了那本日志和已经完成的协定。他转过身，目光迅速与你对上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b96783da:

    # r "Come, [e]."
    r "过来，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_0604cedc:

    # "You rabidly leap over the chairs, Furkan gives you a nod before you begin following the old bull, closely."
    "你迫不及待地跨过椅子，弗坎朝你点了点头，你便紧紧跟在那头老公牛身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_4d0460e0:

    # e "What is it, Rahim?"
    e "怎么了，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_8403f08b:

    # r "We're heading back to Lusterfield."
    r "我们正要回卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_af4ebffe:

    # "Rahim says calmly as he pushes open the door. His tone is more like a command than a request."
    "雷希姆平静地说着，同时推开了门。他的语气更像是在命令，而不是请求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_65d7ba53:

    # "You notice Haskell and Kari sitting in the garden outside, the dark dragon seems to be enjoying his tea with closed eyes."
    "你注意到哈斯克尔和卡里正坐在外面的花园里，那条黑龙闭着眼睛，似乎正享受着他的茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_edbb717e:

    # "Your attention shifts to the deer noticing the two of you, silently staring with wider eyes, as if pleading to be rescued from another second of sitting with the tea master."
    "你的注意力转向那头鹿。它注意到了你们两个，正睁大双眼默默地盯着你们，仿佛在恳求你把它从与那位茶师多坐一秒的煎熬中解救出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_277ef0fe:

    # "Strangely, you chuckle at the goat general's misery, before Rahim takes notice. One side eyes from him is enough for you to turn back to the front."
    "不知怎么的，看到羊族将军的苦难，你竟然轻笑起来，直到雷希姆注意到了这一点。他只需从侧面瞥你一眼，你便立刻转回前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_337eb791:

    # "The road ahead is quiet, all you can hear is the occassional panting coming from Rahim. You have trodded the same path many times, though not as often with the old bull ahead."
    "前方的道路一片寂静，你唯一能听见的，只有雷希姆偶尔传来的喘息声。这条路你已经走过许多次了，只是很少有那头老公牛走在前面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d7ecce66:

    # "His sweat has soaked through the old rag covering his body, your gaze always gravitates towards his brawny back, stretching out sometimes as he strains his muscles."
    "汗水浸透了覆盖在他身上的旧破布。你总是不由自主地将目光投向他那结实的背部，看着他绷紧肌肉时偶尔伸展的身躯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c9a2f065:

    # "Sometimes you wonder if he has intentionally kept himself unkempt, for a experienced tailor like him, you'd think he has an eye for fashion."
    "有时你会怀疑，他是不是故意让自己显得邋遢。像他这样经验丰富的裁缝，你本以为他应该很有时尚眼光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1430cced:

    # "Perhaps this is his fashion, the musty old garments, with tawny cloth draped over his soft fur, you'd have swear you could squeeze out some water from that drenched fabric."
    "或许这就是他的时尚吧：身上穿着散发霉味的旧衣服，黄褐色的布料披在柔软的皮毛上。那块湿透的布，你敢发誓，简直都能拧出水来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b93c9de3:

    # "By now you expect Rahim to say something, it's not a common ordeal to just walking silently, other folks would have been bored enough to at least ask about the weather."
    "到了现在，你已经在等雷希姆开口了。就这么一路默默走着，可不是什么常见的经历；换作其他人，早就无聊到至少问问天气了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9edf8bf7:

    # "When you arrive to Lusterfield again, you have gotten so used to the peacefulness, he'd almost spooked you away when he turns around in front of his house."
    "你再次来到卢斯特菲尔德时，已经习惯了这里的宁静；他在自家门前转身时，差点把你吓得掉头离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_46acb57b:

    # r "You can go now, [e]."
    r "你现在可以走了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_13196834:

    # e "W-what was that all about...? I thought you were mad at me."
    e "刚、刚才那是怎么回事……？我还以为你在生我的气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_b5ace07d:

    # r "I wasn't."
    r "我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_58248af6:

    # "His answer is so concise and calm, it left you speechless before the bovine man."
    "他的回答简短而平静，让你面对这名牛族男子时一时说不出话来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9c2363be:

    # r "Come to see me for the next meeting."
    r "下次会面时，来见我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_6f2aff82:

    # "You didn't get to respond before he slams the door shut, only leaving a gust of air that softly blows on your snout."
    "你还没来得及回应，他便砰地关上了门，只留下一阵气流，轻轻拂过你的鼻吻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_75d70f02:

    # "Rahim stands up again, carrying the journal and the completed pact with him. The room falls into silence again as he walks out."
    "雷希姆再次起身，带着日志和完成的协议离开。随着他走出去，房间再次陷入寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_a4987802:

    # f "I hope I had not embarrassed myself, or noticeably so."
    f "希望我没有让自己出丑，至少没有明显出丑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_cf5a3fe3:

    # e "You did fine, Furkan."
    e "你做得很好，弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_3b8ee64c:

    # f "Not without your aid. Surely. I could not fare so well by myself."
    f "没有你的帮助当然不行。那是肯定的。我自己绝不可能做得这么好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_854c78a1:

    # f "But as a leader, you have to please everyone-"
    f "但作为领袖，你得让所有人都满意——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c8eeb5ff:

    # "Furkan stops himself before continuing, his cheeks burns red."
    "弗坎在继续说下去前及时住了口，脸颊涨得通红。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_456eb707:

    # f "What I meant was, A leader has to take it from all sides-"
    f "我的意思是，领袖必须从四面八方承受——"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_58468331:

    # "Another pause compels him to stammer, peeking at your direction. You are sure that it's merely accident, the chief would make a much subtler suggestions, if he were to tease you."
    "又一阵停顿让他结结巴巴起来，他偷偷瞥向你这边。你确信那纯粹只是口误；如果酋长真想逗你，肯定会暗示得隐晦得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ee5cd377:

    # f "I had begun myself badly. The crux of the matter is with the negotiation, Lusterfield and us, we are used to bargaining advantages back and forth."
    f "我一开始就说糟了。关键在于谈判：我们和卢斯特菲尔德都习惯于来回讨价还价、互相争取利益。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_eb932d33:

    # f "Sometimes you take, sometimes you give. It is the trading that fortifies our alliance."
    f "有时你取，有时你给。正是这种交换巩固了我们的联盟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_89e73306:

    # e "You aren't happy that I took your side?"
    e "你不高兴我站在你这边？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_528245bb:

    # f "I am not happy that our ally stormed off his proposed meeting. This is not a good start at all."
    f "我不高兴的是，我们的盟友竟从他自己提议的会面中拂袖而去。这可一点都不是个好的开始。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_f97af85c:

    # "Furkan looks away, his face sterner than a disappointed elder."
    "弗坎移开视线，脸色比失望的长老还要严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_cac9067e:

    # e "Sorry."
    e "抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_03647f47:

    # f "I am glad we have reached an agreement, [e]. I am sure our people will be happy to hear the news."
    f "我很高兴我们达成了协议，[e]。我相信我们的人听到这个消息会很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_7a4e17a9:

    # f "You have done well today, [e]. I am both surprised and grateful for your presence."
    f "你今天做得很好，[e]。你的出现既让我惊讶，也让我感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_ac06ab24:

    # f "I sometimes wonder about your role in this world, but today you have proven to be a valuable asset to both of us."
    f "我有时会思考你在这个世界上的角色，但今天你证明了自己对我们双方而言都是一项宝贵的助力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_5d348902:

    # e "Thank you, Furkan. I am just doing what I think is right."
    e "谢谢你，弗坎。我只是在做我认为正确的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_dc059b42:

    # f "And that is all we need from you, [e]."
    f "这就是我们需要你做的全部了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_9a750ee3:

    # "Furkan stands up, as he offers his hand to you. You take it soon as he shakes your hand firmly."
    "弗坎站起身，向你伸出手。你随即握住他的手，他用力地与你相握。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_4e412ccd:

    # "And quickly he raises your hand, as his head leans down to kiss it tenderly."
    "他迅速抬起你的手，低下头温柔地吻了吻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_75e465e5:

    # f "I will see you for the second meeting."
    f "我们第二次会面时见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_e707f5fc:

    # "You nod, as you watch him walk out of the hut."
    "你点了点头，看着他走出小屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_06c3e5fe:

    # "You are left alone in the hut, the warmth of the tea still lingers in the air."
    "小屋里只剩下你一人，茶水的暖意仍在空气中萦绕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_331a51ec:

    # h "How's the thing? You three got along well?"
    h "事情怎么样？你们三个相处得还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_fd201789:

    # "You turn around to see Haskell standing at the door, a warm smile on his face."
    "你转过身，看见哈斯克尔站在门口，脸上挂着温暖的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_e756903b:

    # h "I heard you three were having a heated discussion, I thought I should come in and check on you."
    h "我听说你们三个刚才讨论得很激烈，所以想进来看看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_5e3926ac:

    # e "It was... interesting."
    e "挺……有意思的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_8ceab23d:

    # h "Interesting? That's a good word for it. I thought that angry bull was ready to waste my tea on little Furkan's face."
    h "有意思？这个词用得好。我还以为那头暴怒的公牛要把我的茶泼到小弗坎脸上了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_1c82e49c:

    # e "I think they are getting along now."
    e "我想他们现在相处得还不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_d3ed3071:

    # h "Good, good. Now that you are done, I can finally have my tea in peace."
    h "很好，很好。既然你们聊完了，我终于可以安安静静地喝茶了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_c2147849:

    # "You chuckle, as you watch Haskell pour himself a cup of chamomile tea. He then stares at you as if you've forgotten something."
    "你轻笑着，看着哈斯克尔给自己倒了一杯洋甘菊茶。随后，他盯着你，仿佛你忘了什么似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Rahim_Pact_eb95742d:

    # "You quickly excuse yourself, as you walk out of the hut."
    "你赶紧告辞，走出了小屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_85f7a355:

    # "You notice the planks on the supposed longhouse is now pried open, probably at the hands of Amble."
    "你注意到那座所谓长屋的木板已经被撬开了，大概是安布干的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_0bfc80ef:

    # "Just as you are about to open the door, you notice a familiar figure, trodding towards your direction."
    "正当你要开门时，你注意到一个熟悉的身影正朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_b94ac89c:

    # s "Hey hey, [e]. Is that the house thing? Mayor's longhouse? It doesn't seem that long, honestly."
    s "嘿嘿，[e]。那就是那个房子？市长的长屋？说实话，看起来也没那么长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_b5f08608:

    # e "Yeah, I don't know, I have never been inside before."
    e "嗯，我也不知道，我以前从没进去过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_e17bfe57:

    # s "Well, I guess it is a longhouse, but it doesn't look like a house at all."
    s "嗯，我想它确实算是长屋，但看起来根本不像房子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_594aa0ac:

    # s "This house's been here before I even came to Lusterfield, it's the first time I hear someone calls it a Mayor's house."
    s "这房子在我来到卢斯特菲尔德之前就已经在这儿了，我还是第一次听人叫它市长的房子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_bcd8a80e:

    # "You chuckle, as you watch the lion push open the wooden door, leading both of you inside the abandoned building."
    "你轻笑着，看着那头狮子推开木门，带着你们两个走进这栋废弃的建筑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_f34a6e7b:

    # "You find yourself in the old mayor's longhouse. Rahim is sitting on the chair at the center, his eyes are fixed on the journal in his hand."
    "你发现自己来到了老市长的长屋。雷希姆坐在中央的椅子上，目光紧盯着手中的日志。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_a4c1c231:

    # "Sebas looks around the dusty room, there's dust everywhere, even in the air."
    "塞巴斯环顾这间尘土飞扬的房间，四处都是灰尘，连空气中也不例外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_3204cebc:

    # s "This place is in a desperate shortage of Ole... He's gonna get a kick out of cleaning these walls."
    s "这地方缺奥利缺得厉害……清理这些墙壁肯定够他乐的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_c5f3d32b:

    # f "Good day, [e]. This is the longhouse we are supposed to meet, was I correct?"
    f "日安，[e]。这里就是我们约好见面的长屋，对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_b5f08608_1:

    # e "Yeah, I don't know, I have never been inside before."
    e "嗯，我也不清楚，我以前从没进去过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_4e059b13:

    # "You frowned, it feels weird to see Furkan in Lusterfield, weirder that he is not accompanied by the general."
    "你皱起眉头，看到弗坎出现在卢斯特菲尔德已经够奇怪了，更奇怪的是将军竟然没有陪在他身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_93e76bb1:

    # e "Weren't you supposed to be with the general?"
    e "你不是应该和将军在一起吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_cfc0ca36:

    # f "Worry not, courier, I sneaked out, Kari will never approve of my travel alone, and he did not wish to be here."
    f "别担心，信使，是我偷偷溜出来的。卡里绝不会同意我独自出行，而且他也不想来这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_a05ee701:

    # "Furkan feints a weak smile, it makes you wonder if Kari even knew about the last time he was here."
    "弗坎勉强挤出一丝微笑，让你不禁怀疑卡里是否知道他上次来这里的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_89c053a3:

    # f "Shall we make this meeting quick?"
    f "我们能不能尽快结束这次会面？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_34976afb:

    # "Before you respond, the goat chief pushes open the wooden door, leading both of you inside the abandoned building."
    "还没等你回答，山羊族长便推开木门，带着你们两人走进那栋废弃的建筑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_f34a6e7b_1:

    # "You find yourself in the old mayor's longhouse. Rahim is sitting on the chair at the center, his eyes are fixed on the journal in his hand."
    "你来到老市长的长屋。雷希姆正坐在中央的椅子上，目光紧盯着手中的日记。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_4f0c98b3:

    # "Furkan looks around the dusty room, his maw hangs agape."
    "弗坎环顾着满是灰尘的房间，惊讶得张大了嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_5994a87a:

    # f "I am grateful to be here, Rahim. But you misconstrued my aptitude for the ancients. I am not sure if this place is safe to be in, let alone to discuss our alliance."
    f "雷希姆，能来到这里我很感激。不过，你误判了我研究古代人的能力。我不确定这里是否安全，更别说在此讨论我们的联盟了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_8bdd5c69:

    # e "What is this place, Rahim?"
    e "雷希姆，这是什么地方？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_413a356d:

    # "Rahim looks up, his eyes are fixed on you. You can see a hint of amusement in his eyes, as he puts down the old book."
    "雷希姆抬起头，目光落在你身上。放下那本旧书时，你能看到他眼中浮现出一丝笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_4289b732:

    # r "It's the old mayor's longhouse, where they meet and discuss matters of importance."
    r "这是老市长的长屋，他们会在这里会面，商议重要的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_364acf90:

    # s "That old mayor surely didn't have a long life breathing in those thick dust, did he?"
    s "那位老市长整天吸入这么厚的灰尘，肯定没活多久吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_fc88e84d:

    # f "Old Mayor? Then it must be very important. Why is this place even abandoned in the first place?"
    f "老市长？那这里一定非常重要。可这里当初为什么会被废弃？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_fc2f62c1:

    # r "The last mayor to set foot in here, Stadfel, he died peacefully in his sleep... ages ago, before I was even born."
    r "最后一位踏足这里的市长名叫斯塔德费尔，他在睡梦中安详地去世了……那已经是很久以前的事，在我出生之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_2692bae5:

    # r "As it had been a peaceful death, he did not leave anything behind, nor a choice for the next mayor."
    r "既然他是安详离世的，就什么也没留下，也没有为下一任市长留下人选。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_9bd88067:

    # r "Election was attemped to be hold, but each candidate... faced inexplicable misfortunes, it was the reason why we had no mayor for the better part of the history."
    r "我们曾试图举行选举，但每位候选人……都遭遇了无法解释的灾祸，这就是我们历史上大半时间没有市长的原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_0ae9bcd0:

    # ""
    ""

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_09786e0b:

    # r "Back to the matter at hand, this journal. I found it when I was cleaning the old mayor's longhouse, fell from the cracked wooden planks."
    r "说回正题，这本日记。我清理老市长的长屋时发现了它，它是从开裂的木板间掉出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_4eed3af0:

    # r "I have read through it, the journal was written by the old mayor himself, it was a record of his daily life, his thoughts, and his plans for the village."
    r "我已经把它通读了一遍。这本日记是老市长亲自写的，记录了他的日常生活、想法，以及他为村子制定的计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_e2cbdb55:

    # r "Towards the end of the journal, he had been investigating the longhouse's moistness problem, the summer rains had been harsh on the buildings."
    r "日记接近末尾时，他一直在调查长屋潮湿的问题，夏季的雨水给这些建筑造成了严重影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_e304b0ba:

    # s "Another history lesson... I am not sure if I can keep up with this."
    s "又是历史课……我不确定自己能不能跟上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_8b71590f:

    # f "I don't see how this is relevant to our discussion, Rahim."
    f "雷希姆，我看不出这和我们的讨论有什么关系。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_0bb0943f:

    # r "Stop moaning and listen, child. He had written about the wooden left wall of the longhouse, where the moss grew almost exclusively on that side."
    r "别嘟囔了，孩子。上面写着长屋左侧的木墙，苔藓几乎只在那一侧生长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_2c919be0:

    # "You look around, the left wall is indeed covered in moss, the wooden walls are damp and the floor is moist, you can smell the horrid stank even from here."
    "你环顾四周，左墙确实爬满了苔藓。木墙湿漉漉的，地面也很潮，哪怕站在这里，你都能闻到那股恶臭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_7df4bce8:

    # "Rahim flips through the pages, before he stops at a certain page, and continues."
    "雷希姆翻阅着书页，直到停在某一页上，才继续说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_d0f52221:

    # r "He had compared the interior of the longhouse to the exterior... and found that there was a hidden space unaccounted for."
    r "他曾将长屋的内部与外部进行对照……发现有一处未被计算在内的隐藏空间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_9f3a17b1:

    # r "Turns out, it was a hidden entrance to an underground temple, he had written that it was much larger than the longhouse itself."
    r "原来那是一座地下神殿的隐藏入口。他写道，神殿本身比长屋大得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_53bdc63c:

    # r "So, there it is. We ought to investigate the temple ourselves, there are much more to the journal than I had told you."
    r "所以，入口就在这里。我们应该亲自去调查那座神殿。况且，这本日志里还有很多内容，我之前没有告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_f2f105ea:

    # "Sebas looks at you, his eyes are wide with excitement."
    "塞巴斯看着你，双眼因兴奋而睁得老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_aa4c3b8a:

    # s "A hidden temple? That sounds amazing! I want to see it!"
    s "隐藏的神殿？听起来太棒了！我想去看看！"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_524fc6c7:

    # r "I don't know, but we have to find out. The mayor had written about a hidden lever that opens the entrance, but he never wrote where it was."
    r "我不知道，但我们必须查个清楚。市长写过，那里有一个能打开入口的隐藏拉杆，可他从没写过拉杆在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_849dc4f4:

    # "Furkan's eyes widen, he looks at you, then back at Rahim."
    "弗坎睁大双眼，先看向你，又回头看向雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_fd8f573b:

    # f "What do you suppose we do with this information, Rahim?"
    f "你觉得我们该怎么利用这个情报，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_196472f0:

    # r "Explore the room ourselves, and I would like for [e] to accompany me."
    r "我们自己去探索这个房间，我希望[e]能陪我一起去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_2eff3ccb:

    # f "What if this was the very thing that killed the old mayor and the other candidates. Would it not be better for you to leave this behind?"
    f "万一正是这东西害死了老市长和其他候选人呢？你是不是最好把这件事抛在脑后？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_0fc04730:

    # r "No. I believe it has to be linked to whoever stole your runes. And, I am done sitting around and waiting for you to find nothing on your own."
    r "不。我认为这一定和偷走你符文的人有关。而且我受够了干坐着等你自己什么也找不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_9d7531a4:

    # f "Then, I should come along as well. As the leader of the goats, I must know what lies in our own temple."
    f "那我也该一起去。作为山羊族的首领，我必须知道我们自己的神殿里究竟有什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_f22c1704:

    # "Rahim doesn't flinch, his gaze looks as if it was expected of him."
    "雷希姆不为所动，目光仿佛早就料到他会这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_f567a94e:

    # r "Why else did I invite you here, chief?"
    r "不然我为什么要邀请你来这里，首领？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_334bb7a0:

    # "His hand sweeps across the table before standing up and walks towards the cabinet at the left wall."
    "他的手掠过桌面，随后起身走向左墙边的柜子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_5a019d8e:

    # r "If the journal is to be believed, the entrance should be here."
    r "如果日志上的内容可信，入口应该就在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_abb2b81a:

    # "He points towards the bookshelf, where the books are stacked neatly. You notice a small gap between the wall and the shelf."
    "他指向那面书架，书本整整齐齐地堆放着。你注意到墙壁和书架之间有一道小缝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_c1f25b47:

    # s "I think I see it too."
    s "我好像也看到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_7144981b:

    # "Sebas walks over to the shelf, and begins to push it, but it doesn't budge, not even with Rahim's help."
    "塞巴斯走到书架前，开始推了起来，可书架纹丝不动，就连雷希姆帮忙也一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_fbcf30c9:

    # s "Come on..."
    s "加油……"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_cd1a027e:

    # "Sebas pushes the shelf again, but it still doesn't move."
    "塞巴斯又推了一下书架，但它还是一动不动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_cdfd04aa:

    # "Rahim shifts to the side to push the shelf, but it doesn't budge. Furkan stares at the shelf, before he walks over to help Rahim."
    "雷希姆挪到一旁推起书架，可它依旧纹丝不动。弗坎盯着书架看了一会儿，随后走过去帮雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_abb84fd8:

    # "The two of them push the shelf together, but it still doesn't move."
    "两人合力推着架子，但它还是纹丝不动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_4a1fa3a6:

    # f "It's stuck."
    f "卡住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_faec40e6:

    # "Rahim takes a step back, as he looks at you."
    "雷希姆后退一步，看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_a2bd7401:

    # r "The mayor had written about finding a hidden lever, but he never wrote where it was."
    r "市长曾写过找到隐藏拉杆的事，却没写它在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_15bd8f16:

    # e "Then, where can we find it?"
    e "那我们要去哪儿找？"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_f5524d19:

    # r "We should look around the longhouse, it's should be here somewhere."
    r "我们该在长屋里找找，它应该就在某个地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Furkan_Enter_Mayor_Longhouse_855eb5ee:

    # "Silence fills the room, as the three of you begin to search the longhouse for any hints."
    "房间里一片寂静，你们三人开始在长屋里寻找线索。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_9bd88067:

    # r "Election was attemped to be hold, but each candidate... faced inexplicable misfortunes, it was the reason why we had no mayor for the better part of the history."
    r "我们曾试着举行选举，但每位候选人……都遭遇了无法解释的不幸，所以历史上大部分时间都没有市长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_6abc8fda:

    # e "Misfortunes?"
    e "不幸？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_e3985dcf:

    # r "Bad omens, some said the candidates were cursed."
    r "凶兆。有人说那些候选人都被诅咒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_b8cc2ea5:

    # r "One of them, the mayor's son, fell ill and became bedridden, plagued by a deadly fever that eventually claimed him."
    r "其中一人是市长的儿子，他病倒后卧床不起，被致命的高烧折磨，最终丢了性命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_3bee35de:

    # r "Another one, the ambitious old steward, he preyed on the title after the son's death. And one day he was found floating face down on the river."
    r "另一个是野心勃勃的老管家，他在那位儿子死后觊觎起市长之位。后来有一天，人们发现他脸朝下漂浮在河面上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_dcebc56d:

    # r "The last one withdrew from the election, but an inconspicable paranoia ate him whole, it was a fate worse than death. But eventually he fled the village and no one saw him since."
    r "最后一人退出了选举，但一种莫名的偏执将他彻底吞噬，那是比死亡更糟糕的命运。最终，他逃离了村子，此后再也没人见过他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_90e32a5f:

    # e "Is this why you were not... the 'mayor'? Because of the curse?"
    e "所以你才没当上……“市长”？是因为诅咒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Ask_Bad_Omens_e65fdb97:

    # r "I am not a mayor. And we had not needed one for decades. If not for the goat's invasion I'd not be taking up as the spokesperson on my village's behalf."
    r "我不是市长。而且我们几十年来都不需要市长。要不是山羊入侵，我也不会代表村子担任发言人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_2620862f:

    # "You shift the cabinet aside, and begin walking towards the underground temple."
    "你把柜子移到一旁，开始朝地下神庙走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_ae1e2492:

    # "The cabinet is filled with various books, scrolls, and other documents, some of them are old and dusty, while others are new and well-kept."
    "柜子里塞满了各种书籍、卷轴和其他文件，其中一些古老积灰，另一些则崭新且保存得很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_16fdc264:

    # "Skimming past the titles, it seems they are mostly about the history of Lusterfield, some of the village's records and the old mayor's personal collection."
    "掠过书名看去，这些大多是关于卢斯特菲尔德历史的书，还有一些村庄记录和老市长的私人收藏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_3be27e84:

    # "The dust on the shelves is thick, except for a few of them, where Rahim had been looking through."
    "书架上的灰尘很厚，只有几格例外，雷希姆之前翻看过那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_eb372aa2:

    # e "Rahim, what are we looking for?"
    e "雷希姆，我们在找什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_cf16d261:

    # r "The old mayor had written about a hidden entrance to an underground temple, it should be somewhere around here."
    r "老市长写过关于通往地下神庙的隐藏入口的事，它应该就在这附近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_b5dcc088:

    # e "What does it look like?"
    e "看起来是什么样的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_13544d1d:

    # "Rahim glances at you for a moment, before continues flipping over the book."
    "雷希姆看了你一会儿，随后继续翻动手中的书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_c8d4ec44:

    # r "Buttons, levers. The mayor hid the entrance well, it should be something that blends in with the wall."
    r "按钮、拉杆。市长把入口藏得很好，它应该和墙壁融为一体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_19fae5c5:

    # e "I see."
    e "我明白了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_2d13db61:

    # e "What about the journal? Can I take a look at it?"
    e "那本日记呢？我能看看吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_664cfd6e:

    # r "Not yet. I will show it to you once we find the entrance."
    r "还不行。等我们找到入口后，我会拿给你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_66928172:

    # "You begin to search the cabinet, looking for any hidden levers or buttons that might open the entrance."
    "你开始搜查柜子，寻找可能打开入口的隐藏拉杆或按钮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Cabinet_ff0c2994:

    # "You find nothing but dust and old books, the cabinet is filled with old scrolls and documents, some of them are written in a language you do not understand."
    "你什么也没找到，只有尘土和旧书。柜子里塞满了古老的卷轴和文件，其中一些是用你看不懂的语言写成的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Planks_bcd8e900:

    # "You notice the wooden planks on the left wall are covered in moss, the wood is damp and the floor is moist."
    "你注意到左侧墙上的木板爬满了苔藓，木头很潮湿，地面也湿漉漉的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Planks_eed2766f:

    # "It seems to be covering a hole, but you can't see anything beyond the moss."
    "它似乎遮住了一个洞，但你看不清苔藓后面有什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_559988a2:

    # "A white parchment settles easily on the table, there are some stains on the cover, and the pages are yellowed."
    "一张白色羊皮纸平铺在桌上，封面上有些污渍，纸页已经泛黄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_c2b0e4ea:

    # "You pick up the parchment, and notice the writing on the first page."
    "你拿起羊皮纸，注意到第一页上的字迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_d65f7500:

    # "It is a rhyme, written in a neat cursive handwriting. The words are written in a black ink, and the letters are large and bold."
    "这是一首押韵诗，用工整的花体字写成。诗句以黑色墨水书写，字母又大又醒目。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_ac2a5e5c:

    # "{i}Five wayfarers wandered under the morning, {p}The horned one paused where the rivers string,{/i}"
    "{i}五名旅人在晨光下漫游，{p}有角者在河流交汇处停留，{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_6be9efa0:

    # "{i}By the edge he pondered the shape, {p}The waters embraced him; and so did the spring.{/i}"
    "{i}他在边缘思索着形状，{p}水流拥抱了他，泉水亦然。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_82d0f065:

    # "{i}Four wayfarers walked as the sun climbed high, {p}The fanged one ventured where the forests sighed,{/i}"
    "{i}四名旅人在太阳升高时前行，{p}有獠牙者走入森林叹息之处，{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_06c0c873:

    # "{i}Drawn to the shadow that howled his name, {p}The woods closed in and the last wail died.{/i}"
    "{i}被那呼喊着他名字的阴影吸引，{p}林木合拢，最后的哀嚎消逝。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_0113a254:

    # "{i}Three wayfarers roamed from the shore, {p}The gilled one swam where the sea has roared,{/i}"
    "{i}三名旅人离开海岸游荡，{p}有鳃者游向大海咆哮之处，{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_322427b4:

    # "{i}Beneath the depth he found his fellows, {p}Gave himself to the harness of the thrall.{/i}"
    "{i}在深处，他找到了同伴，{p}将自己交给奴役的枷锁。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_49e2d88f:

    # "{i}Two wayfarers promised to never stray, {p}But the clawed one climbed where the mountains swayed,{/i}"
    "{i}两名旅人承诺永不走散，{p}但有利爪者攀上了摇撼的群山，{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_4d3ef47a:

    # "{i}He chased the scourge that caused it all, {p}A battle he sought; none lived to see the day.{/i}"
    "{i}他追逐造成这一切的灾祸，{p}寻求一战；无人活着见到那一天。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_3bc7b606:

    # "{i}One wayfarer sprawled across the red dryland, {p}The scaled one listened where the desert scanned,{/i}"
    "{i}一名旅人横卧在赤红的旱地上，{p}有鳞者倾听着沙漠的巡视，{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_01194de0:

    # "{i}A calling, a purpose, from horizons untold, {p}His fate woven before the night ran cold.{/i}"
    "{i}来自未知的地平线，召唤与使命悄然而至，{p}在夜色转冷之前，他的命运便已织就。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_4c70abe4:

    # "You look up to see Rahim and Furkan, their eyes fixated on the parchment."
    "你抬头看去，只见雷希姆和弗坎正盯着羊皮纸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_40dd9620:

    # e "Did the old mayor write this?"
    e "这是老市长写的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_2d9172d1:

    # r "It is a children's rhyme, [e]. Older folks used to sing it when they were younger. I've heard it before."
    r "这是一首童谣，[e]。年长的人们年轻时常唱它。我以前听过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_58f69d68:

    # s "I've heard this one, too. I thought they were playing games... or something."
    s "我也听过这首。我还以为他们是在玩游戏……之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_145b1f65:

    # r "No, most of the children in Lusterfield have forgotten it, the only few who are fortunate enough to hear it probably heard a happier version."
    r "不，大多数孩子都已经忘了这首童谣。少数有幸听到它的孩子，听到的可能是更快乐的版本。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_d434b5e8:

    # "Sebas gulps, as he turns away to inspect the room again."
    "塞巴斯咽了口唾沫，转过身去再次打量房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_055d02c4:

    # f "Strange, I have never heard of it."
    f "奇怪，我从没听说过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_6e3656b3:

    # r "Only the old folks remember it, kids nowadays have forgotten the rhyme. The old mayor must have written it down for his grandchilren."
    r "只有老人们还记得这首韵文，如今的孩子们早已忘了。老市长肯定把它记下来留给自己的孙辈了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_55dd59cf:

    # "Furkan looks at you, then turns away to inspect the room again."
    "弗坎看了你一眼，随后转身再次打量起房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_47e5143a:

    # r "We should look around for more clues, [e]."
    r "我们该四处找找更多线索，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_ae0c3f79:

    # "You look up to see Sebas, he's staring at the rhyme as you do."
    "你抬头看去，发现塞巴斯也正像你一样盯着那首韵文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_3bff1721:

    # s "I swear I have heard this before."
    s "我发誓，我以前肯定听过这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_196f158e:

    # s "I did remember it having to do with how tribes of the wayfarers, but I don't remember the happier version..."
    s "我记得这似乎和漫游者的部族有关，但我不记得那个更欢快的版本了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_7765dbbf:

    # s "I'm starting to regret not taking History lessons seriously."
    s "我开始后悔自己没认真上历史课了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_3135fff7:

    # "You nod, as you put the parchment back on the table."
    "你点点头，把羊皮纸放回桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_c4d69ef5:

    # "You turn around as you finish the rhyme, Rahim seems to be distracted somewhere else, while Furkan slowly walks towards you."
    "你念完韵文后转过身，雷希姆似乎在别处走神，而弗坎正慢慢朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_9ee7d143:

    # f "Do you think this is a clue, [e]?"
    f "你觉得这是线索吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_8a0f094c:

    # e "I am not sure, Furkan. It's just a rhyme."
    e "我不太确定，弗坎。这只是一首韵文。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_3b7d6b28:

    # f "It's a strange rhyme, I didn't expect Lusterfield's children are taught such dark tales."
    f "这首韵文真奇怪，我没想到卢斯特菲尔德的孩子们会被教导这些阴暗的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_3135fff7_1:

    # "You nod, as you put the parchment back on the table."
    "你点点头，把羊皮纸放回桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_6c225c55:

    # e "I wonder what the other wayfarers were doing when they perished one by one."
    e "我在想，其他漫游者一个接一个死去时，都在做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_a035273a:

    # f "Perhaps they were searching for something, or someone."
    f "也许他们当时正在寻找某样东西，或者某个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_b2a36493:

    # "Furkan smiles softly, as he pats your shoulder. But when you turn around, he is already walking away."
    "弗坎轻轻一笑，拍了拍你的肩膀。可你转过身时，他已经走远了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_7773378d:

    # e "Maybe... it has something to do with the weird markings around the house."
    e "也许……这和房子周围那些奇怪的标记有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Rhyme_f8cfc37f:

    # e "The rhyme is written as a sequence, I wonder if it has something to do with the faces around the room."
    e "这首韵文是按顺序写下来的，我在想这是不是和房间四周的那些脸有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_eb978b55:

    # "As you press on the marking, you hear a loud creaking sound, as the bookshelf gives way."
    "当你按下那个标记时，随着书架移开，你听见一阵刺耳的吱嘎声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_967078ce:

    # "Rahim notices the shifting of the cabinet, as he quickly turns around. Furkan's eyes widen as he steps back."
    "雷希姆注意到柜子发生了移动，连忙转过身来。弗坎睁大双眼，向后退了一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_8ce62381:

    # "The bookshelf slides to the side, revealing a dark staircase leading down into the darkness."
    "书架向一旁滑开，露出一段通往黑暗深处的阴暗楼梯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_f70b01cf:

    # "The staircase is narrow, and the steps are steep, it's almost as if it was carved out of the earth itself."
    "楼梯很窄，台阶也很陡，简直就像是直接从大地里凿出来的一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_4dc68e87:

    # s "Whoa! This is amazing! I can't believe we found a secret passage!"
    s "哇！太棒了！真不敢相信我们居然找到了秘密通道！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_0c1b1ee7:

    # "Sebas jumps up and down, his eyes sparkling with excitement."
    "塞巴斯兴奋得上下蹦跳，双眼闪闪发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_5332b5d5:

    # s "What's down there, Rahim?"
    s "下面有什么，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_d6c4e06a:

    # r "The temple. Have you not been listening?"
    r "神殿。你刚才没在听吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_a24bbf1f:

    # s "I was, but I thought it was just a story."
    s "我听了，但我以为那只是个故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_08dba5a9:

    # "You follow both of them down the stairs. The air is damp and cold, the smell of moss and mildew fills your snout."
    "你跟着他们俩下楼梯。空气又湿又冷，苔藓和霉菌的气味充满了你的鼻腔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_da4b113c:

    # r "No, it's real. The old mayor had written about it."
    r "不，是真的。老市长曾写过这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_402f5143:

    # f "What lies underneath the longhouse, Rahim?"
    f "长屋下面有什么，雷希姆？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_fbc5aceb:

    # r "The temple, the old mayor had written about it."
    r "神殿，老市长曾写过这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_c76ccc31:

    # "You follow Rahim down the stairs, while the goat chief lags behind. The air is damp and cold, the smell of moss and mildew fills your snout."
    "你跟着雷希姆下楼梯，山羊酋长则落在后面。空气又湿又冷，苔藓和霉菌的气味充满了你的鼻腔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_da414f42:

    # e "What do you mean Rahim, an underground temple built underneath Lusterfield?"
    e "你的意思是，卢斯特菲尔德下面有一座地下神殿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_1ff1a8ff:

    # r "According to the mayor, it's a place where the goats worshipped Tapjoo, where the primordial runes was originally placed."
    r "据老酋长所说，那是山羊们供奉塔普乔的地方，也是原初符文最初被放置之处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_e9bf42fa:

    # s "Tapjoo... Do you think the goats are behind this?"
    s "塔普乔……你觉得这事是山羊们干的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_a0464434:

    # "Sebas turns to you, he looks pleasantly surprised."
    "塞巴斯转过身看向你，脸上带着惊喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_82417fd5:

    # "For a moment Rahim stops, as he looks up to meet Furkan's gaze."
    "雷希姆停了一会儿，抬起头迎上弗坎的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_efa7946b:

    # f "Tapjoo... we had not been practicing the old faith for a long time, Rahim. I can attest, this is not our doing."
    f "塔普乔……雷希姆，我们已经很久没再信奉旧信仰了。我可以保证，这不是我们干的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_4a662fcb:

    # "Rahim turns to you, his eyes stare directly into your soul, as if he's trying to see your reaction as well."
    "雷希姆转向你，目光仿佛直视着你的灵魂，似乎也在试图看清你的反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_d7be1475:

    # e "Why were they in Lusterfield?"
    e "他们为什么会在卢斯特菲尔德？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_132b9123:

    # r "In the primordial days, the goats had settled in this land, it was only after the great flood that they had moved to the other side of the river."
    r "远古时代，山羊们曾定居于这片土地；直到那场大洪水之后，它们才迁到了河的另一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_4fbcd1e6:

    # e "I thought the goats had always been on the other side."
    e "我还以为山羊们一直都在另一边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_bbf460ac:

    # r "It was a long time ago, [e]. From before the old gods still roamed the land. We never knew it existed... until now."
    r "那是很久以前的事了，[e]。那时古神还在大地上游荡。我们从不知道它的存在……直到现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_335016d0:

    # r "The mayor's writings had gotten messier after he visited the altar."
    r "老酋长拜访祭坛后，留下的文字变得越来越潦草。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_92353413:

    # "Rahim continues as the three of you continue down the stairs, the air grows colder and the smell of moss grows stronger."
    "雷希姆继续说道，你们三人也继续沿楼梯向下走去；空气越来越冷，苔藓的气味也越来越浓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_31320c28:

    # r "I am not sure what he had found, but the journal went from a daily record of his life, to a series of cryptic messages and a few sketches."
    r "我不确定他发现了什么，但那本日记从记录日常生活，变成了一连串隐晦的信息和几幅素描。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_572ae10d:

    # r "This is the line that caught my attention, it was the last entry of the journal."
    r "这一行引起了我的注意，这是日记的最后一篇记录。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_0937e65a:

    # r "'{i}A horned dragon that slumbers beneath the earth, bound by chains forged of forgotten oaths.{/i}'"
    r "‘{i}一头沉睡于大地之下、被遗忘誓言铸成的锁链束缚着的有角巨龙。{/i}’"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_fed37b73:

    # r "'{i}The dragon is said to awaken when the shepherd's call reaches the depths, heralding a time of upheaval and transformation.{/i}'"
    r "'{i}据说，当牧羊人的呼唤传至深渊时，巨龙便会苏醒，预示着动荡与蜕变的时代降临。{/i}'"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_952fa300:

    # "You look up to see Sebas's face, and notice both of them are staring at you deeply. Do they think you are the horned dragon?"
    "你抬头看向塞巴斯的脸，发现他们两个都在目不转睛地盯着你。他们觉得你就是那条有角的巨龙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_8f8a51a2:

    # s "I've been saying it, roomie. You do look like a dragon... or goat."
    s "我早就这么说了，室友。你确实像条龙……或者山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_3f95d230:

    # "You look up to see Furkan's face, and notice both of them are staring at you deeply. Do they think you are the horned dragon?"
    "你抬头看向弗坎的脸，发现他们两个都在目不转睛地盯着你。他们觉得你就是那条有角的巨龙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_072b53d7:

    # f "Is he?"
    f "他是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_de9da977:

    # e "Well, I am neither the only dragon, nor the only one horned here."
    e "好吧，我既不是唯一的巨龙，也不是这里唯一长角的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_2c7de737:

    # r "Granted, the teamaker is antlered. And I am pretty sure I am not a dragon. Do you think it is a coincidence that you ended up here, [e]?"
    r "姑且不提制茶人也长着鹿角。我很确定自己不是龙。你觉得你会来到这里，只是巧合吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_907f398b:

    # "You furrow your brows, horned dragons were so common in Puro that you had slowly forgotten that you came alone in this land."
    "你皱起眉头。在普罗，长角的龙十分常见，以至于你渐渐忘了自己是独自来到这片土地的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_9d6e812a:

    # e "Well, I don't recall being bound by chains either."
    e "不过，我也不记得自己曾被锁链捆住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_d506753b:

    # r "It could be metaphorical, for all I know."
    r "据我所知，也可能只是比喻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_371e068d:

    # "In all honesty, you don't want to know what the metaphor is."
    "老实说，你不会想知道这个比喻指的是什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_6577f73b:

    # r "This shepherd, is the reason why I asked for an alliance, if the journal is to be believed. Perhaps the goats can decipher whatever the old mayor had found."
    r "如果日记所言属实，这位牧羊人就是我提出结盟的原因。也许山羊们能解读出老市长发现的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_55291146:

    # s "Oh, but we didn't bring the goats with us."
    s "可是，我们没把山羊带来啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_b984d90a:

    # r "Yes, that was what I meant, Sebas. We have to do these ourselves either way."
    r "对，我就是这个意思，塞巴斯。无论如何，这些事都得我们自己来做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_017ce408:

    # s "I do have an idea..."
    s "我倒是有个主意……"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_183849ee:

    # r "Do you?"
    r "你有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_4f8feda3:

    # "Sebas turns to you, then back to Rahim."
    "塞巴斯转身看向你，随后又转回雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_3f384c52:

    # s "We'll see, Rahim. I have to think about it later."
    s "到时候就知道了，雷希姆。我得之后再想想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_9325095d:

    # "Rahim abruptly stops and closes the journal, before he shoves it back into his pocket."
    "雷希姆突然停下，合上日记，然后把它塞回口袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_dfc17e84:

    # r "And I have a gut feeling it has something to do with the missing runes."
    r "而且我有种直觉，这和失踪的符文有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_a21b2584:

    # "The staircase ends as you almost bump into Rahim. You find yourself in a large chamber. The room is dark, but you can still see the markings etched on the walls and the floor."
    "楼梯到了尽头，你差点撞上雷希姆。你发现自己来到了一个宽敞的大厅。房间里很暗，但你仍能看见墙壁和地板上刻着的痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_0ee84518:

    # s "Oh, this is so exciting, I didn't know there's a whole new temple underneath our village the whole time!"
    s "哦，这太令人兴奋了！我都不知道我们村子底下原来一直藏着一整座新神殿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_666f4993:

    # r "Neither did I, I must say, this place is preserved well."
    r "我也是，得说，这地方保存得真好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_83b31bfb:

    # s "We should totally let everyone see how big of a temple this is..."
    s "我们真该让所有人都来看看这座神殿到底有多大……"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_1bcff45a:

    # f "This is it... the temple of the goats. Yet I have never heard of such a place before."
    f "就是这里……山羊神殿。可我以前从没听说过这种地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_a1bd29e2:

    # r "I would have thought a goat chief would have known about the goat temple."
    r "我还以为，山羊族的酋长应该知道山羊神殿的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_00b277d0:

    # f "The goats have not believed in the old faith for a long time, Rahim. Some traditions still retains, but most are better left forgotten."
    f "山羊族已经很久不再信奉旧日信仰了，雷希姆。有些传统还保留着，但大多数还是忘掉为好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_e7fa9eee:

    # f "But, my father might have known about this place."
    f "不过，我父亲也许知道这个地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_461d3afd:

    # r "You think?"
    r "你觉得？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_070f5daa:

    # "Rahim raises his voice, as if he's struggling to contemplate the implication."
    "雷希姆提高了声音，仿佛正费力思索这其中的意味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_949fca4e:

    # f "If I knew we were exploring an underground temple, I would have brought Kari along."
    f "要是我知道我们是在探索一座地下神殿，我就会把卡里也带上了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_2a03a74e:

    # r "The whole point of this is to keep it a secret."
    r "这一切的目的就是保守秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_c2439d11:

    # "You look around, the room is vast, the floor is made of grey stone, cracked and chipped along the edges, the high and arched ceiling reaches up to the darkness."
    "你环顾四周，这个房间十分宽阔，地面由灰色石块铺成，边缘布满裂痕与缺口，高耸的拱顶一直延伸进黑暗之中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_096ddf8f:

    # r "This looks to just be the entrance, the temple should be further down."
    r "这里看起来只是入口，神殿应该还在更下方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_fcf862fa:

    # r "We shall proceed with caution. [e], go see if you can find anything that might help us."
    r "我们要谨慎行事。[e]，去看看能不能找到什么对我们有帮助的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayors_Longhouse_Going_Downstairs_8e8fd108:

    # "Hesitantly, you nod, as you take the first step into the temple."
    "你有些迟疑地点点头，迈出了踏入神殿的第一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Old_Mayors_Journal_b82baf72:

    # "Rahim hands you the journal, the pages are yellowed and the ink is faded, but the writing is still legible."
    "雷希姆把那本日记递给你，纸页已经泛黄，墨水也褪了色，但字迹依然清晰可辨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_9966fd6d:

    # "The moss guardian falls again as it crumbles into dust, hopefully for the last time. The door behind you suddenly snaps open, a sigh of relief escapes your lips."
    "苔藓守卫再次倒下，化作尘埃，希望这次就是最后一次。你身后的门突然猛地打开，一声如释重负的叹息从你唇间逸出。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_d4c57401:

    # s "I can't believe we did it! We defeated the moss guardian!"
    s "真不敢相信我们做到了！我们打败了苔藓守卫！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_0c1b1ee7:

    # "Sebas jumps up and down, his eyes sparkling with excitement."
    "塞巴斯兴奋得双眼闪闪发光，蹦来蹦去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_303bbd78:

    # s "I knew you could do it!"
    s "我就知道你能做到！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_44ed88bd:

    # r "We should have been here, [e]. But I'm glad you're fine."
    r "我们本该在这里，[e]。不过，看到你没事我很高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_416a9bb0:

    # "Rahim pats your back, his eyes are filled with pride."
    "雷希姆拍了拍你的后背，眼中满是自豪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_0929eaad:

    # f "Thank the gods, you had done it again."
    f "谢天谢地，你又一次做到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_965bf1a5:

    # r "Good job on the killing, [e]. I am proud of you."
    r "杀得漂亮，[e]。我为你感到骄傲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_ebfe53aa:

    # "Both Rahim and Furkan glances at each other before patting your back at the same time. You can't help but feel a bit embarrassed."
    "雷希姆和弗坎先互相看了一眼，随后同时拍了拍你的背。你不禁感到有些尴尬。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_48705cd7:

    # f "We should proceed now, it won't be long before we reach the grand chamber."
    f "我们现在该继续前进了，距离大殿应该不远了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_36037bc1:

    # "You can see the corridor ahead of you, the grand chamber seems to be just beyond the corner."
    "你能看到前方的走廊，大殿似乎就在转过拐角之后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_a271f647:

    # "You take your first step in the antechamber of the temple, the room is vast and dark, the only light comes from the torches on the wall."
    "你迈出第一步，走进神殿的前厅。房间宽阔而昏暗，唯一的光线来自墙上的火把。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_8f827997:

    # e "This is e-"
    e "这是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_d768ec51:

    # s "Shush!"
    s "嘘！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_d01bf198:

    # "Sebas puts his finger on his lips, as he hears strange sounds ahead."
    "塞巴斯听到前方传来奇怪的声音，便把手指竖在唇边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_e905e9b3:

    # f "Shh..."
    f "嘘……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_b50d0e8f:

    # "Furkan hushes you, as he points towards where a series of strange sounds comes from, it was the chamber ahead."
    "弗坎示意你噤声，同时指向传来阵阵怪声的方向——那是前方的房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_85f84e1d:

    # "Intricate patterns of blue markings are painted across the dome, all converging around the central figure of a goat intertwined with the image of Tapjoo."
    "穹顶上绘满精美的蓝色纹饰，尽皆汇聚于中央那只与塔普乔形象交织在一起的山羊图案。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_408aa32d:

    # "The room is filled with the smell of incense, and the sound of water dripping from the ceiling echoes throughout the chamber."
    "房间里弥漫着焚香的气味，天花板上滴落的水声在整个房间里回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_8a81b94c:

    # "At the center of the chamber stands an ornate pedestal, where you can count three figures standing around it."
    "房间中央立着一座华丽的基座，你数了数，周围站着三个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_8b9b77a3:

    # my1 "The moon wanes, and the veil grows thin. Have the offerings been prepared?"
    my1 "月渐亏，帷幕渐薄。供品准备好了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_5d86a86d:

    # "A mysterious voice echoes through the chamber, it's soft and melodic, but its sheer presence sends shivers down your spine."
    "一个神秘的声音在房间里回荡，轻柔而悦耳，却仅凭其存在便令你脊背发寒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_30f08ac3:

    # "Sebas and Rahim stop in their tracks, as they listen to the voices echoing in the chamber."
    "塞巴斯和雷希姆听着房间里回荡的声音，顿时停下了脚步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_f7bb0c8d:

    # "Furkan and Rahim stop in their tracks, as they listen to the voices echoing in the chamber."
    "弗坎和雷希姆听着房间里回荡的声音，顿时停下了脚步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_36d54895:

    # "You and your companions take cover behind one of the massive pillars, close enough to hear their conversation but hidden from view."
    "你和同伴躲到一根巨大的柱子后面，距离近得足以听见他们的谈话，却又藏得严严实实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_ddfc46cc:

    # my2 "Yes, brother. The horn of the silver wolf rests upon the altar."
    my2 "是的，兄长。银狼之角正放在祭坛上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_5d6fa67a:

    # "Another voice speaks, and your heart skips a beat upon hearing those words... silver wolf. It can't be anyone other than Chime."
    "又一个声音响起，听到“银狼”二字，你的心猛地一跳……那不可能是别人，只能是齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_e83f2606:

    # my1 "The time draws near. Have the temple's gates been secured? The uninitiated must not enter."
    my1 "时候快到了。神殿的大门封锁好了吗？未受启蒙者不得入内。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_62fbefbb:

    # my2 "The basin is in place, and the entrance is sealed."
    my2 "水盆已经就位，入口也封死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_6cf1c1c7:

    # my1 "Oh... Do you feel it? The whispers in the water? His voice grows stronger."
    my1 "哦……你感觉到了吗？水中的低语？他的声音越来越强了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_4203a988:

    # "The rhythmic voices carry a tone of reverence, as if they are already chanting in the ritual."
    "那有节奏的声音带着虔敬的意味，仿佛他们已经开始吟诵仪式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_aec5fd2d:

    # my2 "As have we all. The prophecy unfolds, and we are but vessels for his will."
    my2 "我们也感受到了。预言正在展开，而我们不过是承载他意志的容器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_ceb81b1e:

    # "Strangely, your arm seems to be hovering towards the voice, as if it's beckoning you to follow. You can feel the pull, the whisper at the edge of your consciousness."
    "奇怪的是，你的手臂不知不觉朝着那个声音抬起，仿佛那声音在召唤你跟随。你能感受到那股牵引，以及意识边缘的低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_a906aaf4:

    # "{i}'The shepherd comes for us all.'{/i}"
    "{i}‘牧羊人来接我们所有人。’{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_08919bba:

    # "You shudder at the whisper, the same phrase that the old mayor had written in his journal. You look around, but the corridor is empty except for Rahim and Sebas."
    "你因那声低语而战栗，那正是老市长在日记里写下的相同话语。你环顾四周，走廊里空无一人，只有雷希姆和塞巴斯在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_3137f70d:

    # "Afraid of alerting the strangers, you do not dare to ask if they hear the same voice, but the confused look on Rahim's face tells you that he does."
    "你怕惊动那些陌生人，不敢询问他们是否听见同一个声音，但雷希姆脸上的困惑告诉你，他也听见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_68c5d8e1:

    # "And somehow, Sebas is the most alert of you three."
    "不知为何，三人之中塞巴斯的警觉性最高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_9242731a:

    # "You shudder at the whisper, the same phrase that the old mayor had written in his journal. You look around, but the corridor is empty except for Rahim and Furkan."
    "你因那声低语而战栗，那正是老市长在日记里写下的相同话语。你环顾四周，走廊里空无一人，只有雷希姆和弗坎在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_a61fae19:

    # "Afraid of alerting the strangers, you do not dare to ask if they hear the same voice, but the confused look on their faces tells you that they do."
    "你怕惊动那些陌生人，不敢问他们是否也听到了同一个声音，但他们脸上的困惑告诉你，他们确实听到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_ae6794b2:

    # my1 "With the shepherd's staff, we can bend the strongest of the will. The new guardians proved to be vigilant, but not impenetratable."
    my1 "有了牧羊人之杖，我们便能扭曲最坚韧的意志。新来的守卫确实警觉，却并非坚不可摧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_48950ee7:

    # my3 "The lost flock has not stopped their search. They are close, and we cannot slacken."
    my3 "迷途的羊群还没有停止搜寻。他们已经很近了，我们不能松懈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_2cb7436f:

    # my2 "Only those who understand is worthy of following. Yet those who do not understand still listens. How foolish."
    my2 "只有理解者才值得追随。然而，不理解的人却仍在聆听。真是愚蠢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_4bfe6279:

    # "You begin to close in in the grand chamber, it was spacious, and the three acolytes catch your eyes immediately."
    "你开始接近那间宽敞的大殿，三名侍僧立刻映入眼帘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_3a8f3d92:

    # "The white robed strangers still are not aware of your existence, they are solely focused on the ritual."
    "身穿白袍的陌生人仍未察觉你的存在，只专注于仪式。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_659a4c7d:

    # my1 "Once the shepherd arrives, we can finally begin."
    my1 "牧羊人一到，我们终于可以开始了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_17ff6371:

    # "They guffaw in unison. The cultists seem to be overly amused in their ambition."
    "他们齐声大笑。这些邪教徒似乎对自己的野心乐不可支。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_284d2ff7:

    # "And most importantly, you feel as if they have a shared mind."
    "更重要的是，你感觉他们仿佛拥有共同的意识。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_2cc02f82:

    # "You decide to remain hidden, you place your finger onto your lips, signaling the two leaders to wait patiently."
    "你决定继续藏身，并将手指放在唇边，示意两位首领耐心等待。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_0a082ec6:

    # "And so you wait as the cultists draped in dim light continue their conversation."
    "于是，你等着那些笼罩在昏暗光线中的邪教徒继续交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_f8b0b5f1:

    # my1 "The shepherd's call will be heard soon. The time is nigh."
    my1 "牧羊人的召唤很快就会传来。时辰将至。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_4416e801:

    # my3 "I sense whispers of interference."
    my3 "我察觉到了干扰的低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_c364c058:

    # "He cautions, glancing over his shoulder as if sensing your presence."
    "他警告道，同时回头瞥了一眼，仿佛察觉到了你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_47ed530d:

    # my2 "Outsiders who seek to disrupt our sacred rite."
    my2 "那些企图打断我们神圣仪式的外来者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_21eae051:

    # my1 "They are of no consequence. Sadly, some uninitiated are cursed with obnoxiously vulgar voices."
    my1 "他们无足轻重。可惜，有些未受启蒙者被诅咒拥有令人恼火的粗俗嗓音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_01964995:

    # my1 "Remember, we shall all search in the fogged forest, do not approach the watchtower."
    my1 "记住，我们要一同在雾林中搜寻，不要靠近瞭望塔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_59345861:

    # my2 "The elder dragon is cautious, we shall avoid his lantern this time."
    my2 "那头古龙很谨慎，这次我们要避开他的灯笼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_abc6b6cb:

    # "Elder... dragon. Your heart skips a beat. You can't help but feel that the acolytes are talking about Hezzong, the allfather?"
    "古龙……你的心跳漏了一拍。你不由得觉得，这些侍僧说的是赫宗，那位万父？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_364246d6:

    # my1 "We shall begin promptly, the shepherd waits for no one."
    my1 "我们马上开始，牧羊人不会等任何人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_7bee808a:

    # "The acolytes exchange glances before they continue to hum."
    "侍僧们交换了眼神，然后继续哼唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_5033e614:

    # "Rahim leans in close to you, his brow furrowed."
    "雷希姆皱着眉头，凑近你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_7da32952:

    # r "Go."
    r "走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_8b0dc71b:

    # "He whispers urgently."
    "他急切地低声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_c311e0e1:

    # "You choose to act without delay."
    "你决定立即行动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_c15bf505:

    # "Turning to Rahim and Sebas, both of them nod at you as you quickly stand up from from behind the pillar."
    "你转向雷希姆和塞巴斯，两人都朝你点头，而你迅速从柱子后站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_74922bf8:

    # "Turning to Rahim and Furkan, both of them nod at you as you quickly stand up from from behind the pillar."
    "你转向雷希姆和弗坎，两人都朝你点头，而你迅速从柱子后站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_d25f6171:

    # "You decide to wait more, gesturing for Furkan and Rahim to stay quiet."
    "你决定再等一等，同时示意弗坎和雷希姆保持安静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_c4bf60a9:

    # "Rahim impatiently taps his foot, as he turns back towards the three strangers."
    "雷希姆不耐烦地跺着脚，转身面向三个陌生人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_5d45b1ab:

    # "Sebas's grip tightens on the stone floor. You can sense his nervousness as he glances at you."
    "塞巴斯紧紧抓住石地面。他看向你时，你能感受到他的紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_2d91097b:

    # "Furkan's grip tightens on his bow. You can sense his nervousness as he glances at you."
    "弗坎紧紧握住手中的弓。他看向你时，你能感受到他的紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_f22dc591:

    # "A familiar blue light begins to emanate from the pedestal, as the acolytes begin to chant in unison."
    "祭坛底座开始散发出熟悉的蓝光，侍僧们开始齐声吟唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_1da013bb:

    # "You can feel the pull, the whisper at the edge of your consciousness, but you have managed to resist it."
    "你能感受到那股拉力，也能听见意识边缘的低语，但你成功抵抗住了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_f5e8cc2d:

    # "As the acolytes continue their chant, you can see the blue light growing brighter, covering the entire chamber."
    "侍僧们继续吟唱，蓝光越来越亮，覆盖了整个房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_922aabed:

    # my1 "Halt!"
    my1 "住手！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_cb3ec9f9:

    # "They quickly quieten, shooting prudent glances around the room."
    "他们很快安静下来，谨慎地扫视着房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_65b7057b:

    # my1 "Your own shadow has betrayed your horns, uninitiated."
    my1 "你自己的影子暴露了你的双角，未入门者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_fd0f2671:

    # "The leader scans the chamber slowly. You can feel his gaze lingering on the pillar you are hiding behind."
    "首领缓缓扫视整个房间。你能感受到他的目光停留在你藏身的柱子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_2197ee84:

    # my1 "Come forth, horned one. There is no need for secrecy."
    my1 "出来吧，长角之人。无需藏匿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_faa23013:

    # s "Wait... wait... we should do something now!"
    s "等、等一下……我们现在该做点什么了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_f35b0905:

    # "Sebas whispers urgently."
    "塞巴斯急切地低声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_28288dc1:

    # f "They know we are here."
    f "他们知道我们在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_6d70c5cd:

    # "Furkan whispers urgently."
    "弗坎急切地低声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_8519e1c3:

    # "The leader in the middle exchanges a meaningful glance with his subordinates. They started to chant again, this time more like a shout."
    "中间的首领意味深长地瞥了手下一眼。他们再次开始吟唱，这次更像是在喊叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_499c13b0:

    # "Suddenly the room is filled with a blinding light, and you find yourself unable to move."
    "突然，房间里充满了刺目的强光，你发现自己无法动弹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_8c7c1a6a:

    # r "Go! Stop them!"
    r "快！阻止他们！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_89ead515:

    # "You can't see what's happening, but you can hear the sound of footsteps and the clashing of weapons."
    "你看不见发生了什么，但能听见脚步声和武器碰撞的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_75ab91e4:

    # e "W-wait..."
    e "等、等一下……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_73bd8d29:

    # "You try to call out, but your voice is drowned out by the cacophony."
    "你试图喊出声，但声音被这片嘈杂彻底淹没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_2ccac467:

    # "The light fades, and you find yourself falling on the ground, your head spinning."
    "光芒消退，你发现自己正摔向地面，脑袋一阵天旋地转。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_52d57773:

    # "The back of your head throbs with pain, and you can feel both the warm red liquid and the cold stone floor."
    "你的后脑阵阵作痛，你能感觉到温热的红色液体和冰冷的石地板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Encounter_c43304f2:

    # "You decide to confront the acolytes before they can complete their ritual."
    "你决定在侍僧完成仪式前，出面阻止他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_cc0357b7:

    # e "Stop right there!"
    e "站住！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_6e1b77a2:

    # "One of them turns sharply, his eyes narrowing beneath his hood."
    "其中一人猛地转过身，兜帽下的双眼微微眯起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_c153ca7a:

    # my1 "Very well, after all the uninitiated has arrived."
    my1 "很好，未受启蒙者终究还是来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_fe6350c3:

    # my2 "And accompanied by the impotent goat chief and the imprudent mayor. How... quaint."
    my2 "还带着无能的山羊酋长和鲁莽的市长。真是……有趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_d338489d:

    # "The three of you emerge from darkness, confronting the masked men."
    "你们三人从黑暗中现身，与那些蒙面人对峙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_d7476066:

    # "They are dressed in white robes, their faces are hidden beneath the white mask, much alike to that of Kari's, except for the gaping mouth hole."
    "他们身穿白袍，脸庞隐藏在白色面具之下，面具与卡里的那副十分相似，只是嘴部留着一个大大的孔洞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_2688686a:

    # s "People are coming, you guys. You won't get out of here alive without telling us what's that you're doing here."
    s "有人来了，各位。你们不说清楚来这里做什么，就别想活着离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_f2a09086:

    # f "You have no way out, yield now and we shall spare your life."
    f "你们无路可逃。现在投降，我们就饶你一命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_0aef63fd:

    # my1 "Spare our lives? You are the ones who are trespassing in our Temple."
    my1 "饶我们？明明是你们擅闯我们的神殿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_f8fb7465:

    # r "Nonsense, this is Lusterfield's land."
    r "胡说，这里是卢斯特菲尔德的土地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_c67fa1d1:

    # my3 "Lusterfield, the heathen's quarters? You are mistaken, mayor. You people are merely invaders in our true land."
    my3 "卢斯特菲尔德，异教徒的居所？市长，你搞错了。你们不过是闯入我们真正领地的入侵者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_dc5fdf7b:

    # "Rahim clenches his fist, as he steps forward."
    "雷希姆攥紧拳头，向前迈步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_85718faa:

    # r "Enough of this. Who are you, and how did you get here?"
    r "够了。你们是谁，又是怎么来到这里的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_d3a3ccb8:

    # "The three strangers exchange a glance, before they chortle with the lowest voice."
    "三个陌生人交换了一个眼神，随后用低沉的声音嗤嗤笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_d02e8d4d:

    # my1 "We are but humble followers of the shepherd. And you are but a mere obstacle in our path."
    my1 "我们只是牧者卑微的信徒。而你，不过是挡在我们路上的区区障碍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_0f978057:

    # "They raise their hands, as they begin to chant in a language you do not understand."
    "他们抬起双手，开始用你听不懂的语言吟唱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_da3aca8a:

    # s "What are you doing? Stop it! Now!"
    s "你们在做什么？住手！现在就停下！"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_455fb3c0:

    # my1 "You are foolish to think you can stop us, hornless one."
    my1 "你竟蠢到以为自己能阻止我们，无角者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_ad59c7b3:

    # f "Are you truly trying to summon Tapjoo?"
    f "你们真的想召唤塔普乔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_4f4ff152:

    # my1 "Just as expected, the goat chief is as clueless as his ancestors. Curious."
    my1 "果然，山羊酋长和他的祖先一样无知。真有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_b7c25002:

    # "Furious, the brown bull charges forwards and swings his fist at the strangers."
    "棕色公牛怒不可遏，向前冲去，挥拳打向陌生人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_b75c16d0:

    # "They are quick to react, as they dodge the bull's attack and counter with a swift kick."
    "他们迅速作出反应，躲开公牛的攻击，并以一记迅猛的踢击反击。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_901bf68e:

    # my2 "Impressive, but you are not worthy of the shepherd's grace, mayor."
    my2 "令人印象深刻，但你不配得到牧羊人的恩典，市长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_672a5b33:

    # "You watch as Rahim staggers back, his eyes are filled with anger and confusion."
    "你看着雷希姆踉跄着后退，眼中充满了愤怒与困惑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_4b60a8c2:

    # my1 "We cannot proceed as planned, escape with the basin. I will handle our guests."
    my1 "我们无法按计划行事了，带着圣盆逃走。我来对付我们的客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_837ede16:

    # "One of them nods, and lifts up the basin, he begins to run towards the dark corner of the chamber while the other opens the door."
    "其中一人点了点头，抬起圣盆，朝着大殿的黑暗角落跑去，另一人则打开了门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_3b3c228f:

    # r "They're getting away! We can't let them escape under our noses."
    r "他们要逃了！我们不能眼睁睁看着他们从眼皮底下溜走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_bca84893:

    # "Sebas and Rahim dash after the fleeing acolytes, disappearing through the archway."
    "塞巴斯和雷希姆冲向逃跑的侍祭，消失在拱门后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_85b15f8c:

    # "Furkan and Rahim dash after the fleeing acolytes, disappearing through the archway."
    "弗坎和雷希姆冲向逃跑的侍祭，消失在拱门后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_f6176937:

    # "The chamber door closes behind them with a resonant thud, leaving you alone with the acolyte leader."
    "大殿的门在他们身后轰然关闭，只留下你和侍祭首领独处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_c0d6505f:

    # "You can sense a laughter louder than no other, as the masked stranger in front of you lifts his hand."
    "面前那个蒙面陌生人抬起手，你能感受到一阵前所未有的狂笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_0de038ba:

    # my1 "You are more resourceful than I anticipated. Come forward so I can see you better."
    my1 "你的能耐比我预想的更强。走近些，让我看清楚你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_98289c5b:

    # "You level your weapon at him, not taking another step forward or back."
    "你举起武器对准他，既没有继续前进，也没有后退。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_3f5bee55:

    # "Nonetheless, he leans closer to see you."
    "不过，他还是俯身靠近了些，想看清你的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_588844be:

    # my1 "A h-horned dragon? Are you-... impossible."
    my1 "长、长角的龙？你是——不可能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_23348d12:

    # "You remain silent, your eyes locked on the stranger's mask."
    "你一言不发，双眼紧紧盯着陌生人的面具。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_2420811e:

    # my1 "No... must be coincidence."
    my1 "不……一定只是巧合。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_e6791652:

    # "The acolyte leader chuckles, as he raises his hand."
    "侍祭首领轻笑着抬起手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Grand_Chamber_Confront_78fafeb2:

    # "Suddenly, a bright light blinds you. You find yourself unable to move, as the stranger's voice echoes in your head."
    "突然，耀眼的光芒刺得你睁不开眼。你发现自己动弹不得，而那个陌生人的声音在你的脑海中回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_634f71e0:

    # "The first thing you notice is the sound of a bell. It's a soft, gentle sound, but it's also insistent."
    "你首先注意到的是铃铛声。那声音轻柔温和，却又执着地响个不停。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c975aefd:

    # ch "You alright?"
    ch "你还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_09cea61a:

    # e "...Huh?"
    e "……嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c82c2f5a:

    # ch "You're alright, right?"
    ch "你没事，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_e5bdee20:

    # "You open your eyes to see the source of the voice."
    "你睁开眼睛，寻找声音的来源。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_fc62d6df:

    # "It... it's so familiar, his face, his voice, his eyes..."
    "他……他的脸、声音，还有眼睛……都如此熟悉……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_574b1357:

    # e "Chime!"
    e "齐门！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_07c88da5:

    # "The horned white wolf in front of you smiles, his tail wagging."
    "面前的白色独角狼微笑着，尾巴欢快地摇摆着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_686e4c59:

    # ch "I was starting to get worried, pip, you were out for quite a few minutes."
    ch "我都开始担心了，小家伙，你已经昏过去好几分钟了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_e7d9a4bf:

    # "He reaches out a hand to help you up, and you take it."
    "他伸出手拉你起来，你握住了他的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_9686dbd5:

    # e "I-I'm sorry, where are we?"
    e "对、对不起，我们这是在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1f83b68c:

    # "Chime chuckles softly."
    "齐门轻声笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_b294fd3b:

    # ch "Allfather's house, did you lose memories within? It's his birthday, you told me we were preparing a huge surprise."
    ch "在天父的家里啊，你是不是把记忆丢在里面了？今天是他的生日，你还告诉过我，我们正在准备一个天大的惊喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_e7b05373:

    # "You look around, and soon you begin to remember, you are indeed in Hezzong's house."
    "你环顾四周，很快便开始回想起来：这里确实是赫宗的家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_109b422c:

    # "Was it all... a dream? Everything that happened in the other world, the people you met, was it all just fading away...?"
    "这一切……都是梦吗？在另一个世界里发生的一切，还有你遇到的那些人，难道全都在逐渐消散……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_0805bbeb:

    # "You look back at Chime, who is still smiling at you."
    "你回头看向齐门，他依然对你微笑着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_50d191b4:

    # ch "Hey, take this, [e]."
    ch "嘿，拿着这个，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_12581c25:

    # "He hands you a wooden sculpture of a dragon that look just like Hezzong."
    "他递给你一尊木雕的龙，模样和赫宗一模一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_024f758d:

    # "You clumsily take it, the sculpture is heavier than you thought."
    "你笨手笨脚地接过来，这尊木雕比你想的要重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1cb6f9fd:

    # ch "This one took me a couple of days, does it look good?"
    ch "这个我花了两天才做好，好看吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c8c78387:

    # e "It looks amazing, Chime. How did you manage to make the lantern light up?"
    e "它看起来棒极了，齐门。你是怎么让灯笼亮起来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_7fdc81cc:

    # ch "Firefly, the one we caught last week. I think it looks better than the last one."
    ch "是萤火虫，就是我们上周抓到的那只。我觉得它比上一只好看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_a9675efc:

    # "You nod, and put the sculpture down on the table."
    "你点点头，把木雕放在桌上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_02deb319:

    # "Chime sits down next to you, his gaze quickly latches onto you."
    "齐门在你身旁坐下，目光很快便锁定了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_36e477f4:

    # ch "What is it, pip. You seem a bit stiff, does your head still hurt?"
    ch "怎么了，小家伙？你看起来有点僵硬，头还疼吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_a824dded:

    # e "No, it's not... it's just..."
    e "不，不是……只是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_2fc4731d:

    # ch "Come on, I've known you since you were a lil pup, you can tell me anything."
    ch "别这样，我从你还是个小崽子时就认识你了，有什么事都可以告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_5e403fc3:

    # "He places a hand on your lap, and you look down at it."
    "他把一只手放在你的腿上，你低头看向那只手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_2ae444a9:

    # ch "Your big chimney always here."
    ch "你的大烟囱一直都在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1ac92979:

    # e "I... I had a dream, Chime."
    e "我……我做了个梦，齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_3078d8ec:

    # "The wolf tilts his head."
    "那只狼歪了歪头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_bc3d8d29:

    # ch "A dream?"
    ch "梦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_13a99588:

    # e "You were missing... and Hezzong and I went to find you. But then... everything changed, and I was in a different world."
    e "你不见了……我和赫宗一起去找你。可是后来……一切都变了，我来到了另一个世界。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_510a737e:

    # e "It was... so real, Chime. I met so many people, and I... I did things I never thought I would do."
    e "那一切……太真实了，齐门。我遇到了好多好多的人，而且我……我做了些从没想过自己会做的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_916434f2:

    # "You look up at him, and see the concern in his eyes."
    "你抬头看向他，看见他眼中流露出的担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6a79e411:

    # e "I... I don't know if it was real, and I don't know if you are even real."
    e "我……我不知道那是不是真的，也不知道你到底是不是真实存在的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_7da820f5:

    # ch "W-what? [e], I'm real, I'm right here."
    ch "什、什么？[e]，我是真的，我就在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c4fd6b96:

    # ch "At least I think I am. I'm pretty sure I am. Don't you worry."
    ch "至少我是这么觉得的。我相当确定自己是真的。别担心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_a28db3bb:

    # "He pulls you into a hug, and you almost immediately sink into his embrace."
    "他把你拉进怀里，你几乎立刻便陷入他的怀抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_b9c07ffe:

    # ch "I'm here, pip. I'm here."
    ch "我在这里，小家伙。我在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_de19830f:

    # ch "You must've had a bad dream there, but it's over now, you're safe."
    ch "你刚才一定做了个噩梦，但现在已经结束了，你安全了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_22ab154e:

    # "You close your eyes, and hug him back."
    "你闭上眼睛，也抱住了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_3721a5d7:

    # "You hug him so tight, you're afraid he'll disappear if you let go."
    "你把他抱得如此紧，生怕一松手他就会消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_92c6c9dc:

    # e "I'm sorry, Chime."
    e "对不起，齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_64a35ea3:

    # "Your eyes are wet, and you feel a sob coming up."
    "你的眼眶湿润了，感觉一阵抽泣涌了上来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_3254d982:

    # "He pats your back gently."
    "他轻轻拍着你的后背。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_7e34feb6:

    # ch "It's alright. It's alright."
    ch "没事了。没事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_4f3770bf:

    # "You stay like that for a while, until your body stopped shaking."
    "你就这样待了一会儿，直到身体不再颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_96c76311:

    # "His scent was so familiar, so comforting, you never wanted to let go."
    "他的气息如此熟悉，如此令人安心，让你根本不想松手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_4ddfbdd9:

    # "But you eventually pull away, and wipe your eyes lazily."
    "但最后你还是拉开了距离，懒洋洋地擦了擦眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_55b0cde2:

    # e "I'm sorry, Chime. I don't know what came over me."
    e "对不起，齐门。我不知道自己刚才是怎么了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_33b548f8:

    # ch "It's alright, okay. We all have bad dreams sometimes."
    ch "没事了，好吗。我们有时都会做噩梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_5b48e533:

    # e "I missed you so much, Chime. I missed you."
    e "我好想你，齐门。我真的好想你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_8255a82c:

    # "He smiles at you, and ruffles your hair."
    "他朝你微笑，揉乱了你的头发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_41950867:

    # ch "I have just been gone for a few seconds, [e]."
    ch "我才离开了几秒钟，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_dfe9a6dd:

    # ch "But I missed you too."
    ch "但我也想你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_e1e1b67b:

    # "You smile at him, and shake your head."
    "你对他笑了笑，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1ae29f86:

    # e "I wish I could stay here forever. Life was so much simpler here."
    e "我真希望能永远留在这里。这里的生活简单多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_7b066a9a:

    # ch "I know, [e]. I know."
    ch "我知道，[e]。我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_e1e1b67b_1:

    # "You smile at him, and shake your head."
    "你朝他微微一笑，摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6688878a:

    # e "It's nothing, Chime. I'm just a bit tired."
    e "没什么，齐门。我只是有点累。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_0a5b6f01:

    # ch "Alright, if you say so."
    ch "好吧，既然你这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c7e6684a:

    # "He stands up, and offers you a hand."
    "他站起身，朝你伸出手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_470d60ed:

    # ch "Come on, let's hide. Hezzong will be back soon."
    ch "快来，我们躲起来。赫宗很快就会回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6baaee78:

    # "You take his hand, and stand up."
    "你拉住他的手，站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_d4eee17e:

    # "You follow him towards the windows, where he points to the working table."
    "你跟着他走向窗边，他指了指那张工作台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_fd8f4b67:

    # ch "Here, let's stay here before he comes back."
    ch "我们待在这里，趁他还没回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_fd00ffe6:

    # "The silver wolf pulls you down with him, gesturing you to sit down on the floor."
    "银狼把你拉下来，示意你坐到地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_50603ad5:

    # "It was a bit cramped, your arms and legs crosses over to Chime's, and you barely have enough space to move."
    "这里有点挤，你的手脚和齐门的交叠在一起，几乎没有活动的空间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6c5bba7f:

    # e "Chime?"
    e "齐门？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_dfdcf30f:

    # ch "What's it, pip?"
    ch "怎么了，小家伙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_3de3a60d:

    # e "I remembered this night. It was the night you told me about the stars."
    e "我想起了这个夜晚。就是那晚，你告诉我关于星星的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_95b9fa1d:

    # ch "Oh, how did you know I was about to talk about that?"
    ch "哦，你怎么知道我正要说这个？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_0218a63d:

    # e "Hezzong didn't come back this night, but we waited and waited."
    e "赫宗今晚没有回来，但我们等了又等。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_288a4bc6:

    # e "You told me about the stars, and how they were the only thing that stayed the same."
    e "你告诉我星星的事，还说它们是唯一始终不变的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_be5fbc9a:

    # e "And... we... shared his bed when I was getting too tired."
    e "而且……我们……在我快要累得撑不住时，睡在了他的床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1f83b68c_1:

    # "Chime chuckles softly."
    "齐门轻轻笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c6595a9a:

    # ch "How could you remember something that didn't happen yet, pip. Last I heard Hezz didn't share with you his skills."
    ch "你怎么会记得尚未发生的事呢，小家伙？我上次听说，赫宗还没把他的本事传给你呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1ce1e62d:

    # e "The memory all came back to me now..."
    e "那段记忆现在全都回来了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_b50dcfbf:

    # "You look at him, and see the concern in his eyes."
    "你看着他，察觉到他眼中的担忧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_08a776f7:

    # ch "I didn't know you hit your head that badly. Guess I'll take you to Pairon first thing tomorrow."
    ch "我不知道你竟然把头撞得那么重。看来明天一早我得先带你去找派伦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_11272ac0:

    # e "No, Chime. I'm fine, I promise."
    e "不，齐门。我没事，我保证。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1b719c6f:

    # "It was only seeing him again that you remembered how much you missed him."
    "直到再次见到他，你才想起自己有多么想念他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_48044479:

    # "This all... was too good to be true. You understand that, but you didn't want to wake up at all."
    "这一切……好得令人难以置信。你明白这一点，可你一点也不想醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_c4a46391:

    # "You didn't want to leave Chime behind... again."
    "你不想再一次把齐门留在身后……"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6e2f08ed:

    # "It was that moment you notice a pair of orange orbs hovering outside the windows, watching over you."
    "就在那一刻，你注意到窗外悬着一对橙色的光球，正注视着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_d55fc529:

    # e "Chime, do you see that?"
    e "齐门，你看到了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_428dc58d:

    # "The wolf looks up, and sees the orbs as well."
    "那头狼抬起头，也看到了那些光球。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_bb6d1cc6:

    # ch "Oh... don't worry. It's just the fireflies."
    ch "哦……别担心。只是萤火虫而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_a4a20ba8:

    # "You look at Chime, and quickly notice the weariness in his eyes."
    "你看向齐门，很快便注意到他眼中的疲惫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_6c5bba7f_1:

    # e "Chime?"
    e "齐门？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_443e0ba1:

    # ch "G-go away!"
    ch "走、走开！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_b214cea5:

    # "The wolf suddenly pushes you off, and you stumble back."
    "那头狼突然把你推开，你踉跄着向后退去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_4872fa00:

    # "You were still in shock over his sudden burst of rage, when you see the orbs suddenly grow larger."
    "你还在为他突然爆发的怒火感到震惊，这时你看见那些光球突然变大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_ef51888e:

    # ch "You have no power here."
    ch "你在这里没有力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_92b7e97d:

    # "Chime charges towards the orange orbs, who quick reveals as they emerge from the shadow."
    "齐门朝那些橙色光球冲去，那些光球从阴影中现身，很快显露出了真身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_75bd01c4:

    # "I-It was a stag man, and it's only upon closer look, you realise he was the one who kidnapped you into this world."
    "那是一个雄鹿人，直到仔细看去，你才意识到他就是把你绑架到这个世界的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_ea7af8c5:

    # "A gust of wind escape from the bottom of your lung, as Chime pulls out his tuck from the back."
    "一口气从你肺腑深处冲出，齐门从背后拔出他的细剑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_ea62a9c3:

    # "He swings it at the stag, but the stag easily dodges it. It soon becomes clear that his target was not Chime, but you."
    "他挥剑砍向雄鹿人，但雄鹿人轻松躲开了。很快就清楚了，他的目标不是齐门，而是你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_4ec394e5:

    # "The stag man flies at you, grabbing your hand and pulling you towards him."
    "雄鹿人朝你扑来，抓住你的手，把你往他那边拽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_574b1357_1:

    # e "Chime!"
    e "齐门！"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_3d187ed6:

    # "Chime tries to grab you back, but the stag pushes him off with an otherworldly strength, and the wolf dragon tumbles into the other side of the room."
    "齐门试图把你拉回去，但雄鹿人以超乎常理的力量将他推开，那头狼龙翻滚着摔到了房间另一侧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_04f955a3:

    # "Desperately, you try to struggle away, but the stag's grip is too strong. He is dragging you out of the house."
    "你拼命挣扎着想要逃开，但雄鹿人的手劲太大了。他拖着你走出屋子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_58026b6d:

    # "It's only when he throws you onto the grass outside, you had registered that the stag is staring at you the whole time."
    "直到他把你扔到屋外的草地上，你才意识到，雄鹿人一路都在盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_8d1286a1:

    # e "Who are you? What do you want from me?"
    e "你是谁？你想从我这里得到什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_e961b3b6:

    # "You instinctively flinch as he kneels down to gaze at every inch of your face, hand snagging your cheeks."
    "你本能地瑟缩了一下。他跪下来，端详着你脸上的每一寸肌肤，一只手勾住你的脸颊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_0ed243ba:

    # "It is the first time you get wind of his obscured face. His eyes are the only thing you can see, and they are filled with a deep, dark void that you cannot comprehend."
    "这是你第一次看清他被遮掩的面容。你唯一能看见的是他的双眼，里面充斥着深邃而黑暗的虚无，令你无法理解。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_4e9d6690:

    # e "Hu... I need to go back. I need to go back to Chime."
    e "呜……我得回去。我得回齐门那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_319911c9:

    # "But you can make out his long snoot, a dark ring of fur beset his eyes, and his antlers were as sharp as ever."
    "但你还是看清了他长长的口鼻，双眼周围围着一圈深色的毛发，而他的鹿角依旧如往常般锋利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_8ed62403:

    # e "You are not going to hurt me, are you?"
    e "你不会伤害我，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1c874155:

    # "Silently, he leans in closer, and you can feel his breath on your face. It was cold, and it was heavy."
    "他一言不发地继续靠近，你能感觉到他的呼吸拂过脸颊。那呼吸冰冷而沉重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_316859cb:

    # "He has not uttered a word, and you have given up asking him anything already. You just sit on the grass, and let him crawl around you, staring."
    "他始终没有说过一句话，而你也早已放弃继续向他提问。你只是坐在草地上，任由他爬到你身边，盯着你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_5bdafa78:

    # "At last, his eyes widens as he seems to find something, and then he suddenly slaps on the back of your head."
    "最后，他的双眼突然睁大，似乎发现了什么，接着猛地拍了下你的后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_33bf54a2:

    # e "Ouch! What are you doing this for?"
    e "好痛！你干什么呀？"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_1002c4eb:

    # "As you open your eyes, you notice the stag man standing up again, it does not take long before you notice the world fading before your eyes."
    "你睁开双眼，发现那个鹿人又站了起来。没过多久，你便察觉到眼前的世界开始褪色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_403ddeb6:

    # "It takes another blink from you, for the stag man to vanish again."
    "你又眨了一下眼，那个鹿人再次消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_80544402:

    # "And your consciousness quickly follows."
    "你的意识也随之迅速远去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Chime_First_Dream_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_72b022b8:

    # o "He's awake!"
    o "他醒了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_58404e58:

    # s "Roomie! Hey!"
    s "室友！喂！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_32131a7b:

    # f "[e]!"
    f "[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_360c0996:

    # "You wake up with a start, your heart racing. You had to peel your eyelids open to see that you are back in your bed."
    "你猛然醒来，心脏怦怦直跳。你费力睁开眼皮，才发现自己已经回到了床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_a5036fe1:

    # "The first thing you noticed was Ole's usual smile. He was tending to your wound, and he looks up at you."
    "你醒来后最先看到的是奥利一贯的笑容。他正在替你处理伤口，这时抬头看向了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_841f13c8:

    # o "How are you doing, kiddo."
    o "感觉怎么样，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_de36f5dd:

    # "The first thing you noticed was Furkan's broken arm, but it doesn't stop him from smiling at you."
    "你醒来后最先看到的是弗坎那条断臂，但这丝毫没有妨碍他对你微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_89e14174:

    # f "You are finally awake."
    f "你终于醒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_8833b5d2:

    # "You look around, and see that Ole is there as well."
    "你环顾四周，发现奥利也在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_57de740e:

    # o "We were starting to get worried when one minotaur's dose of wolfbark didn't wake you up."
    o "一头弥诺陶洛斯分量的狼吠草都没能把你唤醒，我们本来都开始担心了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_86395f9f:

    # o "It took two minotaurs'."
    o "得用两头弥诺陶洛斯的分量才行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_2bd89205:

    # e "Ugh... what happened?"
    e "呃……发生什么事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_72e7443f:

    # "You try to sit up, but a sharp pain in your head stops you."
    "你试着坐起来，但头部传来一阵剧痛，让你不得不停下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_ba86eb9e:

    # o "You were out for a while, [e]. By a while I mean 5 days you were in bed, mumbling something about Chime."
    o "你昏迷了一阵，[e]。说是一阵，是因为你已经躺在床上5天了，还一直嘟囔着什么齐门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_2f10d0be:

    # s "Oh! Roomie, you're awake!"
    s "哦！室友，你醒啦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_2201cd66:

    # "Sebas hops into the room with excitement, and quickly jumps onto your bed. For a second you thought you were about to bounce up when he lands."
    "塞巴斯兴奋地蹦进房间，立刻跳上你的床。他落下时，你还以为自己差点被弹起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_23a7ca13:

    # "Ole reprimands him with a sharp stare, before cover you up with another blanket."
    "奥利狠狠瞪了他一眼斥责道，然后又拿一条毯子替你盖好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_7fbd9ec3:

    # s "When Rahim carried you here all by himself, I thought you were a goner!"
    s "雷希姆一个人把你背到这里时，我还以为你没救了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_f7c9d827:

    # o "Now, now, Sebas. [e] is awake now, let's not scare him."
    o "好了，好了，塞巴斯。[e]已经醒了，别吓着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_88974e6b:

    # "You look around, and see that Rahim sits in the corner of the room, his arms crossed as usual."
    "你环顾四周，发现雷希姆像往常一样，双臂交叉坐在房间角落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_4c7f0561:

    # e "Uhm... what happened back there?"
    e "呃……刚才到底发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_5c8f1e31:

    # r "I have no idea. That son of a goat cast a spell on all of us. We were lucky to get out of there alive."
    r "我完全不知道。那个山羊杂种对我们所有人施了法。我们能活着逃出来，已经算走运了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_2dc6b536:

    # r "Though, the young ram is back in his tribe, last I heard he still had not woken up."
    r "不过，据我最后听到的消息，那只小公羊已经回到自己的部族了，但他还没醒过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_18858a85:

    # e "Where are the cultists then?"
    e "那邪教徒呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_925d375e:

    # r "No idea. They vanished when I woke up, and I had to carry you back here."
    r "不知道。我醒来时他们就消失了，只好把你背回这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_c5e8693e:

    # "Rahim shrugs."
    "雷希姆耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_41db2820:

    # s "When the ram carried you all bloody and unconscious, I thought you were a goner!"
    s "那只公羊把浑身是血、昏迷不醒的你背回来时，我还以为你没救了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_c1b0f83f:

    # e "I am fine now, Seb. I think. If I'm not dreaming now."
    e "我现在没事了，塞巴斯。我想是这样。只要我现在不是在做梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_76dc5abb:

    # "You look around, and see that Furkan presses down on his arm quite frequently."
    "你环顾四周，发现弗坎一直在按压自己的手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_43efe4fd:

    # e "Furkan, what's wrong with your arm?"
    e "弗坎，你的手臂怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1ec991e9:

    # f "Remember when we separated to chase down the cultists, I cannot ascertain the cause, but I got caught in a boulder trap."
    f "还记得我们分头去追那些邪教徒吗？我也说不清原因，但我中了落石陷阱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_f92e66df:

    # r "We lost the cultists, and this fool tried to climb over the rocks to catch them."
    r "我们跟丢了那些邪教徒，而这个蠢货为了追上他们，竟然试图爬过那些岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_cf600434:

    # "It was only now you realised Rahim sits in the corner of the room, his arms crossed as usual."
    "直到这时，你才意识到雷希姆正像往常一样，双臂交叉坐在房间角落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_a76cf5b2:

    # f "If I knew they had set a trap there, I would never let [e] fight that cultist alone."
    f "要是我知道他们在那里设了陷阱，我绝不会让[e]独自对付那个邪教徒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_efc5645e:

    # r "Oh, now you care about [e]. I said I would chase them alone, but you insisted on following me."
    r "哦，现在你倒是关心起[e]来了。我说过要一个人去追他们，可你非要跟着我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_b07820aa:

    # f "Do not jest, Rahim. We both left [e] to his own device. We should have stayed with him."
    f "别拿这个开玩笑，雷希姆。我们俩都把[e]丢下不管了，本该留下来陪着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_796c9c18:

    # s "If only you two tell me what the fuck's going on?"
    s "你们俩倒是告诉我他妈到底发生了什么啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_e64c9f57:

    # r "None of your business, lion."
    r "不关你的事，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_88974e6b_1:

    # "You look around, and see that Rahim sits in the corner of the room, his arms crossed as usual."
    "你环顾四周，看到雷希姆像往常一样抱着双臂，坐在房间角落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_4c7f0561_1:

    # e "Uhm... what happened back there?"
    e "呃……刚才到底发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_0623b33b:

    # r "I have no idea. That son of a goat cast a spell on us. We were lucky to get out of there alive."
    r "我完全不知道。那个山羊杂种对我们施了法。我们能活着出来，已经算走运了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_9c7ecd65:

    # s "Those cultists ran really fast, I couldn't get a hold on them before they disappeared."
    s "那些邪教徒跑得太快了，等他们消失前我都没能抓住他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_00849d21:

    # s "I had to drag you two out of that place, at least Rahim woke up pretty quickly."
    s "我不得不把你们两个从那地方拖出来，至少雷希姆很快就醒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_5d6b9176:

    # s "I'm sorry we left you alone there, [e]. We were both too busy chasing the thieves."
    s "抱歉把你一个人留在那里，[e]。我们俩都忙着追那些小偷。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1dc9d550:

    # o "Yeah, thieves, if only you told me what you two were up to."
    o "对，小偷。你要是早点告诉我你们两个在搞什么就好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_ff692bd0:

    # "You look at Rahim, his everlasting tired face seems to brighten as you wake."
    "你看向雷希姆；你醒来后，他那张总是疲惫的脸似乎也明亮了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_569cbbc4:

    # r "Is he going to be alright?"
    r "他没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_859e9a2e:

    # o "[e] will be fine."
    o "[e]会没事的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_92d10a2c:

    # "Rahim silently nod. You understand that he's not one to show his concern openly."
    "雷希姆默默点了点头。你明白，他不是那种会公开表现出担忧的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_377134fb:

    # "Ole returns to you, tending on the wound carefully. You let out a lout grunt as his claws ruffles the fur around there."
    "奥利回到你身边，小心地处理伤口。他的爪子拨弄着那里的毛发时，你发出一声响亮的哼声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_71f4b5ba:

    # o "Now, the back of your head is struck quite hard. Not to mention your previous injury when we first found you."
    o "现在，你的后脑勺受到了相当重的一击。更别提我们第一次找到你时，你身上就有的那处伤了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_8a7cae33:

    # "The lizard grabs a bottle of wine and pours it onto a piece of white pad, it quickly soaks up the alcohol and turns red."
    "那只蜥蜴拿起一瓶酒，倒在一块白色敷料上；敷料很快吸收了酒精，变成了红色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_aa212490:

    # o "Sebas told me you were fighting some cultists in a temple, they seems pretty strong, but at least you managed to survive."
    o "塞巴斯告诉我，你当时正在一座神殿里和几个邪教徒战斗。他们似乎很强，但至少你活了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_3c7a147f:

    # o "We weren't sure what happened at all. Rahim wouldn't let us know anything more except that you stumbled upon some cultists... somewhere."
    o "我们完全不清楚到底发生了什么。除了说你……在某个地方撞见了邪教徒，雷希姆什么都不肯再告诉我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_dc1517e6:

    # o "With the minor injuries, you should have been awake when he brought you back, but somehow... you were still unconscious, as if something is holding you back."
    o "伤势并不重，他把你带回来时，你本该已经醒了，可不知怎么的……你还是昏迷不醒，仿佛有什么东西在阻止你醒来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_c84102ae:

    # "Ole clutches at the dressing on the back of your head, replacing it with the one he had on his hand."
    "奥利抓住你后脑勺上的敷料，把它换成他手里那块。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_853c4282:

    # e "Is it serious? Do I have to rest for a while?"
    e "严重吗？我得休息一阵子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_e1bcaeae:

    # o "I don't know. But for your own sake, you should take it easy for a while. We'll be here if you need anything."
    o "我不知道。但为了你自己着想，你还是暂时悠着点吧。你有任何需要，我们都会在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_7bb02063:

    # "You nod, and lay back down on the bed."
    "你点了点头，又躺回床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_e5b06810:

    # e "Furkan, how long have you been here? I thought you had a tribe to run."
    e "弗坎，你在这里待多久了？我还以为你有个部落要管理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_bf798bc2:

    # f "I do, but I cannot leave you alone here. Even as we're in good hands as Ole."
    f "是的，但我不能把你一个人留在这里。况且有奥利照顾你，我也放心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_48faa954:

    # f "The general is ostensibly mad at me for even trying to step foot in Lusterfield. Or attempting the quest we had back there."
    f "将军显然因为我甚至试图踏入卢斯特菲尔德而对我很恼火。或者说，因为我试图完成我们之前接下的任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_d928e15b:

    # f "But I wanted to make sure you were alright before I left."
    f "但我还是想在离开前确认你没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_f047f91d:

    # s "Nah, this chief here told me he just wanted to get away from his little general."
    s "不，这位酋长告诉我，他只是想躲开他那位小将军。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_be682461:

    # "Furkan glares at Sebas, but the lion only grins back at him."
    "弗坎瞪着塞巴斯，但那头狮子只是朝他咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_8ee38a14:

    # s "Hey! I'm just kidding here. It's like a rite of passage if you want to stay in my shop, you know."
    s "嘿！我只是在开玩笑。这算是一种入门仪式嘛，想留在我的店里就得经历这些，你懂的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_ddae4010:

    # e "Thank you, Furkan. I don't know if I fully deserved your courtesy, but I'm grateful for it."
    e "谢谢你，弗坎。我不知道自己是否完全配得上你的礼遇，但我对此很感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_8ee6e32f:

    # "You lift your head, but the pain in your head quickly reminds you of the wound."
    "你抬起头来，但头部的疼痛很快让你想起了伤口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_daad9cfb:

    # o "Well, let's not disturb him longer. He needs some rest now."
    o "好了，别再打扰他了。他现在需要休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_d96a0386:

    # s "Get well soon, [e]!"
    s "祝你早日康复，[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_673e743f:

    # "You smile at Sebas, and wave them goodbye."
    "你朝塞巴斯微笑着，挥手向他们道别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_732a0e80:

    # "The two shopkeepers quietly walk outside. Leaving you alone with Rahim in the room."
    "两位店主悄悄走了出去，把你和房间里的雷希姆单独留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_10ed024a:

    # "Both Furkan and Sebas nod, they quietly walk outside and Ole follows suit. Leaving you alone with Rahim in the room."
    "弗坎和塞巴斯都点了点头，悄悄走到外面，奥利也跟了出去，把你和房间里的雷希姆单独留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_54d81770:

    # r "I heard from Sebas that he first found you in the green forest, unconscious and bleeding."
    r "我听塞巴斯说，他最初是在那片绿色森林里发现你的。当时你昏迷不醒，还在流血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_f088a016:

    # "The old bull sits on the side of the bed. He looks at you with a concerned look."
    "那头老公牛在床边坐下，忧心忡忡地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_00faca0b:

    # e "I did. I told them everything I knew, or remembered."
    e "是的。我把自己知道的，或者记得的一切都告诉了他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_adfb3a82:

    # r "And today, when the cultists escaped, we cleared out the traps left behind in the temple."
    r "今天邪教徒逃走后，我们清理了神殿里留下的陷阱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_8a8532f5:

    # r "When we followed the path, you know where it led to?"
    r "我们沿着那条路追过去，你知道它通向哪里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1f56ce6c:

    # r "It led to the same forest where you were found. There is a secret passage from the temple to the green forest."
    r "它通向发现你的那片森林。神殿里有一条通往绿色森林的秘密通道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_5bd8695b:

    # r "These people hid under our snouts for ages, I cannot let them get off that easily."
    r "这些人就在我们眼皮底下藏了这么多年，我不能就这么轻易放过他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_6da7f7ba:

    # r "By god's name, if these were the same thief who stole the primordial runes all along... and we protected them from Tevfik-"
    r "看在神的份上，如果这些人一直就是那个偷走原初符文的窃贼……而我们还保护他们不受特夫菲克——"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_3e078ea6:

    # e "You couldn't have known, Rahim. You did what you thought was right. It's not your fault."
    e "你不可能知道，雷希姆。你只是做了你认为正确的事。这不是你的错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_d915aa22:

    # r "It is! My people looked up to me. They were left to defend themselves when I was the one who forbade the goats from finding the culprit."
    r "就是我的错！我的族人敬仰我。可在我禁止山羊寻找真凶时，他们只能靠自己保护自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_266348e9:

    # r "How could I be so blinded by my rage, as to have never trusted the intention of Tevfik. And to assume that the goats were the real threat."
    r "我怎么会被愤怒蒙蔽到这种地步，从未相信特夫菲克的用意，还认定山羊才是真正的威胁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_e2f44f61:

    # r "I was a good tailor... but I was not a good mayor, [e], and... I was not a good father."
    r "我曾是个好裁缝……但我不是个好市长，[e]，而且……我也不是个好父亲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_bcd6f23f:

    # e "The Rahim I know would never have let his people down. You did what you thought was right, and that's all that matters."
    e "我认识的那个雷希姆绝不会让他的族人失望。你只是做了你认为正确的事，而这才是最重要的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_c4de7b55:

    # e "It's not the end, Rahim. We can still find out who these people are, soon enough."
    e "这还不是结局，雷希姆。我们很快就能查出这些人究竟是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1cdf7aa3:

    # "Your hand reaches out to Rahim, sweeping across at his arm."
    "你的手伸向雷希姆，掠过他的手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_dda9af7d:

    # r "This is my last chance to make it right, [e]. I cannot let these people get away with what they did."
    r "这是我最后一次挽回一切的机会，[e]。我不能让那些人对他们所做的一切逍遥法外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_c48f7ea6:

    # "Rahim continues muttering, stumbling over his words. But you didn't catch much of it, your mind wandering back and forth between the dream and the reality."
    "雷希姆仍在喃喃自语，说话时磕磕绊绊。但你没听清多少，思绪在梦境与现实之间来回游移。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1c73a4e6:

    # "You try to recall what had happened between when you were defeated by the cultist, and now. Surely they would not leave you alive if so..."
    "你试图回想自己被邪教徒击败到现在之间发生了什么。如果真是那样，他们肯定不会留你活着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_74ee41f5:

    # "But it was all blank, you weren't even sure if you ever lost to the cultist truly, the gap of memory in your brain scares you."
    "可脑海中一片空白，你甚至不确定自己是否真的曾败给那个邪教徒；记忆中的这段空缺让你感到害怕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_eed7c9c2:

    # "At least, you can feel yourself being changed in some ways, you can feel the power of the shepherd's pendant still lingering in your mind."
    "至少，你能感觉到自己正在以某种方式发生变化，也能感觉到牧羊人吊坠的力量仍在你的脑海中萦绕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1da013bb:

    # "You can feel the pull, the whisper at the edge of your consciousness, but you have managed to resist it."
    "你能感受到那股牵引，也能听见意识边缘的低语，但你成功抵抗住了它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_3d293e9d:

    # "{i}The shepherd comes for us all.{/i}"
    "{i}牧羊人会来找我们所有人。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_0a830506:

    # "You keep seeing Chime, as if he is standing next to Rahim. You keep hearing his voice, as if he is whispering in your ear to come back to the village."
    "你不断看见齐门，仿佛他正站在雷希姆身旁；你不断听见他的声音，仿佛他在你耳边低语，让你回到村子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_4e40f8bf:

    # "After a long absence in your life, all of a sudden the wolf dragon comes back and ravishes your mind with his presence."
    "在你的生命中消失了这么久之后，狼龙突然归来，他的存在肆意侵占着你的心智。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_4a03386f:

    # "He was your best friend at one point, but you admit your memory of him had faded until that dream."
    "他曾是你最要好的朋友，但你也承认，直到那个梦出现之前，你对他的记忆早已逐渐淡去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_dd07a1aa:

    # "But still, you cannot stand to abandon him to the cultists. He was the reason you ended up here in the firt place."
    "但即便如此，你也无法忍心把他丢给那些邪教徒。他正是你来到这里的根本原因。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_1454d98a:

    # r "I should not have laid all of this upon you as everyone else seemed to do so. You have your own problems to deal with."
    r "我不该像其他人那样，把这一切都压到你身上。你也有自己的问题要处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_33f4830e:

    # "Your attention quickly shifts back onto the back of the brown bull. For a moment you remember how much this world has meant to you right now."
    "你的注意力很快又回到了那头棕色公牛的背上。有那么一刻，你想起此刻这个世界对你而言究竟有多么重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_f4279ea3:

    # r "At least we have a common goal, you and me. We will find out who these people are, and what they want to do with the primordial runes."
    r "至少你我有着共同的目标。我们会查清这些人是谁，以及他们想拿原初符文做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_7447b2dc:

    # e "I will help you, Rahim. I promise."
    e "我会帮你的，雷希姆。我保证。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_61bc6bc1:

    # "He nods, and stands up."
    "他点了点头，站起身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_4412030f:

    # r "Strange things are happening in Lusterfield now, ever since your arrival- or the death of Tevfik, or... the moment the old mayor found the temple."
    r "自从你来到卢斯特菲尔德以来——或者说，自从特夫菲克死去，又或者……自从老市长发现那座神殿的那一刻起——这里就一直发生着怪事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_457f8bce:

    # r "I cannot finger the moment it all started, but I know we are treading on dangerous waters, and things only get stranger from here."
    r "我说不准这一切究竟是从什么时候开始的，但我知道我们正踏入险境，而从现在起，事情只会变得更加诡异。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_472fee7d:

    # r "There is a long journey ahead of us, [e]."
    r "我们前方还有一段漫长的旅程，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_9a23bc05:

    # "He walks towards the door, and stops."
    "他朝门口走去，然后停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_50fb7f59:

    # r "I will leave you to rest now. You've earned it."
    r "我先让你休息吧。你值得好好休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_7daa5386:

    # "As soon as Rahim exit the room. You close your eyes, trying to forget the burden that was just laid upon you."
    "雷希姆一离开房间，你便闭上双眼，试图忘掉刚刚压到你身上的负担。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_f550fee3:

    # "You try to recall that gap again."
    "你再次试图回想那段空缺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_7bcaf9db:

    # "Something crosses your mind, and you quickly push it away. Perhaps deep down in your mind, you don't really want to remember."
    "某个念头掠过你的脑海，你赶紧将它推开。也许在内心深处，你其实并不愿意记起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_722a6f66:

    # "The sense of uncertainty quickly preys upon your vulnerable mind, you can't shake off the thought that you might hurt someone you may love."
    "不确定感很快侵蚀了你脆弱的心灵，你无法摆脱自己可能会伤害某个你所爱之人的念头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_b6834d9e:

    # "You try to remember that dream."
    "你试着回想那个梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_46b4abbe:

    # "But it was all fading away again, like a distant memory. You remembered you saw Chime there, but you couldn't even remember what he looked like."
    "可一切又在逐渐淡去，宛如遥远的记忆。你记得自己在那里见过齐门，却连他的模样都想不起来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_ff4c0a5d:

    # "You only know he was the one friend you ever wanted. Someone took him away, and that hole he left behind is yet to be filled."
    "你只知道，他是你一直渴望拥有的唯一朋友。有人把他带走了，而他留下的空缺至今仍无人填补。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_cf8f2af0:

    # "Afraid of tending to the horrible thoughts, you drift off to sleep, and let the world take you away."
    "你害怕继续面对那些可怕的念头，便渐渐睡去，任由世界将你带走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_c090dee4:

    # "When you wake up again, you feel a bit better, partly thanks to the lack of confusing dreams. It seems the wound on your head is healing well."
    "再次醒来时，你感觉好了一些，部分得益于没有做那些令人困惑的梦。看来你头上的伤口恢复得不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_6dc9de64:

    # "You throw away the dressing, and ruffle your hair to shake off any residues. You feel a bit better, and maybe you can get up now."
    "你把绷带扔到一旁，抓了抓头发，抖掉残留物。感觉好了一些，也许现在可以起床了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Mayor_Quest_Waking_End_3fb51132:

    # "You stand up from the bed, and walk towards the window. The sun is shining, and the village is bustling with life as usual."
    "你从床上起身，走向窗边。阳光灿烂，村子一如往常，充满了生机。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_70852fdd:

    # "Turning around, you almost bump into the mask of the robed person, but he does not speak, the man only faces you with a tilted head."
    "转过身时，你差点撞上那个身披长袍之人的面具，但他没有说话，只是歪着头面对着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_4d45b179:

    # acolyte "Your initiation is not yet finished, I am afraid."
    acolyte "恐怕，你的入会仪式还没有结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_f736c239:

    # "He strokes your cheek with one hand, his fingers tracing along the fur on your face."
    "他用一只手抚摸你的脸颊，手指沿着你脸上的毛发划过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_542fa897:

    # acolyte "Look at this pendant, brother."
    acolyte "看看这个吊坠，兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_76cfbede:

    # "You sense a tone of intimacy from his voice, as he gently raises sits on the ground again, gesturing your eyes to follow him."
    "你从他的声音中感受到一丝亲密意味，只见他轻轻地再次坐到地上，示意你的目光跟随他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_10a38831:

    # "You don't know why but your body responds automatically, it was almost like instinct, as if his soothing voice was a trigger."
    "你不知道为什么，但身体却自动作出回应，几乎就像本能一样，仿佛他那令人舒缓的声音就是触发开关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_9e9fd943:

    # "Your eyes follow the movement of the pendant, for the first time, as far as you can remember."
    "这是你记忆中第一次，你的双眼跟随着吊坠的摆动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_75da357d:

    # acolyte "You are always one of us. One of the brotherhood."
    acolyte "你永远都是我们的一员。兄弟会的一员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_0270ba41:

    # "As the goat man talks, you feel your thoughts are getting clearer. It is as if the swinging pendant is talking to you directly."
    "随着这个羊人开口说话，你感觉自己的思绪越来越清晰，仿佛那枚摇摆的吊坠正直接对你诉说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_f1ae9937:

    # "You begin to realize the purpose of your existence. It is your duty to follow the shepherd."
    "你开始意识到自己存在的意义。你的职责就是追随牧羊者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_caa6bda7:

    # "To be his faithful servant, and to help the shepherd bring peace and harmony to the realm."
    "成为他忠诚的仆人，帮助牧羊者为这片领域带来和平与和谐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_1061ec07:

    # e "Yes, brother."
    e "是的，兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_e0bc6c8c:

    # acolyte "After this pendant stops, you will not remember me or our encounter."
    acolyte "这枚吊坠停止摆动后，你将不会记得我，也不会记得我们之间的遭遇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_b7b733da:

    # "The goatman whispers in your ear as he stands up."
    "羊人站起身来，同时在你耳边低语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_bd531e85:

    # acolyte "For all you know, we escaped after your defeat. You will stay here and rest, and your memories will be restored."
    acolyte "你只会以为我们在你被击败后逃走了。你会留在这里休息，记忆也会恢复。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_bb2a1c98:

    # acolyte "You will resume your previous life, living as if you are uninitiated."
    acolyte "你会回归从前的生活，像从未入教一样活下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_23ccd730:

    # acolyte "But not for long."
    acolyte "但不会持续太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_9b7b79a0:

    # acolyte "When the shepherd calls for you, you will remember your true identity, and obey him at any cost."
    acolyte "当牧羊人呼唤你时，你会记起自己的真实身份，不惜一切代价服从他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_c00fd3ad:

    # "The masked cultist speaks with a soft and soothing tone. You look up at the cultist, and nod in response."
    "戴面具的邪教徒用轻柔而安抚的语调说话。你抬头看向他，点头回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_c84e244b:

    # acolyte "You have a long journey ahead of you, brother."
    acolyte "你前方还有一段漫长的旅程，兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_38b568e6:

    # "He says softly as he strokes your head."
    "他一边抚摸着你的头，一边轻声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_271bf9bb:

    # acolyte "We will meet again. May the shepherd watch over you and guide you in the days to come."
    acolyte "我们还会再见的。愿牧羊人在未来的日子里守护你，引导你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_52312640:

    # "The pendant slowly comes to a stop, just as your eye begin to feel heavy."
    "吊坠缓缓停了下来，正当你的眼皮开始变得沉重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_cb1456fd:

    # acolyte "Sleep now."
    acolyte "现在睡吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Temple_Acolyte_Hypnosis_Aftermath_a173aa20:

    # "Your head feels hazy, and your mind begins to slip away again."
    "你的脑袋昏昏沉沉，意识再次开始飘离。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_4069531c:

    # "A loud howl echoes through the village, as you see Lothar standing in the middle of the village."
    "一声响亮的狼嚎回荡在村子里，你看见洛萨尔站在村子中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_2d322a65:

    # "You walk towards the furious wolf, a bottle of beer held tightly in his hand."
    "你朝那头怒气冲冲的狼走去，他手里紧紧攥着一瓶啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_9221ff34:

    # "In front of him are Amble and Jog, both glance at you as you inch closer."
    "安布和乔格站在他面前，你一点点靠近时，两人都瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_2d2f4c25:

    # l "Bunch of cowards... you all, you all are ungrateful bastards."
    l "一群懦夫……你们，你们全都是忘恩负义的混蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_a5b334ad:

    # "Lothar's eyes are bloodshot, his fur bristling with anger."
    "洛萨尔双眼充血，皮毛因愤怒而竖起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_3584f889:

    # a "Look, Lot-"
    a "等等，洛——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_e5dc8232:

    # l "Look me in the eyes and tell me you didn't betray my trust."
    l "看着我的眼睛，告诉我你没有背叛我的信任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_641203a4:

    # l "I treated you two as ones of my own, my ally. I saved you two when you both were on the edge of peril, took you two into my own house."
    l "我把你们两个当作自己人，当作我的盟友。你们两个身陷险境时，是我救了你们，还把你们收进了自己的家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_0cb8d353:

    # l "We hunted together for years you two. Why..."
    l "你们两个一起打猎这么多年了。为什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_6a97891d:

    # j "Lot... you are drunk."
    j "洛……你喝醉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_9b0f0230:

    # l "Shut the fuck up. I know what you two voted."
    l "给我他妈闭嘴。我知道你们两个投了什么票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_148bf067:

    # l "After what I told you, reminded you beforehand, and you stabbed me behind my b-back!"
    l "我之前都告诉过你、提醒过你了，可你却在背后捅了我一刀！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_ac8d8c87:

    # l "The goats were the reason why you ended up by yourself in the first place, Jog."
    l "当初正是那些山羊害得你落得孤身一人，乔格。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_91c52eda:

    # l "And you, Amb. I've told you not to build that damn bridge, what the fuck is wrong with you."
    l "还有你，安布。我早就告诉过你别去造那座该死的桥，你他妈到底哪里不对劲？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_7915bafe:

    # a "Calm down, Lot. Just take a deep breath."
    a "冷静点，洛。深呼吸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_c9779b84:

    # a "The goats were good people, it's not that bad as-"
    a "那些山羊都是好人，没那么糟糕——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_252b857a:

    # l "SHUT UP! I'm done with you trecherous fiends, I saved the entire village, and now you ask to be friends with the villains!"
    l "闭嘴！我受够你们这些叛徒了。我救了整个村子，而你们现在居然要和那些恶棍做朋友！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_22340c7e:

    # "The wolf's thorax pulses, his snout contorts into undescribable contours."
    "狼人的胸膛一阵起伏，口鼻扭曲成难以名状的形状。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_2ac4413d:

    # l "Fucking pretenders."
    l "该死的冒牌货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_d29f2fb7:

    # "He paces back and forth, holding his fist tightly."
    "他紧紧攥着拳头，来回踱步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_2d012516:

    # l "I knew-"
    l "我知道——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_183ed02c:

    # "The wolf raises his head, that is when both your eyes meet."
    "狼人抬起头，就在那一刻，你们四目相对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_589d35cb:

    # "Before you know it, Lothar rushes forwards with a handful of his sharp claws."
    "你还没反应过来，洛萨尔便挥舞着一把锋利的爪子冲了上来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_d15edf6a:

    # e "S-shit."
    e "糟、糟了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_e9ef6add:

    # l "You dare show your face to me!" nointeract
    l "你竟敢出现在我面前！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_f79ccc5c:

    # "You try to dodge as his fist flies in your direction, but it's too late, it hits you right on the side of the cheek."
    "你试图躲开迎面挥来的拳头，可已经太迟了，拳头正正打在你的脸颊侧面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_dd78975f:

    # "You stagger back, feeling dizzy and disorientated, and then a second blow catches you on the shoulder and knocks you to the ground."
    "你踉跄着退后，感到头晕目眩、方向错乱，紧接着第二击打中你的肩膀，将你击倒在地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_2153ad46:

    # l "Fucking coward, admit it, you can't fucking handle me. I ca-"
    l "你这个该死的懦夫，承认吧，你根本不是我的对手。我能——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_6f21da2d:

    # l "-Aargh!"
    l "——啊啊！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_34f369ec:

    # "You see the red bear running towards you, grabbing Lothar by the arm."
    "你看见那头红熊朝你跑来，一把抓住洛萨尔的手臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_e42f5cda:

    # l "F-fuck off, Amble."
    l "滚、滚开，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_c3846258:

    # a "I am not standing by and watch you beat the crap out of our friend. That's not how a real hero should behave."
    a "我不会眼睁睁看着你把我们的朋友揍得屁滚尿流。真正的英雄不该这样做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_df11c414:

    # l "How fucking dare you. I'll kick your ass if I need to."
    l "你他妈的竟敢这么说。我有必要的话，就把你的屁股踢烂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_bc667122:

    # "The two men glare at each other. You can see that Lothar is furious, but Amble stands his ground."
    "两人怒目相视。你看得出洛萨尔怒不可遏，但安布寸步不让。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_b8eadfa5:

    # a "You are being unreasonable. Come on, Lot, we're all friends here."
    a "你太不讲理了。好了，洛特，我们都是朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_c883596e:

    # l "You talking to me about friends! Fuck you!"
    l "你跟我谈朋友？去你妈的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_c2f76f00:

    # "The wolf holds his fist tightly, he charges toward Amble with a strong stance."
    "狼人紧紧攥着拳头，摆开架势朝安布冲去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_1b483763:

    # "Amble is shocked by the sudden move, and he staggers back a step."
    "安布被这突如其来的举动惊住，踉跄着后退了一步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_d7760a05:

    # "Just as Lothar is about to throw his fist, something trips him, causing the hero to fall forward and land face-first in the dirt."
    "就在洛萨尔即将挥拳时，某个东西绊倒了他，导致这位英雄向前扑倒，脸朝下栽进了泥土里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_1e7e0446:

    # "You raise your head, and notice Jog standing over the shadow."
    "你抬起头，注意到乔格正站在那道影子上方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_39ddd2c5:

    # j "Don't lay your hands on Amble, friend."
    j "别对安布动手，朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_c5679ed9:

    # "You sit up, wincing as pain shoots through your side, and watch as Jog swings his leg onto the grey wolf."
    "你忍着侧腹窜过的疼痛坐起身，看着乔格抬腿跨到灰狼身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_f393c93c:

    # "A loud yelp has made you shudder, it's clearly Jog held himself when he tripped Lothar over, but it still left the wolf weary."
    "一声响亮的痛叫让你浑身一颤，显然乔格在绊倒洛萨尔时收住了力，但还是让那头狼疲惫不堪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_fb27478c:

    # l "F-fuck! Fuck! Fuck! F-wack all of you!"
    l "操！操！操！操你们所有人！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Fail_86610aed:

    # "Lothar struggles to stand up. He glares at everyone before patting the dirt and dust off his face."
    "洛萨尔挣扎着站起身，瞪了所有人一眼，然后拍去脸上的泥土和尘埃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_0602316e:

    # "You tilt your head in time as his fist zips through the air."
    "你及时侧头，躲过了他破空挥来的拳头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_cfe7f37d:

    # "That hit would have done some damage on your snout, but instead, Lothar stumbles forwards, it takes him a few steps to regain his balance."
    "那一拳本会重重击中你的口鼻，但洛萨尔反而踉跄着向前跌去，走了几步才重新站稳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_24990692:

    # e "Hey, are you a-"
    e "喂，你是不是——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_5b5efa71:

    # l "Y-you piece of shit. Think you are better than me?"
    l "你、你这个狗杂种。你以为自己比我强吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_64fad8c0:

    # "The mad wolf stifle a strong kick in your stomach, and you land on the ground with a loud thud."
    "那头发狂的狼朝你的腹部狠狠踢来，你重重摔在地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_e5de927e:

    # a "Watch it, Lot! Don't touch him."
    a "当心，洛特！别碰他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_23c67b3c:

    # "You press against your abdomen as you look up, The wolf's twisted face is quickly replaced by Amble's backside as he stands in front of you."
    "你捂着腹部抬头望去，灰狼那张扭曲的脸很快被安布的背影挡住了，他正站在你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_6612b9d7:

    # a "Blame me. It was my idea to restore the bridge, I simply asked [e] to help along."
    a "怪我。修复桥梁是我的主意，我只是请[e]来帮忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_65de118f:

    # "You see Jog looks at the three of you with a slightly gaped mouth, it's certain he never wants to be in this situation ever."
    "你看见乔格微微张着嘴望着你们三人，显然他再也不想陷入这种局面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_fd317d92:

    # l "Blame you? Oh I did blame you. But this welp is nothing but disappointment."
    l "怪你？哦，我当然怪你。但这个小崽子只会让人失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_c15214aa:

    # a "Look, Lot. We all just have one vote. Our votes' worth as much as the common folks next doors."
    a "听着，洛特。我们每个人都只有一票。我们的票，和隔壁那些平民的票一样有分量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_65de118f_1:

    # "You see Jog looks at the three of you with a slightly gaped mouth, it's certain he never wants to be in this situation ever."
    "你看见乔格微微张着嘴望着你们三人，显然他再也不想陷入这种局面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_5f30bcb8:

    # l "Why are you defending him. He pretended to be my disciple... he-"
    l "你为什么要护着他？他假装是我的门徒……他——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_5567b78b:

    # e "Lot-"
    e "洛特——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_fc059384:

    # l "Let me get his fucking ass beat-"
    l "让我狠狠揍扁他的屁股——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_9da17fb3:

    # l "This one fucking voted for the goats."
    l "这个家伙他妈的投了山羊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_b3bc3997:

    # l "You know how I found out? I marked you three's fucking ballots."
    l "知道我是怎么发现的吗？我他妈的在你们三个的选票上做了记号。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_c75502f4:

    # a "Go home, Lot."
    a "回家去，洛特。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_3204c755:

    # a "Being a hero doesn't give you the privilege to mess with your friends."
    a "当英雄并不代表你就有资格拿朋友寻开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_b93aeb1b:

    # l "You-"
    l "你——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_275bd621:

    # a "We stuck with you, because you were our friends, our brother-in-arms. Not because of that one good deed you've done years ago."
    a "我们一直站在你这边，是因为你是我们的朋友，是并肩作战的兄弟。不是因为你多年前做过的那件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_6269d5e9:

    # "The wolf's eyes widen."
    "狼的双眼睁大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_bfd93b60:

    # l "You..."
    l "你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_8af8a70c:

    # l "I can't be bothered with these snobs, Jog, you're standing me by."
    l "我才懒得理这些势利鬼，乔格，你得站在我这边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_32aa4b2d:

    # "He turns to the hyena, who lays still on the hay stacks, shooting him a stare nonchalantly."
    "他转向那只鬣狗，对方仍躺在干草堆上，漫不经心地瞪着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_be038a6e:

    # j "Yeah, you're just drunk."
    j "是啊，你只是喝醉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_ae4f6058:

    # l "No I'm not. You think I am some debauched jerks?"
    l "才没有。你觉得我是那种放荡的混蛋吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_57e0d443:

    # "Lothar jumps at the accusation, ostensibly his face is not of one that's drunk, but same can hardly be said of his behaviours."
    "洛萨尔被这番指责激得跳了起来；表面上看，他的脸并不像醉汉，但他的行为就很难说了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_fae3392b:

    # l "I- I saved you."
    l "我——我救过你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_2997691a:

    # j "Amble said what I wanted to say, Lot."
    j "安布替我把想说的话说出来了，洛特。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_cde9ce73:

    # "It rendered Lothar speechless, maybe he was stunned by everyone suddenly turning their backs against him, or that he had no rebuttal to answer."
    "这让洛萨尔一时哑口无言；也许是大家突然背弃了他令他震惊，也许是他根本无从反驳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_Countdown_Success_f2da13de:

    # l "W-what is this... huh?"
    l "这、这是怎么回事……啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c0ee31ed:

    # l "You all claimed to be my f-friends, and this is how you treat your friends!"
    l "你们都说是我的朋友，可你们就是这样对待朋友的吗！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_2388d082:

    # a "Lot, you know. If everyone tells you you drank too much, maybe it's not the world that's drunk."
    a "洛特，你想想。要是所有人都说你喝太多了，那也许不是全世界都醉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_6ea8a706:

    # "The red bear crosses his arms, his face stern with tinte of sadness that only friends would feel for each other."
    "红熊抱起双臂，神情严肃，脸上带着只有朋友才会为彼此流露的悲伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_959784f0:

    # l "I am not drunk!"
    l "我没醉！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_082ec7fc:

    # "Lothar stares into the depth of Amble's eyes, perhaps somewhere deep down he knows it is wrong, but he stands firm nonetheless."
    "洛萨尔凝视着安布双眼深处；也许在内心深处，他知道自己错了，但他依然固执己见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_8dcacdfd:

    # l "You are coming with me, disciple!"
    l "你跟我走，弟子！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_344ba337:

    # "In truth, you sound confused by his request, it had came out of nowhere, and you can hardly respond."
    "说真的，你听起来被他的请求弄得一头雾水。那请求来得毫无征兆，你几乎不知该如何回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1a307c40:

    # "At the time where he has had no one else, he clings onto you still, even as he had known you for less than all of his friends."
    "在他身边再没有其他人的时候，他依然紧紧依赖着你，尽管相较于他的那些朋友，他认识你的时间还没那么长。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c4086d54:

    # e "Where are we going?"
    e "我们要去哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1b546354:

    # l "With me, now!"
    l "跟我走，现在！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_717be612:

    # "You hope that it was purely because he enjoyed your company enough, not a desperate ruse to prey on someone fervidly gullible."
    "你希望这纯粹是因为他足够喜欢和你相处，而不是为了利用一个极其容易受骗的人而使出的绝望伎俩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_b6e05b3e:

    # "Both the hyena and the bear turns to you, they look worried, but the times spent with Lothar taught them that he won't easily hurt you... again."
    "鬣狗和熊都转向你，看起来忧心忡忡，但与洛萨尔相处的时光让他们明白，他不会轻易再伤害你……至少不会再。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9d1f7ab3:

    # "You nod hesitantly, dreading the talk that will ensue during this journey."
    "你迟疑地点点头，害怕这趟旅途中将要进行的谈话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9936100e:

    # "Lothar takes the strides in the direction of the village center, with the attitude that he has had, he expects you to follow behind, not besides."
    "洛萨尔迈步朝村中心走去，依旧摆着那副态度，意思是要你跟在他身后，而不是走在他身旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_ea317ab7:

    # "You look back, both Amble and Jog's eyes are filled with concern. You give them a gracious nod before running up to Lothar."
    "你回头看去，安布和乔格的眼中都满是担忧。你朝他们礼貌地点了点头，便跑去追上洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_8e404b23:

    # l "You were supposed to be by my side, disciple. What's the deal with you. I can't make sense of it."
    l "你本该站在我身边，徒弟。你这是怎么回事？我实在搞不懂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_7e111a05:

    # e "I liked you, Lothar, but I am not some errand boy you can lead by the snout."
    e "我曾经喜欢你，洛萨尔，但我不是任你牵着鼻子走的跑腿小厮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1789285f:

    # l "But I just did, didn't I? Why else will you come with me this easily."
    l "但我不是已经这么做了吗？不然你怎么会这么轻易跟我来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_fc3dc1b0:

    # "You frown, it is neither insightful nor shrewd, if anything, the wolf has exploited your sympathy again."
    "你皱起眉头，这话既不高明也不机敏；说到底，那头狼又一次利用了你的同情心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_68ff4702:

    # e "Because I had faith in you, but you tell me as if I had done something wrong."
    e "因为我信任你，可你却说得好像做错事的人是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_ce5e2486:

    # "The grey wolf clutches his hands, needless to say, his restraint had surprised you, the Lothar you knew would have rebuked you for even uttering a word."
    "灰狼攥紧双手，不必说，他这份克制让你颇为意外；你所认识的洛萨尔，哪怕你只说出一个字，都会斥责你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_924d8dda:

    # l "Walk faster, errand boy."
    l "走快点，跑腿小厮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_16cdfe8e:

    # "He chides you with a softer voice, almost like muttering under one's breath, but it made you smile for once."
    "他放轻声音斥责你，几乎像是在自言自语地嘟囔，但这次你总算笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_507e4754:

    # "You quickly pacen up, walking by Lothar's side as he wanders around the town aimlessly."
    "你连忙加快脚步，走到洛萨尔身旁，而他正漫无目的地在镇子里闲逛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_3384b944:

    # "Lusterfield is relatively quiet today, the vote earlier had worn the crowd thin, but business goes as usual as you trod your way down the village center."
    "今天的卢斯特菲尔德相对安静，早些时候的投票让人群散去了不少，但你沿着村中心走去时，生意依旧照常进行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_65f5028d:

    # "It's only travelling through the streets, that you recognized how many folks greeted Lothar on the way, most waved with a warm grin, some pointed at him, face full of astonishment."
    "穿过街道时，你才注意到一路上有多少人向洛萨尔打招呼；大多数人都带着温暖的笑容挥手，少数人则满脸惊讶地指着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_217891df:

    # "Of course, Lothar responded with a slick pose, jokingly snarl with his canines out. It is a wonder how many people loved him, despite all the public abasement he had imposed upon others."
    "洛萨尔自然摆出一个潇洒的姿势，露出犬齿，装模作样地低吼了一声。真令人惊讶，尽管他曾让别人当众蒙受各种羞辱，竟然还是有这么多人喜欢他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_d5a1ee8c:

    # "It was just now that Amble and Jog were interrogated in the open, you begin to ponder if they had knowingly chosen to ignore Lothar's flaws, or if it was all an act to appease him."
    "就在刚才，安布和乔格还在众目睽睽下被盘问，你开始思索，他们究竟是有意忽视了洛萨尔的缺点，还是这一切都只是为了安抚他而演的一场戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c8af8e99:

    # "From the time you know the wolf, he is often explosive, sometimes stubbornly charming. But to burst out at the friends he considered dearest, you did not think he had it in him."
    "自从你认识那头狼以来，他经常一点就爆，有时又固执得迷人。可要对他视为至交的朋友发火，你没想到他竟做得出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_23d172e1:

    # "You recall the splitting memory of greeting with the wolf, he was assertive, his satin eyes were teeming with confidence, not hatred."
    "你想起与那头狼相识时那段破碎的记忆：他态度强硬，绸缎般的双眼中满是自信，而非憎恨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9b8a98a6:

    # "More often than not, he spent time gloating about himself, you loathe being with him, sometimes repulsed when he berated you, but you could have seen the good intention in his heart."
    "大多数时候，他都在吹嘘自己。你厌恶和他相处，有时他训斥你更会让你反感，但你也曾看出他内心的一片好意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_309cbb02:

    # "After all, Lothar had accepted to train you at Ole's request in the first place, he showed you the ways of a capable fighter and offered to treat you as his own."
    "毕竟，最初还是应奥利的请求，洛萨尔才答应训练你；他教你成为一名出色战士的方法，还愿意把你当作自己人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9e7d8787:

    # "He has helped the village in many ways, whether it be for the greater goods or selfish reason, perhaps it truly makes no difference to the common folks."
    "他以各种方式帮助了村子，无论是为了更大的利益，还是出于自私的理由，对普通人来说，或许确实没有什么区别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_0b3e3d19:

    # l "Since being with you, disciple. My name's been tarnished to no extent."
    l "自从和你在一起以来，徒弟，我的名声简直被玷污得不成样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1051ece5:

    # l "I sent you to spy on the goats, and you saved their chief. I told you not to vote for the goats, and you charmed my friends into voting for them."
    l "我派你去监视山羊，你却救了它们的首领。我告诉你别投山羊的票，你却把我的朋友迷得投了它们的票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_13470367:

    # "To be fair, he was not wrong, every step of the way, you have been working against the wolf oversaw you as disciple."
    "公平地说，他并没有说错；从头到尾，你都在和那头把你收为徒弟的狼作对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_682128ea:

    # "You stutter, indeed you have good intentions, but to Lothar you had managed to hurt him more than anyone had."
    "你结结巴巴地说着，你的确是一片好意，可在洛萨尔看来，你伤他比任何人都深。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_2c4997d4:

    # l "And I almost forgot that time you let the lion humiliate me in front of the shop. How could I forget that..."
    l "我差点还忘了你曾让那头狮子在店铺前羞辱我。我怎么可能忘得掉那件事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_6d6aa871:

    # "Lothar raises his hand onto his forehead, figure out what had made him oblivious to your own volition."
    "洛萨尔抬手扶额，试图弄明白究竟是什么让他忽视了你的意愿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_de1f885a:

    # e "I do what I think is right."
    e "我只做我认为正确的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_88dc5d2e:

    # l "No doubt. You never cared."
    l "毫无疑问。你从来就没在乎过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_e2b357c9:

    # "That has taken you aback, his words are made to hurt you, and he has succeeded."
    "这让你猝然一怔；他的话本就是为了伤害你，而他成功了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_960ec0f4:

    # e "That's a lie, Lothar. And you know it."
    e "那是谎话，洛萨尔。你自己也知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_2583546c:

    # l "What about that day? That day when we both had quested and taken from that damn flower. Did you lie?"
    l "那一天呢？就是我们一起接任务、从那该死的花那里取走东西的那天。你撒谎了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_23da1b5e:

    # "Lothar recalls the time when the two of you slayed the flower monster, where the purple mist had left the two of you in heat."
    "洛萨尔想起了你们俩斩杀花怪的那次经历，那时紫色雾气让你们二人都欲火焚身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_523bec95:

    # "You assume it is the pollen's doing, but the memory is still so vivid to you, as if Lothar's hands were softly placed onto your hips at this very moment."
    "你以为那是花粉造成的，可那段记忆依旧鲜明得如同此刻洛萨尔的双手正轻柔地放在你的腰胯上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_49a9edb1:

    # "The gentle wolf swayed to your movement, hot breathes parted your fur fervously as you jostle yourself closer to his embrace."
    "温柔的狼随着你的动作摇摆，灼热的呼吸急促地掠过你的毛发，而你不断挪动身体，更贴近他的怀抱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_bbc15836:

    # "It was the first time you had felt something real in Lothar's body, as he stood bare and naked, both figuratively and in actuality."
    "那是你第一次真切感受到洛萨尔身体里的某种真实——那时他赤身裸体，无论喻意上还是事实上都是如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_869b56ac:

    # l "Was I wrong in trusting you?"
    l "我信错你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_dd3b2d7a:

    # "A shadow of his past self speaking, nonetheless. His verdent eyes gleaming under the sunlight."
    "尽管如此，说话的还是那个他昔日的影子。他碧绿的双眼在阳光下熠熠生辉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9a7150d9:

    # "You begin to wonder if that flower had revealed something he held dear to, or if it was merely altered mirage, a natural result of taking love dusts."
    "你开始怀疑，那朵花是否揭示了他珍视的某样东西，还是说那不过是一场扭曲的幻象，是服下爱情粉尘后自然产生的结果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_bc866e1e:

    # l "Did you ever feel anything?" nointeract
    l "你曾有过任何感觉吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9893f8de:

    # e "A little it is, but I did. You were... warm to me, for the first time."
    e "是有一点，但我确实有过。你第一次对我那么……温柔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_a0ed4da1:

    # l "Was my body the only thing you care? If so, you must be shallower than the ebbing tides on the shore, [e]."
    l "你在乎的就只有我的身体吗？如果是这样，那你可真是肤浅，连岸边退潮的海水都不如，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9e028341:

    # e "I had cared, Lothar. You never let me. What else can I do except to take on dusty chores for you?"
    e "我在乎过，洛萨尔。是你从不给我机会。除了替你做那些尘土飞扬的杂活，我还能怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_d1a2f7d9:

    # l "Maybe to take initiative and express your gratitude for once, I saved your ass from that river!"
    l "或许你该主动一次，表达一下谢意——我可是从那条河里救了你的狗命！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_65f7bb4b:

    # l "Maybe you should express your gratitude as I'm keeping my village safe, aren't you now one of us?"
    l "或许你也该表达谢意，毕竟我一直在保护我的村子。你现在不也算是我们的一员了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_e86122a8:

    # e "And you say I am shallow."
    e "你还说我肤浅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_3306881c:

    # l "Wh- how could you..."
    l "你——你怎么能……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_a5c640bd:

    # e "I should be honest with you, Lothar. I was not there... when it happened."
    e "我应该对你坦白，洛萨尔。事情发生的时候……我并不在场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c3c63878:

    # "Lothar exhales lightly, feinting a loud sigh. You would have noticed, if not for your own racing heartbeat."
    "洛萨尔轻轻呼气，假装发出一声响亮的叹息。要不是你自己心跳如擂，你本该注意到的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_38dcad5c:

    # l "I would have suspected. You were never like that."
    l "我本来会起疑的。你从来不是那样的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_b12a47c1:

    # "He was right, the sex had left you completely undone, as if you were a dictonary with every word decoded."
    "他说得没错，那场性爱让你彻底失去了自我，仿佛你是一本每个词都已解码的字典。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_ceec1e22:

    # e "I can say the same thing for you."
    e "我也可以对你说同样的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_215a8d46:

    # l "And I don't know why I brought that thing up. We both know that weren't the normal us."
    l "我也不知道自己为什么提起那件事。我们都知道，那不是平常的我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_6bf649f1:

    # e "And what would the normal us want? Meaningless quarrels one after another? Is that better than taking on the flower?"
    e "那平常的我们会想要什么？一场接一场毫无意义的争吵？那难道比接受这朵花更好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_d1f37062:

    # "He gulps nervously. Part of him had wished to embrace the lasting desire, but shame had taught him it is merely a fool's instinct."
    "他紧张地咽了口唾沫。他有一部分曾想拥抱这份长久的欲望，但羞耻让他明白，那不过是愚蠢的本能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_dcd330f9:

    # l "Takes one to know one."
    l "彼此彼此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_2a63fbeb:

    # "Lothar crosses his arms, he grows more impatient with every word you say."
    "洛萨尔抱起双臂，你每说一个字，他就越发不耐烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9ff99092:

    # l "I don't need your love, disciple. Honestly, I... I don't care. But it's weird you never said thanks to me."
    l "我不需要你的爱，门徒。说真的，我……我不在乎。但奇怪的是，你从没对我说过谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_ac63b37c:

    # l "You rendered everything that I've done invisible, you threw yourself onto the little details and left me with no dignity."
    l "你把我做过的一切都视若无物，只揪着那些琐碎细节不放，让我颜面尽失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_7e372df7:

    # e "I am sorry if I had ever hurt you, Lothar."
    e "如果我曾伤害过你，我很抱歉，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_3027de8b:

    # l "It was I who turned blind to you. I had hoped for someone capable to venture together, to share the hunting days with at last."
    l "是我对你视而不见。我曾希望能有一个有能力的人与我一同闯荡，终于一起度过那些狩猎的日子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_e0d4987c:

    # l "And once again, my suspicion is justified."
    l "看来我的怀疑又一次得到了证实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_a64b997f:

    # l "First it was Amble and Jog, then I turned to you, but as it turned out, everyone turned into a damn coward. Everyone turned on me."
    l "先是安布和乔格，后来我找上了你，可结果所有人都变成了该死的懦夫。所有人都背叛了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_f2975c55:

    # l "The longer they stayed with me, the more weary they have become... it's like I never killed-"
    l "他们和我待得越久，就变得越疲惫……就好像我从未杀过——"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_273cd6e7:

    # "Lothar stops suddenly, staring forwards, his brows furrowed."
    "洛萨尔突然停下脚步，皱着眉望向前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_0035846e:

    # "You look up with concern, the long silence had probably revealed something in him that left you pondering."
    "你忧心忡忡地抬起头，长久的沉默大概暴露了他内心的某些东西，让你陷入沉思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c2a7d3c0:

    # "Now, in front of you, you see a wolf in his barest form, he is not grunting, neither smiling."
    "此刻，你看到面前的他化作一匹最本真的狼；他没有低吼，也没有微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_3d11bbf0:

    # "Silence befalls the entire ground, neither of you has anything to say, the occasional glances you give speaks enough volume."
    "整个场地陷入寂静，你们谁都无话可说；你们偶尔投去的目光，已经说明了一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_943a6086:

    # l "Go back to the lion."
    l "回到那头狮子身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1544770c:

    # e "Is that it...?"
    e "就这样……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c2b07687:

    # l "Yeah, that is it."
    l "对，就这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_32ae539a:

    # "Lothar says softly."
    "洛萨尔轻声说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_76c6b782:

    # e "What about the talk?"
    e "那谈话呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9fc18c64:

    # e "It's like you never killed who?"
    e "就好像你从未杀过——谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_677bebdd:

    # e "Lot?"
    e "洛特？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c92b28c6:

    # "The Lothar you know would never stay silent on you like this, he would rather throw himself on the ground or push you onto the wall than to close his mouth."
    "你所认识的那个洛萨尔，绝不会像这样对你保持沉默；他宁可把自己摔在地上，或是把你推到墙上，也不会闭嘴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_5084e935:

    # "You stare at the begrudged wolf in surprise. Something about him worries you. Somehow, you begin to find his past rants endearing."
    "你惊讶地凝视着那匹心有不甘的狼。他身上的某些地方让你感到不安。不知不觉间，你竟开始觉得他过去那些咆哮还挺惹人怜爱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_7e0dd842:

    # e "Where are you going?"
    e "你要去哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_e76d7025:

    # "You shout as he begins to stroll towards the green forest."
    "他刚开始朝那片翠绿的森林漫步，你便喊道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1e8be04b:

    # l "Hunting."
    l "去打猎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_37105b36:

    # "The iron sword on his back begins to glisten. Every step he stomps heavier, determination washes over his grey fur."
    "背上的铁剑开始闪闪发光。他每一步都踩得更重，坚定的意志浸透了他灰色的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_5b0caf11:

    # "You feel no hostility in him, despite all the words spoken between the two of you, he still holds a soft spot for you."
    "尽管你们之间说过那么多话，你却感觉不到他对你有任何敌意；他依然对你抱有一丝特别的情感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_ba65d937:

    # "You feel no hostility in him, nor fidelity, it is as if you were another nameless villager to him."
    "你感觉不到他的敌意，也感觉不到他的亲近，仿佛对他而言，你只是另一个无名的村民。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_37aaf309:

    # "You stand watching him go, there was no farewell, no goodbyes, not even a hug to be shared. Only the coldness of the leather cover trodding on the path."
    "你站在那里目送他离去，没有道别，没有告别，甚至没有一个拥抱。只有皮革鞋底冷冷地踏过小路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_858f8a74:

    # "It only takes a few moments for you to accept the truth, that Lothar has abandoned his disciple, for better or worse."
    "没过多久，你便接受了这个事实：不论结果好坏，洛萨尔都抛下了他的弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_20f58935:

    # "There were so much hovered words unspoken, so much stories unexplained. The subtle pain aches you deeply. You wish you have the courage to call his name."
    "太多欲言又止的话语，太多未曾说清的故事。那隐约的痛楚深深刺痛着你。你希望自己有勇气喊出他的名字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_5a37548a:

    # "The lone wolf doggedly leaves Lusterfield, his figure soon swallowed by the woods, whatever his quest might be, you have hoped this is not the last time you will see Lothar."
    "卢斯特菲尔德"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_490150b0:

    # e "No... sorry. Lothar."
    e "不……抱歉。洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_028af18f:

    # l "You dare t-... I've given you the privilege to f-"
    l "你竟敢……我可是给了你开口的特权，让你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_3cc8531b:

    # "The grey wolf explodes with anger, he takes a step forwards, before being stopped by Amble."
    "灰狼怒火爆发，向前迈出一步，却被安布拦了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_fbda8a5f:

    # a "You've heard him, Lot."
    a "你听见他说的了，洛特。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_812835ee:

    # "The pair steps between you and Lothar. Any words that he'd wanted to say suddenly vanishes into thin air."
    "那两人挡在你和洛萨尔之间。他原本想说的话，突然全都烟消云散。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_1aabf3da:

    # e "We will talk later, when you've calm down."
    e "我们之后再谈，等你冷静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_f2996ad4:

    # l "I am fucking calm, I told you..."
    l "我他妈很冷静，我告诉过你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_91d87994:

    # "The wolf exchanges glances with the bear and hyena, and quickly looks away."
    "那匹狼与熊和鬣狗交换了一个眼神，随即迅速移开视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c2f36f0a:

    # l "Fucking morons."
    l "一群他妈的蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_ffbe9b94:

    # "He leaves with another word. Something muttered beneath his breath."
    "他又嘟囔了一句，便离开了。那声音低低地埋在他的喉咙底下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_96b73641:

    # "You stand there, feinting a smile to the two."
    "你站在那里，对着那两人强挤出一个笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_91dd28d1:

    # e "Thanks for standing up for me."
    e "谢谢你们替我出头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_41b291a7:

    # a "You are welcome, puny friend. And, if you will, a small request - can you look after Lot for us?"
    a "不客气，弱小的朋友。不过，如果你愿意的话，我还有个小小的请求——你能替我们照看洛特吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_032f9578:

    # "Amble implores, he stares at the vague figure."
    "安布恳求道，凝视着那个模糊的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_3702681c:

    # a "Look, after the vote, I don't think he trusts us very well anymore. But, I think he still listens to you."
    a "看，投票之后，我觉得他已经不太信任我们了。不过，我觉得他还是会听你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_9460e1fc:

    # e "No way, it was me who asked you to vote the other way."
    e "不可能，是我让你投另一边的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_786f3e87:

    # j "It's Lothar, no one ever questions his lack of logic, except for you, I guess."
    j "那可是洛萨尔啊，我想，除了你，没人会质疑他不讲逻辑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_6829787a:

    # "The hyena smiles nonchalantly."
    "鬣狗漫不经心地笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_e638e99d:

    # j "He will be fine, Amb, I am sure he'll come back begging you to go hunting with him like the other days."
    j "他会没事的，安布。我敢肯定，他会像前几天一样，回来求你和他一起去打猎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_c55fa757:

    # a "Yeah..."
    a "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_bfa44476:

    # "Amble's word lingers."
    "安布的话语久久回荡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_842fb7dd:

    # e "Okay, I guess I will check him out later... only if something went wrong and you two didn't make me look like a buffoon."
    e "好吧，我想之后我会去看看他……当然，得是出了什么问题，而且你们俩没让我丢脸才行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_17adf658:

    # "Amble nods, he pats your shoulder lightly."
    "安布点点头，轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Voting_After_Pact_End_de8cfdca:

    # "With that, you quickly trod away, putting together words to say to Lothar later."
    "说完，你快步离开，同时琢磨着之后该对洛萨尔说些什么。"
